{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"c6c66c32-5d39-4292-933b-4a51cba9b9f5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Let me extract Q3.1's details:\n\n**Q3.1**: 针对 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 四类模型负载，各自的编译 IR 表示是什么？\n\nKey aspects to cover:\n- MoE: expert dispatch/combine in IR, all-to-all communication, scatter/gather, FFN subgraph, how XLA HLO and MLIR express expert parallel regions\n- DiT: iterative denoising loop in IR, timestep-conditioned computation, StableHLO while op, cross-timestep dependencies\n- 多模态 (Multimodal): heterogeneous encoders in IR, multi-branch parallelism, MLIR func.func for vision/text encoders, cross-attention dataflow\n- Video: spatiotemporal computation in IR, frame-level parallelism, pmap/shard_map, temporal attention cross-frame dependencies in SSA\n\nThe focus is on: how IR expresses multi-operator concurrency, async execution, synchronization, hardware-topology-aware device placement.\n\n**Pre-keywords**: IR中间表示, Intermediate Representation, HLO, StableHLO, MLIR, Linalg dialect, Affine dialect, GPU dialect, TensorIR, Relay IR, Triton IR, LLVM IR, SSA图, SSA graph, 计算图IR, computation graph IR, all-to-all通信, all-to-all communication, expert dispatch, scatter/gather, async.execute, parallel region, device placement, while op, denoising loop, timestep conditioning, cross-modal dataflow, 跨模态数据流, 帧级并行, frame-level parallelism, pmap, shard_map, 并发标注, concurrency annotation, 同步点, synchronization point, 硬件拓扑感知, hardware topology awareness, 异步执行, async execution\n\n**侧重**: 硬件体系结构 — primary focus on dataflow/architecture, secondary on software stack/algorithm.\n\nFor L3, the answer needs to have: compilation flow simulation (IR transformation chain → pass pipeline → codegen output), each with annotation section.\n\nNow let me do semantic segmentation of the question and search the four directories.\n\n**Semantic segmentation**:\n\nSub-question 1: MoE IR representation — expert dispatch/combine, all-to-all, scatter/gather, expert parallel regions in HLO and MLIR\nKeywords: [\"MoE IR\", \"expert dispatch\", \"all-to-all\", \"XLA HLO\", \"MLIR\", \"async.execute\", \"parallel region\", \"expert parallelism\"]\n\nSub-question 2: DiT IR representation — iterative denoising loop, timestep conditioning, StableHLO while op\nKeywords: [\"DiT IR\", \"denoising loop\", \"StableHLO while\", \"timestep conditioning\", \"diffusion transformer\", \"iteration IR\"]\n\nSub-question 3: Multimodal IR representation — heterogeneous encoders, multi-branch parallelism, cross-modal dataflow\nKeywords: [\"multimodal IR\", \"heterogeneous encoder\", \"MLIR func.func\", \"cross-attention\", \"vision encoder\", \"text encoder\", \"cross-modal dataflow\"]\n\nSub-question 4: Video IR representation — spatiotemporal computation, frame-level parallelism, pmap, shard_map, temporal attention\nKeywords: [\"video IR\", \"frame-level parallelism\", \"pmap\", \"shard_map\", \"temporal attention\", \"spatiotemporal\"]\n\nLet me now run parallel searches across the four directories for each keyword group. I'll try to cover all main keyword sets.","signature":"c6c66c32-5d39-4292-933b-4a51cba9b9f5"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":22106,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c163d944-6c93-4e5e-8d60-5c144e0d6bb3","uuid":"6b028ca5-af5a-4fd7-b4d2-59cb3bb9131a"}
