{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_03_AESPoz9OJNbTH8o3XkiD5994","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Kernel Mixed-Precision (MKMP) Multiplier.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Kernel Mixed-Precision (MKMP) Multiplier\",\"score\":628.8142920583231,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multiplier在移动cpu上的执行流程（以llama-58m\",\"multiplier在移动cpu上的执行流程\",\"multiplier的int4部分基于gemmlowp/qnnpack的int8\",\"multiplier的int4部分基于gemmlowp\",\"multiplier解决了两个关键挑战：\",\"multiplier解决了两个关键挑战\",\"multiplier基于int8\",\"multiplier整合到同一个ge\",\"multiplier整合到同一个gemm\",\"multiplier与自定义int4\",\"multiplier是squat\",\"multiplier构建，通过将相邻行4-bit权重拼接存入16-bit寄存器，利用arm\",\"multiplier构建\",\"multiplier\",\"multi-kernel\",\"level优化\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Kernel\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multiplier\",\"offset\":39},{\"match\":\"Multi-Kernel\",\"offset\":95},{\"match\":\"Multiplier是Squat\",\"offset\":131},{\"match\":\"multiplier与自定义INT4\",\"offset\":227},{\"match\":\"multiplier整合到同一个GeMM\",\"offset\":246},{\"match\":\"multiplier\",\"offset\":328},{\"match\":\"multiplier基于INT8\",\"offset\":344},{\"match\":\"multiplier构建，通过将相邻行4-bit权重拼接存入16-bit寄存器，利用ARM\",\"offset\":361},{\"match\":\"multiplier解决了两个关键挑战：\",\"offset\":486},{\"match\":\"multiplier在移动CPU上的执行流程（以LLaMA-58M\",\"offset\":640},{\"match\":\"Multiplier\",\"offset\":1006},{\"match\":\"Multiplier\",\"offset\":1316},{\"match\":\"multiplier的INT4部分基于gemmlowp/QNNPACK的INT8\",\"offset\":2060},{\"match\":\"level优化\",\"offset\":2195}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Kernel Mixed-Precision (MKMP) Multiplier\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Kernel Mixed-Precision (MKMP) Multiplier是Squat (EdgeQAT)论文提出的SIMD-based混合精度矩阵乘法器，用于在移动设备上高效执行sub-8-bit混合精度MAC操作。核心设计：将现有的INT8 multiplier与自定义INT4 multiplier整合到同一个GeMM kernel中，由Token Control Logic Module…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md\",\"basename\":\"MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation)\",\"score\":577.9927053536971,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-level\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Level\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Multi-Level\",\"offset\":102}],\"excerpt\":\"## MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation) 是 LLVM 项目的编译器基础设施，旨在提供可扩展的、支持多层抽象的编译器框架。其核心概念是 dialect：每个 dialect 定义一组具有特定语义的 operations 和 types。一个 MLIR 程序可同时包含多个 dialect，编译器通过 progressive lowering（将高层 dialect 逐步转换…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate).md\",\"basename\":\"UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate)\",\"score\":449.88960236753053,\"foundWords\":[\"multiply-accumulate\",\"multiply\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":23},{\"match\":\"Multiply-Accumulate\",\"offset\":36},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":654},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1191},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1318}],\"excerpt\":\"## UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate)\\n术语是什么？\\nUWMMA 是 Uni-STC 论文提出的统一 warp 级矩阵乘累加指令序列接口，用于替代传统 GPU dense tensor core 的 MMA 指令。UWMMA 由三类指令组成——stc.load（同步收集 BBC 格式的 metadata 和数值）、stc.task（异步触发 TMS/DPG 硬件生成 task queue）、stc.numeric（检查 READY/BUSY 状态驱动 SDPU 执行）——将稀疏计算的控制流从\\\"gather data\\\"转为\\\"gather tasks\\\"模式。与传统…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Phase Tiling for Heterogeneous Tree Attention.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Phase Tiling for Heterogeneous Tree Attention\",\"score\":409.48546983917083,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-phase\",\"level\",\"level_i_nodes,\",\"level，occupancy\",\"level，但\",\"levels\",\"level），未来可扩展为更细粒度的\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Phase\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Phase\",\"offset\":101},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":425},{\"match\":\"Multi-phase\",\"offset\":472},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":557},{\"match\":\"Multi-phase\",\"offset\":673},{\"match\":\"levels\",\"offset\":743},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":778},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":862},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1235},{\"match\":\"level_i_nodes,\",\"offset\":1359},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1421},{\"match\":\"level，但\",\"offset\":1764},{\"match\":\"level，occupancy\",\"offset\":1937},{\"match\":\"multi-phase\",\"offset\":2081},{\"match\":\"multi-phase\",\"offset\":2149},{\"match\":\"level），未来可扩展为更细粒度的\",\"offset\":2335}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Phase Tiling for Heterogeneous Tree Attention\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Phase Tiling 是 FastTree 中根据 radix tree 不同层级节点特征自适应选择 attention kernel tile size 的优化技术。核心观察：靠近 root 的节点聚合大量 queries（因许多请求共享相同 system prompt 等长前缀），适合大 tile size 以最大化 shared memory 内的 KV 复用和 tensor c…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler).md\",\"basename\":\"Triton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler)\",\"score\":383.8333830394771,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-pass\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Pass\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Multi-Pass\",\"offset\":56},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1329},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1566},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1782}],\"excerpt\":\"## Triton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler)\\n术语是什么？\\nTriton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler)是Meta开发的编译器中心的统一GPU profiling框架，解决现代AI accelerator profiling的核心挑战：性能信号分散在多个abstraction layers（Triton DSL → MLIR IR → PTX/SASS → runtime APIs → hardware counters）之间，每个tool有incompatible interfaces和vendor-specific assumptions，profiling结果面向hum…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation\",\"score\":379.2233345640922,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-version\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Version\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Version\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"Multi-version\",\"offset\":487},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1107},{\"match\":\"multi-version\",\"offset\":1295},{\"match\":\"multi-version\",\"offset\":1439},{\"match\":\"multi-version\",\"offset\":1653}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Version Micro Kernel Generation是Infera compiler为每个micro operator生成多种kernel candidates的策略：通过配置不同的register使用上限（64/96/128）、shared memory上限（48/80/112/144 KiB）、pipeline stage数（2/3/4）、以及spatial/reduction axis tile size组合，为同一micro operator生…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/MPS (NVIDIA Multi-Process Service).md\",\"basename\":\"MPS (NVIDIA Multi-Process Service)\",\"score\":376.44725319700024,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multiplexing\",\"multi-process\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Process\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Multi-Process\",\"offset\":89},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1549},{\"match\":\"Multiplexing\",\"offset\":2773}],\"excerpt\":\"## MPS (NVIDIA Multi-Process Service)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMPS (Multi-Process Service) 是 NVIDIA 提供的 CUDA 软件组件，允许来自不同 OS 进程（不同 CUDA context）的 GPU kernel 在同一 GPU 上同时执行。通过启动 MPS control daemon 和 MPS server，多个 client 进程将 kernel dispatch 请求发送给 MPS server，由 server 统一调度到 GPU。与 Priority Streams（仅限…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling.md\",\"basename\":\"Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling\",\"score\":375.9782802169187,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multimodal\",\"multi-path\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Path\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"Multi-Path\",\"offset\":101},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":268},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1443}],\"excerpt\":\"## Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nModality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling 是 EPD-Serve 的请求级调度策略，根据请求是否包含非文本模态（图像/音频/视频）将其路由到不同的执行管道。多模态请求走完整的 Encode-Prefill-Decode 管道，纯文本请求直接走 Prefill-Decode 管道（绕过 Encode 阶段）。配合 instance-level 的 least-loaded-first 动态负载均衡，实现异构流量分离和资源隔离。…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-View Expert Learning (Shared_Domain_Task Expert Modules).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-View Expert Learning (Shared_Domain_Task Expert Modules)\",\"score\":367.8674455653912,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-view\",\"multi-domain\",\"multi-task\",\"level\",\"level-2:\",\"level-2\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-View\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-View\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"级融合 (Lev\",\"offset\":843},{\"match\":\"- M3oE: Mult\",\"offset\":1284},{\"match\":\"-Domain Mu\",\"offset\":1297}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-View Expert Learning (Shared/Domain/Task Expert Modules)\\n术语是什么？\\nMulti-View Expert Learning（多视角专家学习）是 M3oE 框架的核心设计，通过三种类型的专家模块从输入中提取不同视角的信息：(1) Shared Expert Module（共享专家模块）——N 个专家网络处理所有域的输入，通过 D×T 个独立 gate 为每对域-任务生成加权组合，捕获跨域跨任务的共性模式（如通用用户兴趣）；(2) Domain Expert Module（域专家模块）——D 个域专属专家，每个专家关联一个特定…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型).md\",\"basename\":\"Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型)\",\"score\":353.0505864407761,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet/wafer-scale\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"multi-die\",\"multi-gpu-like\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Die\",\"offset\":41},{\"match\":\"multi-chiplet/wafer-scale\",\"offset\":157},{\"match\":\"multi-die\",\"offset\":230},{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU-like\",\"offset\":298},{\"match\":\"multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":447},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":518},{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU-like\",\"offset\":1819},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1863}],\"excerpt\":\"## Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSingle-GPU-like Programming Model 是将整个 multi-chiplet/wafer-scale GPU（含多个 compute die）暴露为统一单 GPU 的编程模型，完全从软件层面抽象 multi-die topology 和 data placement，使编程体验与 monolithic GPU 相同。与之对应的是 Multi-GPU-like Programming Model（如 WSC-LLM、…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Reward RL Post-Training for Video Agents.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Reward RL Post-Training for Video Agents\",\"score\":344.577930683888,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-reward\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Reward\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Reward\",\"offset\":95},{\"match\":\"multi-rewar\",\"offset\":2080},{\"match\":\"-leve\",\"offset\":2112}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Reward RL Post-Training for Video Agents\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Reward RL Post-Training 是 SAGE 为训练 any-horizon video agent 提出的 GRPO 多奖励设计方案。单一 accuracy reward（如 Video-R1 的 ROUGE/option-matching）对 open-ended 问题无效，而 naive 实现常导致工具调用过度或崩溃。SAGE 的解决方案：R_i = Σ step_rewards…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture _ 多芯粒GPU架构.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture _ 多芯粒GPU架构\",\"score\":341.5765183629643,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"level\",\"level使得同步操作（acquire/release）需要invalidate/flush更深cache层次；跨chiplet\",\"level使得同步操作\",\"level（memory-side\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":180},{\"match\":\"Multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":579},{\"match\":\"level使得同步操作（acquire/release）需要invalidate/flush更深cache层次；跨chiplet\",\"offset\":1058},{\"match\":\"level（memory-side\",\"offset\":1192},{\"match\":\"Multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":1830},{\"match\":\"multi\",\"offset\":2297},{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":2465}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture / 多芯粒GPU架构\\n术语是什么？\\nMulti-Chiplet GPU（也称MCM-GPU）是一种将多个较小的GPU chiplet通过高密度封装（如interposer、硅桥）集成为单个逻辑GPU的架构。与传统的monolithic GPU（单个大die制造）不同，multi-chiplet GPU将计算资源（SM、cache、memory controller等）分布到多个物理die上，各chiplet之间通过inter-chiplet interconnect（如interposer上的NoC或cros…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Head Mixing.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Head Mixing\",\"score\":341.5326150709566,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-head\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":52},{\"match\":\"multi-head\",\"offset\":305},{\"match\":\"multi-head\",\"offset\":351},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":395},{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":687},{\"match\":\"en-le\",\"offset\":915},{\"match\":\"Toke\",\"offset\":1578},{\"match\":\"-Level Mul\",\"offset\":1584}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Head Mixing\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nMulti-Head Mixing 是 MHLA 的核心机制，通过一个可学习的系数矩阵 Mc ∈ R^(M×M) 实现 query-conditioned 的 block 级 KV summary 混合。矩阵元素 m_{i,j} 表示 query block i 对 key-value block j 的 affinity（亲和度），第 i 行 m_i 指定 query block i 如何将 M 个局部 summary 线性组合成该 block 专属的全局 summary。\\n与 standar…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU).md\",\"basename\":\"Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU)\",\"score\":323.7092274309987,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-gpu\",\"multi-stream\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU\",\"offset\":36},{\"match\":\"multi-GPU\",\"offset\":137},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1836},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1849},{\"match\":\"multi-stream\",\"offset\":1861}],\"excerpt\":\"## Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU)\\n术语是什么？\\nResource-Aware Task Dispatching 是 HuntKTm 的 task scheduler 中的运行时调度算法，将 task 动态分配到 multi-GPU 系统中的合适设备。与简单的 round-robin 或 first-fit 分配不同，它同时考虑三个维度的 GPU 资源：memory（free memory 是否满足 task 需求）、compute（从 threads/registers/shared memory 三个子维度评估 SM 可用量）、和 hardware queue（可用的 concurrent strea…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Head Linear Attention (MHLA).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Head Linear Attention (MHLA)\",\"score\":320.46527152898886,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-head\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":69},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":225},{\"match\":\"# Step\",\"offset\":1689},{\"match\":\"on vi\",\"offset\":2634},{\"match\":\"Token-Lev\",\"offset\":2640}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Head Linear Attention (MHLA)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nMulti-Head Linear Attention (MHLA) 是一种新型线性注意力机制，由 Zhang et al. (ICLR 2026) 提出。核心创新在于：沿 token 维度（而非 channel/head 维度）将序列划分为 M 个 non-overlapping blocks（\\\"token-level heads\\\"），为每个 block 独立计算局部 KV summary，再通过可学习的系数矩阵 Mc 使每个 query block 生成专属的…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Progressive Training Strategy for Multi-modal LLMs _ 多模态LLM渐进式训练.md\",\"basename\":\"Progressive Training Strategy for Multi-modal LLMs _ 多模态LLM渐进式训练\",\"score\":312.6263851951367,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-image。qwen2-vl\",\"multi-image\",\"multi-modal\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-modal\",\"offset\":37},{\"match\":\"Multi-image\",\"offset\":391},{\"match\":\"multi-image\",\"offset\":552},{\"match\":\"Multi-image\",\"offset\":1008},{\"match\":\"multi-image。Qwen2-VL\",\"offset\":1556},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":2035},{\"match\":\"Multi-modal\",\"offset\":2137}],\"excerpt\":\"## Progressive Training Strategy for Multi-modal LLMs / 多模态LLM渐进式训练\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nProgressive Training Strategy 是一种多阶段递进训练方法，逐步将预训练语言模型转化为多模态长上下文模型。LongLLaVA 的三阶段：Stage I (Single-image Alignment) — 仅训练 projector，冻结 vision encoder 和 LLM，~600K captions 对齐视觉-文本空间；Stage II (Single-image Instruction Tuning) —…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/gem5_Garnet Multi-Chiplet NoC Simulation Framework.md\",\"basename\":\"gem5_Garnet Multi-Chiplet NoC Simulation Framework\",\"score\":307.4330799350794,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet，还需配置\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":738},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1259},{\"match\":\"multi-chiplet，还需配置\",\"offset\":1941}],\"excerpt\":\"## gem5/Garnet Multi-Chiplet NoC Simulation Framework\\n术语是什么？\\ngem5 是一个开源的全系统计算机架构模拟器（https://github.com/gem5/gem5），支持多种 CPU 模型（out-of-order、in-order）、cache 层次结构、coherence 协议和 memory 系统。Garnet 是 gem5 中 Ruby memory system 的详细 NoC 模型，提供 cycle-accurate 的 router、link、VC 和 flow control 模拟。HeteroGarnet 是 Garnet 的扩展，支