PTX/SASS → runtime APIs → hardware counters）之间，每个tool有incompatible interfaces和vendor-specific assumptions，profiling结果面向hum…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation\",\"score\":379.2233345640922,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-version\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Version\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Version\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"Multi-version\",\"offset\":487},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1107},{\"match\":\"multi-version\",\"offset\":1295},{\"match\":\"multi-version\",\"offset\":1439},{\"match\":\"multi-version\",\"offset\":1653}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Version Micro Kernel Generation是Infera compiler为每个micro operator生成多种kernel candidates的策略：通过配置不同的register使用上限（64/96/128）、shared memory上限（48/80/112/144 KiB）、pipeline stage数（2/3/4）、以及spatial/reduction axis tile size组合，为同一micro operator生…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/MPS (NVIDIA Multi-Process Service).md\",\"basename\":\"MPS (NVIDIA Multi-Process Service)\",\"score\":376.44725319700024,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multiplexing\",\"multi-process\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Process\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Multi-Process\",\"offset\":89},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1549},{\"match\":\"Multiplexing\",\"offset\":2773}],\"excerpt\":\"## MPS (NVIDIA Multi-Process Service)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMPS (Multi-Process Service) 是 NVIDIA 提供的 CUDA 软件组件，允许来自不同 OS 进程（不同 CUDA context）的 GPU kernel 在同一 GPU 上同时执行。通过启动 MPS control daemon 和 MPS server，多个 client 进程将 kernel dispatch 请求发送给 MPS server，由 server 统一调度到 GPU。与 Priority Streams（仅限…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling.md\",\"basename\":\"Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling\",\"score\":375.9782802169187,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multimodal\",\"multi-path\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Path\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"Multi-Path\",\"offset\":101},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":268},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1443}],\"excerpt\":\"## Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nModality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling 是 EPD-Serve 的请求级调度策略，根据请求是否包含非文本模态（图像/音频/视频）将其路由到不同的执行管道。多模态请求走完整的 Encode-Prefill-Decode 管道，纯文本请求直接走 Prefill-Decode 管道（绕过 Encode 阶段）。配合 instance-level 的 least-loaded-first 动态负载均衡，实现异构流量分离和资源隔离。…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-View Expert Learning (Shared_Domain_Task Expert Modules).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-View Expert Learning (Shared_Domain_Task Expert Modules)\",\"score\":367.8674455653912,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-view\",\"multi-domain\",\"multi-task\",\"level\",\"level-2:\",\"level-2\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-View\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-View\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"级融合 (Lev\",\"offset\":843},{\"match\":\"- M3oE: Mult\",\"offset\":1284},{\"match\":\"-Domain Mu\",\"offset\":1297}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-View Expert Learning (Shared/Domain/Task Expert Modules)\\n术语是什么？\\nMulti-View Expert Learning（多视角专家学习）是 M3oE 框架的核心设计，通过三种类型的专家模块从输入中提取不同视角的信息：(1) Shared Expert Module（共享专家模块）——N 个专家网络处理所有域的输入，通过 D×T 个独立 gate 为每对域-任务生成加权组合，捕获跨域跨任务的共性模式（如通用用户兴趣）；(2) Domain Expert Module（域专家模块）——D 个域专属专家，每个专家关联一个特定…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型).md\",\"basename\":\"Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型)\",\"score\":353.0505864407761,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet/wafer-scale\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"multi-die\",\"multi-gpu-like\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Die\",\"offset\":41},{\"match\":\"multi-chiplet/wafer-scale\",\"offset\":157},{\"match\":\"multi-die\",\"offset\":230},{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU-like\",\"offset\":298},{\"match\":\"multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":447},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":518},{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU-like\",\"offset\":1819},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1863}],\"excerpt\":\"## Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSingle-GPU-like Programming Model 是将整个 multi-chiplet/wafer-scale GPU（含多个 compute die）暴露为统一单 GPU 的编程模型，完全从软件层面抽象 multi-die topology 和 data placement，使编程体验与 monolithic GPU 相同。与之对应的是 Multi-GPU-like Programming Model（如 WSC-LLM、…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Reward RL Post-Training for Video Agents.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Reward RL Post-Training for Video Agents\",\"score\":344.577930683888,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-reward\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Reward\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Reward\",\"offset\":95},{\"match\":\"multi-rewar\",\"offset\":2080},{\"match\":\"-leve\",\"offset\":2112}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Reward RL Post-Training for Video Agents\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Reward RL Post-Training 是 SAGE 为训练 any-horizon video agent 提出的 GRPO 多奖励设计方案。单一 accuracy reward（如 Video-R1 的 ROUGE/option-matching）对 open-ended 问题无效，而 naive 实现常导致工具调用过度或崩溃。SAGE 的解决方案：R_i = Σ step_rewards…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture _ 多芯粒GPU架构.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture _ 多芯粒GPU架构\",\"score\":341.5765183629643,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"level\",\"level使得同步操作（acquire/release）需要invalidate/flush更深cache层次；跨chiplet\",\"level使得同步操作\",\"level（memory-side\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":180},{\"match\":\"Multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":579},{\"match\":\"level使得同步操作（acquire/release）需要invalidate/flush更深cache层次；跨chiplet\",\"offset\":1058},{\"match\":\"level（memory-side\",\"offset\":1192},{\"match\":\"Multi-chiplet\",\"offset\":1830},{\"match\":\"multi\",\"offset\":2297},{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":2465}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture / 多芯粒GPU架构\\n术语是什么？\\nMulti-Chiplet GPU（也称MCM-GPU）是一种将多个较小的GPU chiplet通过高密度封装（如interposer、硅桥）集成为单个逻辑GPU的架构。与传统的monolithic GPU（单个大die制造）不同，multi-chiplet GPU将计算资源（SM、cache、memory controller等）分布到多个物理die上，各chiplet之间通过inter-chiplet interconnect（如interposer上的NoC或cros…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Head Mixing.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Head Mixing\",\"score\":341.5326150709566,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-head\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":52},{\"match\":\"multi-head\",\"offset\":305},{\"match\":\"multi-head\",\"offset\":351},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":395},{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":687},{\"match\":\"en-le\",\"offset\":915},{\"match\":\"Toke\",\"offset\":1578},{\"match\":\"-Level Mul\",\"offset\":1584}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Head Mixing\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nMulti-Head Mixing 是 MHLA 的核心机制，通过一个可学习的系数矩阵 Mc ∈ R^(M×M) 实现 query-conditioned 的 block 级 KV summary 混合。矩阵元素 m_{i,j} 表示 query block i 对 key-value block j 的 affinity（亲和度），第 i 行 m_i 指定 query block i 如何将 M 个局部 summary 线性组合成该 block 专属的全局 summary。\\n与 standar…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU).md\",\"basename\":\"Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU)\",\"score\":323.7092274309987,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-gpu\",\"multi-stream\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU\",\"offset\":36},{\"match\":\"multi-GPU\",\"offset\":137},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1836},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1849},{\"match\":\"multi-stream\",\"offset\":1861}],\"excerpt\":\"## Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU)\\n术语是什么？\\nResource-Aware Task Dispatching 是 HuntKTm 的 task scheduler 中的运行时调度算法，将 task 动态分配到 multi-GPU 系统中的合适设备。与简单的 round-robin 或 first-fit 分配不同，它同时考虑三个维度的 GPU 资源：memory（free memory 是否满足 task 需求）、compute（从 threads/registers/shared memory 三个子维度评估 SM 可用量）、和 hardware queue（可用