Level Preemption\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nFine-Grained Block-Level Preemption 是本文提出的概念性 GPU 调度机制，定义为：thread block scheduler 在任意时刻中断**任意一个或一组 thread block** 的执行，保存其 context（register file、shared memory、warp program counter/state），并在之后恢复执行的能力。与 NVIDIA 现有机制的关键区别：(i) Priority Streams…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Two-Level Quantization for Attention Map.md","basename":"Two-Level Quantization for Attention Map","score":229.20455278154665,"foundWords":["multiplication，几乎无额外开销。使用场景：所有需要对","multiplication","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":7},{"match":"Level","offset":94},{"match":"Level","offset":324},{"match":"Level","offset":376},{"match":"Level","offset":431},{"match":"Level","offset":598},{"match":"// L","offset":765},{"match":"P̃ 后","offset":1336},{"match":"1×16","offset":1464},{"match":"scalar-vector multiplication，几乎无额","offset":1600}],"excerpt":"## Two-Level Quantization for Attention Map\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nTwo-Level Quantization 是 SageAttention3 提出的针对 attention map P（softmax 输出，值域 [0, 1]）的专用量化策略。由于 P 的值域极窄（[0, 1]），直接做 FP4 microscaling quantization 时，scale factor 的范围仅为 [0, 0.167]，导致 scale factor 在 E4M3 FP8 格式下仅能使用 280 个（…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Layer-Level Decode Batching（层级解码批处理）.md","basename":"Layer-Level Decode Batching（层级解码批处理）","score":229.18272472176,"foundWords":["multi","multi-slo","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":9},{"match":"Level","offset":69},{"match":"level","offset":501},{"match":"level","offset":2031},{"match":"Level","offset":2171},{"match":"Multi-SLO","offset":2202}],"excerpt":"## Layer-Level Decode Batching（层级解码批处理）\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nLayer-Level Decode Batching是Laser decode阶段的差异化批处理机制，通过控制每个请求每iteration执行多少transformer layer来差异化处理不同SLO的decode请求。核心参数为每个请求的execution plan (L, O)：L表示每iteration执行的层数，O表示调度offset（延迟多少iteration后重新执行）。strict请求（如50ms TBT）每iteration执行全部N层保证低延迟，relaxed请求（…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Group-Level Load Balancing Loss.md","basename":"Group-Level Load Balancing Loss","score":227.11383183288535,"foundWords":["multimodal","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":9},{"match":"Level","offset":47},{"match":"Level","offset":679},{"match":"level","offset":895},{"match":"multimodal","offset":1169},{"match":"level","offset":1194},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":1377}],"excerpt":"## Group-Level Load Balancing Loss\n术语解释\nGroup-Level Load Balancing Loss 是 ARIA 对标准 per-expert load balancing loss 的松弛变体：将 fine-grained MoE 的大量 expert 按固定大小分组，在组级别而非单个 expert 级别施加负载均衡约束，避免过强的负载均衡压制 expert specialization。\n术语是什么？\n标准 MoE load balancing loss 惩罚每个 expert 的负载不均：$L_{aux} = \\alpha \\cdot N \\cdot \\su…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Token-level Expert Gating _ Context Switching.md","basename":"Token-level Expert Gating _ Context Switching","score":215.13898148875657,"foundWords":["multilingual","level"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":9},{"match":"level","offset":61},{"match":"level","offset":299},{"match":"Multilingual","offset":591},{"match":"Multilingual","offset":709},{"match":"level","offset":834}],"excerpt":"## Token-level Expert Gating / Context Switching\n术语解释\nToken-level Expert Gating 是 BTS 中 Stitch Layer 门控机制实现的推理行为：每个 token 处理时，softmax/sigmoid gate 根据当前 Hub hidden state 重新计算各 Expert 的贡献权重，使得模型能在同一序列内动态切换不同 Expert 的主导地位。这与 Expert Routing baseline（整个 prompt 选一个模型处理全部 token）形成对比。\n术语是什么？\nBTS 的 token-level gati…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Task-level Routing _ Task-MoE (任务级路由).md","basename":"Task-level Routing _ Task-MoE (任务级路由)","score":214.27110109305102,"foundWords":["multi","multilingual","multi-task","level"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":8},{"match":"level","offset":52},{"match":"multilingual","offset":101},{"match":"level","offset":273},{"match":"level","offset":548},{"match":"level","offset":583},{"match":"level","offset":646},{"match":"level","offset":730},{"match":"level","offset":795},{"match":"level","offset":1254},{"match":"level","offset":1329},{"match":"multi-task","offset":1613},{"match":"multilingual","offset":1629},{"match":"level","offset":1755},{"match":"level","offset":2003}],"excerpt":"## Task-level Routing / Task-MoE (任务级路由)\n术语解释\nTask-level Routing 是 MoE 路由的一种粒度策略，根据 task identity（如 multilingual NMT 中的语言对或目标语言）而非输入 token 内容来决定 expert 选择，使同一 task 的所有 token 路由到相同的 expert 子集。由 Kudugunta et al. (EMNLP Findings 2021) 在\"Beyond Distillation\"中提出。\n术语是什么？\nTask-level routing 将 MoE 的 gating functi…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Bi-Level Optimization for AutoML in Recommendation Models.md","basename":"Bi-Level Optimization for AutoML in Recommendation Models","score":211.15388236888577,"foundWords":["multi","multi-domain","multi-task","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":6},{"match":"Level","offset":72},{"match":"level","offset":152},{"match":"level","offset":217},{"match":"Level","offset":484},{"match":"Level","offset":1068},{"match":"Multi-Domain","offset":1320},{"match":"Multi-Task","offset":1333}],"excerpt":"## Bi-Level Optimization for AutoML in Recommendation Models\n术语是什么？\nBi-Level Optimization（双层优化）是一种优化框架，将模型参数和超参数/架构参数分为两个层级交替优化。在 M3oE 的语境中：外层优化（upper-level）在给定融合权重 α, β 的情况下更新模型参数 W = argmin_W L(W, α, β)；内层优化（lower-level）在模型参数更新后，基于一个 mini-batch 的数据优化融合权重 α, β = argmin_{α,β} L(W* , α, β)。这一方法源自 DARTS（Di…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multilevel Concentration.md","basename":"Multilevel Concentration","score":208.83207212127445,"foundWords":["multilevel","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Multilevel","offset":3},{"match":"Multilevel","offset":51},{"match":"Level","offset":137},{"match":"Level","offset":222},{"match":"Level","offset":331},{"match":"Multilevel","offset":597},{"match":"Level","offset":649},{"match":"Level","offset":1108},{"match":"level","offset":1127},{"match":"level","offset":1142},{"match":"Multilevel","offset":1758}],"excerpt":"## Multilevel Concentration\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nMultilevel Concentration是Focus论文提出的硬件导向的冗余消除范式，在三个粒度层次上层次化地压缩VLM的视觉-语言输入：(1) Semantic Level (token级)：基于cross-modal attention的语义引导token pruning，保留文本prompt相关的视觉区域；(2) Block Level (spatiotemporal block级)：在2×2×2时空窗口内做localized similarity comparison，限制匹配范围以…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Iteration-Level Scheduling _ Selective Batching（迭代级调度）.md","basename":"Iteration-Level Scheduling _ Selective Batching（迭代级调度）","score":207.64439219524044,"foundWords":["multimodal","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":13},{"match":"Level","offset":114},{"match":"level","offset":194},{"match":"level","offset":308},{"match":"Level","offset":541},{"match":"level","offset":1490},{"match":"level","offset":1600},{"match":"level","offset":1915},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":1992}],"excerpt":"## Iteration-Level Scheduling / Selective Batching（迭代级调度）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nIteration-Level Scheduling 是 LLM serving 系统中的细粒度请求调度策略，由 Orca 系统首次提出。传统 serving 的 request-level batching 将不同请求 padding 到相同长度后批处理——padding token 浪费计算、已完成生成但未结束的请求需等待同批次慢请求（head-of-line blocking）。Iteration-level…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Attention Processing with Head-Level Parallelism on NMP (NMP上的头级并行注意力处理).md","basename":"Attention Processing with Head-Level Parallelism on NMP (NMP上的头级并行注意力处理)","score":207.58106623663372,"foundWords":["multi","multi-head","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":34},{"match":"Level","offset":152},{"match":"multi-head","offset":196},{"match":"Multi-head","offset":2910}],"excerpt":"## Attention Processing with Head-Level Parallelism on NMP (NMP上的头级并行注意力处理)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nAttention Processing with Head-Level Parallelism 是 Stratum 将 Transformer 的 multi-head attention 计算映射到 NMP processor 上的调度策略。由于 attention heads 之间无数据依赖，可以高度并行执行。Stratum 将 16 个 PUs 划分为多个 PU groups（通过 ring topology 上的…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Sparse Router _ Token-Level Gating (稀疏路由 _ Token级门控).md","basename":"Sparse Router _ Token-Level Gating (稀疏路由 _ Token级门控)","score":206.62309150802912,"foundWords":["multimodal","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Level","offset":25},{"match":"-leve","offset":426},{"match":"Multimoda","offset":1806}],"excerpt":"## Sparse Router / Token-Level Gating (稀疏路由 / Token级门控)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nSparse Router（稀疏路由器）是 MoE 架构中决定每个 token 分配给哪些专家的组件。它是一个可学习的线性函数 f(x) = W · x（W ∈ ℝ^{d×M}，d 为 hidden state 维度，M 为专家数），输出每个专家对当前 token 的分配概率（通过 softmax 归一化），然后通过 top-k 选择激活概率最高的 k 个专家。在 Uni-MoE 中，每个 MoE 层有独立的 Router，对每个 token…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multilingual Neural Machine Translation (MNMT).md","basename":"Multilingual Neural Machine Translation (MNMT)","score":195.57581539660725,"foundWords":["multi","multilingual","multi-task","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Multilingual","offset":3},{"match":"multi-task","offset":89},{"match":"Multilingual","offset":250},{"match":"level","offset":713},{"match":"level","offset":1054}],"excerpt":"## Multilingual Neural Machine Translation (MNMT)\n术语解释\nMNMT 是用单一神经网络模型同时翻译多个语言对的范式，本质上是 multi-task learning 问题。参数共享的程度决定正迁移（positive transfer）的程度，过度共享则导致任务干扰（task interference）因容量瓶颈。\n术语是什么？\n在 MNMT 中，参数可以在不同语言对之间完全共享（如 Johnson et al., 2017 的 Google Multilingual NMT），也可以部分共享、部分专用。MoE 模型天然适合 MNMT：不同 exp…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Spatial Multiplexing _ Temporal Multiplexing (GPU Concurrency Strategies).md","basename":"Spatial Multiplexing _ Temporal Multiplexing (GPU Concurrency Strategies)","score":181.15570821187939,"foundWords":["multiplexing**：通过时间分片将","multiplexing**：将","multiplexing）可能优于两者单独使用，这在","multiplexing","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Multiplexing","offset":11},{"match":"Multiplexing","offset":35},{"match":"Multiplexing","offset":131},{"match":"Multiplexing","offset":155},{"match":"Multiplexing**：将","offset":202},{"match":"Multiplexing**：通过时间分片将","offset":468},{"match":"Multiplexing","offset":699},{"match":"Multiplexing","offset":950},{"match":"multiplexing）可能优于两者单独使用，这在","offset":1256},{"match":"level","offset":1981}],"excerpt":"## Spatial Multiplexing / Temporal Multiplexing (GPU Concurrency Strategies)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nSpatial Multiplexing 和 Temporal Multiplexing 是 GPU 并发执行多应用的两种基本策略：\n- **Spatial Multiplexing**：将 GPU 的 SM（空间资源）划分给不同应用，多应用 **同时在** 不同 SM（或同一 SM 的不同 resource partition）上并行执行。代表机制：Priority St…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Any-to-Any Multimodal Models.md","basename":"Any-to-Any Multimodal Models","score":128.40306428182947,"foundWords":["multi","multimodal-input","multimodal","multi-stage","multi-ar","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Multimodal","offset":14},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":52},{"match":"multimodal-input","offset":138},{"match":"multimodal","offset":344},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":815},{"match":"multimodal","offset":1022},{"match":"Multi-AR","offset":1545},{"match":"multi-stage","offset":1816},{"match":"level","offset":1906},{"match":"multi-stage","offset":2012},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":2190}],"excerpt":"## Any-to-Any Multimodal Models\n术语是什么？\nAny-to-Any Multimodal Models 是能够接受和生成多种模态（text、image、video、audio）的统一模型架构。与传统的 text-to-text LLM 或 multimodal-input text-output 模型不同，any-to-any 模型支持交叉模态的端到端训练和理解-生成的统一。代表性模型包括：Qwen-Omni 系列（text+image+video+audio 输入，text+audio 输出）、GLM-Image（text+image 输入，text+image 输出）、BAGEL（…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CSR Sparse Matrix Multiplication for LLM Inference（面向 LLM 推理的 CSR 稀疏矩阵乘法 CUDA Kernel）.md","basename":"CSR Sparse Matrix Multiplication for LLM Inference（面向 LLM 推理的 CSR 稀疏矩阵乘法 CUDA Kernel）","score":100.7350354502508,"foundWords":["multiplication","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Multiplication","offset":21},{"match":"level","offset":1318},{"match":"level","offset":1364},{"match":"level","offset":1425}],"excerpt":"## CSR Sparse Matrix Multiplication for LLM Inference（面向 LLM 推理的 CSR 稀疏矩阵乘法 CUDA Kernel）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCSR (Compressed Sparse Row) 稀疏矩阵乘法用于 LLM 推理中的 hybrid sparse-dense weight format——当约1%的权重以非结构化稀疏格式保留为高精度（FP16），其余权重以低位量化存储时，需要专门的 GPU kernel 高效执行 sparse + dense 两部分矩阵乘法的叠加。SpQR 论文为 outlier…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/TTFT _ TPOT SLO Constraints in Multimodal Serving.md","basename":"TTFT _ TPOT SLO Constraints in Multimodal Serving","score":88.4902205239796,"foundWords":["multimodal","level"],"matches":[{"match":"Multimodal","offset":34},{"match":"Level","offset":194},{"match":"level","offset":1537},{"match":"Multimodal","offset":1686}],"excerpt":"## TTFT / TPOT SLO Constraints in Multimodal Serving\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nTTFT (Time-To-First-Token) 和 TPOT (Time-Per-Output-Token) 是多模态推理 Serving 系统的两个核心延迟 SLO（Service Level Objective）指标。TTFT 衡量从请求到达系统到生成第一个 token 的时间（包含 Encode + Prefill 延迟），TPOT 衡量后续每个 token 的平均生成时间（Decode 阶段的延迟）。在多模态场景下，TTFT 受视觉编码器和跨阶段数据传…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Spatio-Temporal Video Super-Resolution (STVSR _ 时空视频超分辨率).md","basename":"Spatio-Temporal Video Super-Resolution (STVSR _ 时空视频超分辨率)","score":59.0341237955326,"foundWords":["multi","multi-frame","level","level3","level2","level1"],"matches":[{"match":"level1","offset":751},{"match":"level2","offset":761},{"match":"level3","offset":771},{"match":"level1","offset":836},{"match":"level2","offset":846},{"match":"level3","offset":856},{"match":"level","offset":1055},{"match":"level","offset":1112},{"match":"Multi-Frame","offset":1575}],"excerpt":"F_level1, F_level2, F_level3 = PyramidEncoder(LR_frames)\n# 构建多级特征字典\nDict = StackDict(F_level1, F_level2, F_level3)\n# Step 2: 字典查询解码\nfor each output frame t:\n    # 从特征字典中查询对应时空位置信息\n    Q_t = LearnableQuery(t)              # 可学习的位置编码查询\n    F_t = CrossAttn(Q_t, Dict)           # 跨注意力查询字典\n    # 多层解码…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GPU Acquire_Release Synchronization and Cache Coherence Actions _ GPU获取_释放同步与缓存一致性动作.md","basename":"GPU Acquire_Release Synchronization and Cache Coherence Actions _ GPU获取_释放同步与缓存一致性动作","score":53.87597560790748,"foundWords":["multi","multicast","multi-chiplet差异化——额外cache","multi-chiplet差异化","multi-chiplet","level","level迫使同步机制考虑多级cache"],"matches":[{"match":"multicast","offset":2561},{"match":"level","offset":2711},{"match":"Multi-chiplet差异化——额外cache","offset":3203},{"match":"level迫使同步机制考虑多级cache","offset":3229},{"match":"Multi-Chiplet","offset":3527}],"excerpt":"- **LRM-GPU atomic**: AMU in-network merge → combined request sent → multicast response\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\nGPU acquire/release同步的实现要素：(1) Memory fence指令——CUDA中`__threadfence()`（global fence）、`__threadfence_block()`（block-level fence），PTX中对应`membar.cta`（CTA scope）和`membar.gl`（GPU scope）指令。这些指令在硬件层面触发cache coherence actions。(2) Hardware coherence actions——传统GPU通常采用softwa…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Wavelet Coefficient Matching Loss for Diffusion Training（扩散训练的小波系数匹配损失）.md","basename":"Wavelet Coefficient Matching Loss for Diffusion Training（扩散训练的小波系数匹配损失）","score":48.45561406778503,"foundWords":["multi","multi-resolution","multi-scale","level","level=j","level训练正则化方法"],"matches":[{"match":"level训练正则化方法","offset":160},{"match":", level","offset":830},{"match":"aar', l","offset":1086},{"match":"'haar',","offset":1206},{"match":"，提供smoother","offset":1728},{"match":"e (improved mult","offset":2191}],"excerpt":"Wavelet Coefficient Matching Loss (LW) 是一种基于离散小波变换(DWT)的loss-level训练正则化方法，在predicted clean sample x̂₀和ground-truth x₀的所有尺度(scales)和方向(orientations)上计算小波系数的L1差异：LW = E[Σ_{s,ℓ} γ_{s,l}·||W₀^{(s,ℓ)} − Ŵ₀^{(s,ℓ)}||₁]，其中s索引尺度，ℓ索引方向/子带(LL/LH/HL/HH)，γ_{s,l}为各尺度/子带的权重。与Fourier spectral loss（基于全局正弦基函数，提供uniform frequency constraint）不同，wavelet coefficients提供localized、s…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Chunked Prefill（分块预填充）.md","basename":"Chunked Prefill（分块预填充）","score":44.39064471142112,"foundWords":["multi","multiplexing","multi-slo","multi-turn可达50k","level","level粒度使抢占延迟从完整iteration"],"matches":[{"match":"multi-turn可达50K","offset":700},{"match":"Multiplexing","offset":1118},{"match":"Level","offset":1250},{"match":"Multi-SLO","offset":1281},{"match":"level","offset":1322},{"match":"level粒度使抢占延迟从完整iteration","offset":1638}],"excerpt":"…PU利用率；但100ms TBT SLO限制下合规budget仅约**256**（相差约16倍）。此外，chunk prefill需反复读取历史KV cache，当reused context极长时（multi-turn可达50K tokens），TBT随reused长度线性膨胀，极端情况下即使限制budget也无法满足SLO。\n**KV Cache Reload Overhead量化**（Bullet §2）：Bullet进一步量化了chunked prefill的KV cache重复读取代价。16k-token prefill以1k chunk切分为16个chunk，形成近似N(N+1)/2次KV reload。实测1k chunk下compute efficiency从71%降至61%，最后一个chunk处理时间为第一个的1.9x，总prefill latency比unchunke…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warpgroup.md","basename":"Warpgroup","score":44.087140178383024,"foundWords":["multiply-accumulate）指令。hopper架构中每个sm有一个大的tensor","multiply-accumulate","multiply","level","level：","levels:","levels"],"matches":[{"match":"Multiply-Accumulate）指令。Hopper架构中每个SM有一个大的Tensor","offset":310},{"match":"level：","offset":1669},{"match":"levels:","offset":1690},{"match":"level","offset":2021}],"excerpt":"Warpgroup是Hopper SM内部的一种逻辑线程组织方式，用于集体发起WGMMA（Warp Group Matrix Multiply-Accumulate）指令。Hopper架构中每个SM有一个大的Tensor Core（vs Ampere的4个独立Tensor Core），该Tensor Core需要128个线程（=4 warps）协同才能发起一次矩阵乘法操作。这就是warpgroup的根本原因：硬件要求。\n关键特征：(1) Warpgroup是cooperative的——所有128线程必须在同一时间点执行相同的wgmma指令（通过`warpgroup_sync()`对齐）；(2) Warpgroup中每个线程持有输出矩阵的不同行和列（按照特定的swizzle pattern分布），操作数A和B也按架构…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）.md","basename":"CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）","score":38.84813872900354,"foundWords":["multiply）和post-mul","multiply","level","level控制","level和instruction"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":245},{"match":"multiply）和post-mul","offset":1516},{"match":"level","offset":2136},{"match":"level控制","offset":2181},{"match":"level和instruction","offset":2194},{"match":"level","offset":2212}],"excerpt":"…的高性能GPU线性代数模板库，提供C++模板抽象用于构建自定义GEMM（通用矩阵乘法）kernel。CUTLASS将GEMM分解为thread block tile、warp tile和thread-level fragment的层次化tiling结构，通过模板参数配置数据精度（FP16/BF16/INT8/INT4/FP8等）、tile size、pipeline stages等，自动生成针对特定GPU架构优化的kernel。CUTLASS支持Tensor Core的所有精度模式（包括INT4的mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k32等），并提供software pipeline、epilogue fusion（如dequantization+scaling）等高级特性。\n从编译框架角度拆解术语：\nCUTLASS的层次化GEMM抽象（以INT4 GEMM为例）：\n```\n/…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md","basename":"Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation","score":34.60129358870658,"foundWords":["multi","multi-version","multi-level","level","level:"],"matches":[{"match":"Multi-level","offset":787},{"match":"level:","offset":1054},{"match":"level:","offset":1136},{"match":"level:","offset":1289},{"match":"multi-version","offset":1395}],"excerpt":"↓ Multi-level Code Optimization (§4.2)\n  ├── Instruction Reconstruction (cut-and-patch)\n  ├── Warp Specialization (4 mainloop + 4 copy warps)\n  └── Source Code Optimizer\nCUDA Binary Program\n  ↓\nStatic Library (.a)\n```\n1. **Tile Size决策**（top-down策略）：\n   - Register file level: 32-bit register/thread lim…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Query-Centric vs KV-Centric Attention Execution（面向查询 vs 面向KV缓存的注意力执行）.md","basename":"Query-Centric vs KV-Centric Attention Execution（面向查询 vs 面向KV缓存的注意力执行）","score":34.22038105020292,"foundWords":["multi","multi-stream:","multi-stream","multi-tile","level"],"matches":[{"match":"multi-tile","offset":1922},{"match":"Multi-stream:","offset":2235},{"match":"level","offset":2657},{"match":"multi-tile","offset":2783},{"match":"multi-stream","offset":2801},{"match":"Multi-Tile","offset":3171}],"excerpt":"// 动态CTA partitioning + multi-tile\nCTA_0: Q1, Q2 share KV-0, KV-1, KV-3 → tile (32, 128) for q=2, kv_len~=long\nCTA_1: Q3, Q4 share KV-0, KV-2 → tile (32, 64) for q=2, kv_len~=medium\nCTA_2: Q1 finish KV-6, Q2 finish KV-7 → tile (32, 32) for q=2, kv_len=short\nCTA_3: Q3 finish KV-4, Q4 finish KV-5 → tile (32, 32) for q=2, kv_…"}],"totalCount":50,"truncated":true},"effectiveQuery":"MLIR multi-level intermediate representation dialect design path:knowledge_notes"}}}
