tch":"all","offset":1860},{"match":"token","offset":1964},{"match":"tokens-1","offset":2151},{"match":"token","offset":2212},{"match":"to","offset":2220},{"match":"token","offset":2276},{"match":"token","offset":2332},{"match":"to","offset":2348},{"match":"token","offset":2479},{"match":"token","offset":2677},{"match":"to","offset":2742},{"match":"to","offset":2812},{"match":"to","offset":2904},{"match":"tokens","offset":3041},{"match":"token，记录总生成时间得到","offset":3058},{"match":"tokens）的","offset":3108},{"match":"to","offset":3121},{"match":"to","offset":3321},{"match":"all","offset":3432},{"match":"token","offset":3482},{"match":"token","offset":3523},{"match":"token","offset":3552},{"match":"to","offset":3567},{"match":"all","offset":3717},{"match":"token","offset":3955},{"match":"tokens/sec","offset":4096}],"excerpt":"## TTFT (Time to First Token) / ITL (Inter-Token Latency)（首 Token 时间 / Token 间延迟）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nTTFT（Time to First Token）和 ITL（Inter-Token Latency）是 LLM 推理性能评估的两个核心延迟指标，分别衡量推理 pipeline 的不同阶段：(a) **TTFT（首 Token 时间）**：从接收到完整输入 prompt 到生成第一个输出 token 之间的时间，反映 prefill 阶段的效率（包括 prompt tok…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md","basename":"Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism","score":347.48022677527103,"foundWords":["all","all-to-all","to","top-2","top-1","top-k选择：e_selected","top-k选择","top-k路由的具体计算过程","top-k路由是mo","top-k路由是moe模型中最常用的专家选择策略，对每个token选择门控概率最高的k个专家进行处理，其余专家不参与计算。","top-k路由是moe模型中最常用的专家选择策略","top-k","topk_gating","topk_vals.sum","topk_vals","topk_vals,","topk_idx,","topk_idx","topk","top","token/token","token-level","token"],"matches":[{"match":"Top-K","offset":3},{"match":"Top-K路由是MoE模型中最常用的专家选择策略，对每个token选择门控概率最高的K个专家进行处理，其余专家不参与计算。","offset":42},{"match":"token","offset":138},{"match":"Top-K路由的具体计算过程","offset":152},{"match":"Top-K选择：E_selecte","offset":209},{"match":"Top","offset":230},{"match":"（top-","offset":298},{"match":"（top-","offset":329},{"match":"topk_gatin","offset":430},{"match":"topk_vals","offset":666},{"match":"topk_id","offset":677},{"match":"top","offset":688},{"match":"topk_val","offset":730},{"match":"topk_val","offset":742},{"match":"topk_vals.su","offset":754},{"match":"topk_idx","offset":858},{"match":"topk_val","offset":868},{"match":"定Top-","offset":901},{"match":"有toke","offset":912},{"match":"据toke","offset":931},{"match":"单toke","offset":948},{"match":"难toke","offset":960},{"match":"+Top","offset":1029},{"match":"的toke","offset":1088},{"match":"top-","offset":1154},{"match":"toke","offset":1171},{"match":"top-","offset":1179},{"match":"top-","offset":1187},{"match":"toke","offset":1203},{"match":"top-","offset":1223},{"match":"toke","offset":1235},{"match":"all-to-al","offset":1269},{"match":"Top-","offset":1305},{"match":"*Token-leve","offset":1907},{"match":"toke","offset":1937},{"match":"toke","offset":2083},{"match":"（Toke","offset":2139},{"match":"Token/Toke","offset":2192}],"excerpt":"## Top-K Routing / Gating Mechanism\n术语解释\nTop-K路由是MoE模型中最常用的专家选择策略，对每个token选择门控概率最高的K个专家进行处理，其余专家不参与计算。\n术语是什么？\n路由（Gating/Routing）机制决定每个输入token应该激活哪些专家。Top-K路由的具体计算过程：\n1. 门控网络：θ = Softmax(R(x))，R通常是线性层W_r·x\n2. Top-K选择：E_selected = TopK(θ, K)，保留概率最高的K个\n3. 稀疏化：将未选中专家的权重置零，仅K/N的专家参与计算\nK的典型取值为1~8。K=1（top-…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Gradient-AllReduce in MoE Training.md","basename":"Gradient-AllReduce in MoE Training","score":337.54337801003567,"foundWords":["all","allgather,","allgather","allreduce","alltoall,","alltoall","allto","all-reduce","to","torch.matmul","torch"],"matches":[{"match":"AllReduce","offset":12},{"match":"AllReduce","offset":93},{"match":"AllReduce","offset":143},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":162},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":204},{"match":"AllReduce","offset":249},{"match":"to","offset":417},{"match":"to","offset":681},{"match":"yTorc","offset":846},{"match":"`al","offset":859},{"match":"-AllReduc","offset":1218},{"match":"all-reduc","offset":1252},{"match":"in [Allto","offset":1710},{"match":"ll, AllGat","offset":1720},{"match":"er, AllRe","offset":1746},{"match":"11; Allt","offset":2035},{"match":"-7; AllGa","offset":2066},{"match":"-7; AllRe","offset":2134},{"match":"s + torch.ma","offset":2229}],"excerpt":"## Gradient-AllReduce in MoE Training\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nGradient-AllReduce 是数据并行（DP）中梯度同步的集合通信操作。在混合并行训练中，Gradient-AllReduce 为节点间通信，与 AlltoAll 共享 InfiniBand 带宽。若不加优化，会与 MoE 层的 AlltoAll 争用网络导致额外延迟。FSMoE 的自适应梯度分区将 Gradient-AllReduce 与 MoE 层协同设计，最大化隐藏梯度同步开销。\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kerne…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/IpcSafeAllocator.md","basename":"IpcSafeAllocator","score":336.22048873345267,"foundWords":["allocate","allocator。在","allocator","torchcachingallocator","torch.ones","torch.empty","torch.full","torch"],"matches":[{"match":"Allocator","offset":10},{"match":"Allocator","offset":36},{"match":"Torch","offset":66},{"match":"Torch","offset":83},{"match":"TorchCachingAllocator","offset":94},{"match":"Torch","offset":153},{"match":"Allocator","offset":207},{"match":"torch.ones","offset":221},{"match":"torch.empty","offset":236},{"match":"torch.full","offset":252},{"match":"Allocator","offset":388},{"match":"Allocator","offset":417},{"match":"allocate","offset":436},{"match":"Torch","offset":665},{"match":"torch.ones","offset":676},{"match":"Allocator","offset":717},{"match":"torch.empty","offset":730},{"match":"torch.full","offset":758},{"match":"Allocator","offset":799},{"match":"allocator。在","offset":992}],"excerpt":"## IpcSafeAllocator\n术语是什么？\nIpcSafeAllocator 是 ElasticMoE 自定义的 PyTorch 内存分配器，覆盖 PyTorch 默认的 `TorchCachingAllocator`，确保所有模型权重分配使用 CANN 的 IPC 兼容内存标记。标准 PyTorch 分配器使用设备内存池，分配结果通常作为单一内存块管理，无法被跨进程 IPC 共享。IpcSafeAllocator 拦截 `torch.ones()`、`torch.empty()`、`torch.full()` 等核心分配函数，直接调用 IPC 兼容的 `aclrtMalloc`，使分配的张量可被…"}],"totalCount":50,"truncated":true},"effectiveQuery":"MoE scatter gather all-to-all token dispatch NCCL communication compiler IR knowledge path:knowledge_notes"}}}
