{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_9HXBsIXnao1UWXJBhM5r9767","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q3.1_L3_answer.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c163d944-6c93-4e5e-8d60-5c144e0d6bb3","uuid":"e285887c-f372-4730-afb2-4ad2ffa2a7b0","timestamp":"2026-05-30T20:24:38.135Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q3.1_L3_answer.md","content":"# Q3.1 — MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 四类模型负载的编译 IR 表示\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md | 578 | MLIR dialect 架构、progressive lowering、gpu/scf/async/memref/affine 方言；Diffuse 编译 pipeline: inline→fusion→parallelize→GPU lowering |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md | 3521 | Cypress Event IR：SSA 异步 event 建模，event 数组支持 WARP/THREAD 并行迭代追踪，broadcast [:] 索引→硬件同步 lowering |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md | 1762 | Triton 编译链: Python→TTIR→TTGIR→LLVM IR→PTX；block-level 编程；tl.program_id/tl.load/tl.dot/tl.store 原语；autotuner |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton Language (GPU Kernel Programming).md | 213 | Triton kernel 示例（简化 Attention）、block-level 编程详解、autotuner 配置空间、与 CUDA 的对比 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Hidet IR (Task-Mapping Intermediate Representation).md | 5402 | Hidet IR：类 CUDA C 的 task-mapping IR，VM IR→Hidet IR→CUDA C→nvcc→cubin 编译链 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR-based PIM Compiler and IREE Runtime.md | 2553 | PIMphony MLIR lowering: StableHLO→Linalg→PIM ops→IREE HAL；Pattern-matching pass 识别 attention/FFN 子图 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Thread-Block-Level Programming Model (SIMB).md | 294 | Tilus SIMB 模型：thread-block 级 IR 指令集（AllocateGlobal/LoadGlobal/Dot/View/Synchronize/CopyAsync） |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）.md | 39 | CUTLASS 层次化 GEMM 模板：threadblock tile→warp tile→thread fragment；epilogue fusion；Hopper TMA+WGMMA |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md | 379 | Infera compiler：micro-operator 多版本 kernel（register 64/96/128 × shared memory × pipeline stages），ILP/TLP/intensity trade-off |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning.md | 1797 | MoE irregular all-to-all 双趟协议：size 交换→数据传输；NCCL Send/Recv 实现；Lancet static-shape approx 误差 3.83% |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md | 1488 | Difflow DFG IR：符号属性传播、dGraph 分解、denoising loop 展开、ragged operation regularization |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/X-MoE.../3.3-Expensive-All-to-All...md | 9305 | MoE all-to-all 在 HPC 层次化网络上（Infinity Fabric 200GB/s vs Slingshot 25GB/s）的拓扑感知路由 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md | 279 | EEVEE 多模态模块化 IR：modality-specific modules 独立调度、各自 SM allocation、MPS 空间复用 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md | 35 | Infera zero-tuning：warp specialization (4 mainloop + 4 copy warps)、多层次代码优化、CUDA binary 静态库 |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节 — 四类模型负载的编译 IR 表示（编译流程模拟）\n\n> **侧重**：硬件体系结构 — IR 设计如何反映底层硬件能力、算子并发在 IR 中的表达、硬件拓扑感知的 device placement\n\n---\n\n### 1. MoE 模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n#### 1.1 High-level IR：XLA HLO 中 all-to-all + expert FFN 子图\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning.md` (score: 1797); `paper_secs/secs_moe/X-MoE.../3.3-Expensive-All-to-All...md` (score: 9305)\n\nMoE 的编译 IR 核心挑战是将 **expert dispatch/combine** 的通信语义与 expert FFN 的计算语义在 IR 中统一表达。\n\n**编译流程模拟 — MoE 层的 IR lowering 链**：\n\n```\nStep 1: 前端框架（PyTorch/JAX）→ 计算图\n  MoE Layer Forward:\n    gate_logits = Linear(hidden)              // [B×S, E]\n    topk_indices, topk_weights = TopK(gate_logits, k=2)\n    dispatched = Dispatch(tokens, topk_indices)  // [G×C, D] per GPU\n    expert_out = ExpertFFN(dispatched)           // 各 expert 独立计算\n    combined = Combine(expert_out, topk_indices, topk_weights)\n\nStep 2: XLA HLO 中的表达\n  // all-to-all 将 token 按 expert 分配路由到各 GPU\n  %dispatched = all-to-all(%tokens, replica_groups={{0,1,...,G-1}})\n      维度: 输入 [B×S/G×E, D] → 输出 [B×S/G×E, D]（语义重排）\n      底层: NCCL alltoall (intra-node NVLink 900GB/s / inter-node IB 400GB/s)\n\n  // Expert FFN 子图（可被 XLA fusion pipeline 融合内部算子）\n  %expert_out = fusion(\n      dot(%dispatched, %w1),     // gate_proj\n      dot(%dispatched, %w2),     // up_proj  \n      multiply(%gate, %up),      // SiLU activation\n      dot(%result, %w3)          // down_proj\n  )  // XLA multi-output fusion: 3个dot共享输入→融合为单kernel\n\n  // 逆 all-to-all: 将 expert 输出按 token 原始位置归约\n  %combined = all-to-all(%expert_out, replica_groups=...)\n\nStep 3: XLA GPU Codegen\n  HLO → LHLO (buffer assignment) → LMHLO (MLIR HLO dialect) →\n  gpu.launch (CUDA kernel) + Thunk-based runtime (XLA:GPU)\n\n  // 硬件约束下的融合边界:\n  // - shared memory ≤ 228KB/SM (H100) → 3个dot weight tile 共享 SRAM 受限\n  // - register file 65536 regs/SM (H100) → 255 regs/thread max\n  // → XLA fusion pass 根据 cost model 决定是否融合 3 个 dot\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **all-to-all 的硬件映射**：笔记显示 X-MoE 在 HPC 平台上发现 intra-node（Infinity Fabric 200 GB/s）与 inter-node（Slingshot 25 GB/s）带宽不对称达 8:1。XLA HLO 的 `all-to-all` 操作在 codegen 阶段需感知此拓扑——intra-node 传输使用 NVLink peer-to-peer，inter-node 降级为 IB send/recv——但笔记未明确说明 XLA 是否自动做此拓扑感知优化。\n- **并发机会**：expert FFN 内部的 3 个 dot（gate_proj, up_proj, down_proj）在传统 XLA 中以融合单 kernel 串行执行。多 expert（8 个 expert）之间数据独立，若 IR 能标注每个 expert 为独立 `async.execute` region，可在多 CUDA stream 上并发——但笔记显示 standard XLA 以串行为主，async all-to-all 支持有限。\n- **Irregular all-to-all 的 IR 含义**：笔记显示 Lancet 使用双趟 all-to-all（先交换 size 再交换数据），降低通信量（不传输 padding tokens）。在 IR 层面这意味着 all-to-all 的 send/recv sizes 是动态的（不固定 C），IR 需支持 variable-length communication——这对传统 HLO 的固定 shape 假设构成挑战。\n\n#### 1.2 Low-level IR：MLIR 中 MoE expert 并行 region\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md` (score: 3521)\n\n```\n编译流程模拟 — MLIR 多 dialect MoE lowering:\n\n=== Level 1: StableHLO (High-level) ===\nfunc @moe_layer(%tokens: tensor<GxCxDxf32>) {\n  %gate = stablehlo.dot(%tokens, %gate_w)\n  %topk = stablehlo.custom_call @topk(%gate)\n  // all-to-all 是 StableHLO 一等公民 op\n  %dispatched = stablehlo.all_to_all(%tokens) {replica_groups = dense<...>}\n  %expert_out = stablehlo.custom_call @expert_ffn(%dispatched)\n  %combined = stablehlo.all_to_all(%expert_out) {replica_groups = dense<...>}\n}\n\n=== Level 2: Mixed dialect lowering ===\n// all-to-all → 分解为 memref copy within gpu.launch\ngpu.launch blocks(%grid) threads(%block) {\n  gpu.memcpy %dst, %src : memref<CxD>  // NCCL send/recv\n}\n\n// Expert FFN → scf.forall 标注 expert 并发!\nscf.forall (%e) in (0 to 8) {\n  // 每个 expert 迭代独立 → 编译器可并发发射\n  %w = memref.load %expert_weights[%e]\n  linalg.matmul ins(%expert_in, %w) outs(%buf)\n}\n// scf.forall 的硬件映射: \n//   → GPU lowering: 每 iteration 映射为一个 thread block 或独立 kernel\n//   → CPU lowering: 每 iteration 映射为 parallel task\n\n=== Level 3: Async dialect (显式并发) ===\n%tok_e0 = async.execute { call @expert_0(%in0) }  // async region 0\n%tok_e1 = async.execute { call @expert_1(%in1) }  // async region 1 (并发于 0)\n// ... E 个 async.execute 可全部并发\nasync.await %tok_e0, %tok_e1, ...  // gather barrier\n\n=== Level 4: GPU lowering → CUDA streams ===\n// async.execute → 独立 CUDA Stream\n// async.await → cudaEventRecord/cudaStreamWaitEvent\n// gpu.launch → CUDA kernel launch on assigned stream\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **`scf.forall` vs `async.execute` 的选择**：`scf.forall` 适合规则并行（各 expert 计算量相近），编译器可做 loop fusion/tiling；`async.execute` 适合不规则并行（各 expert 延迟不同），支持更灵活的设备放置和通信 overlap。\n- **硬件约束**：单 GPU 上并发 CUDA stream 数受限于 GPU 的 Hyper-Q 能力（通常 32 个硬件工作队列）。8 个 expert 全部并发映射到 8 条 stream 在硬件层面可行，但超过 32 个 expert 时需 compile-time stream assignment 策略。\n- **Event IR 对比**：Cypress 的 Event-Based IR 更进一步——每个异步操作显式生成 event 值，支持 `[(N, WARP)]` 级别的并行完成追踪，可直接 lowering 到 `__syncwarp`/`mbarrier`/`warpgroup sync` 等硬件同步原语。笔记显示该 IR 是纯编译时 construct，无运行时开销。\n\n---\n\n### 2. DiT（Diffusion Transformer）模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n#### 2.1 High-level IR：StableHLO `while` op + Difflow 符号化 DFG\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1488); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578)\n\nDiT 模型的 IR 核心是 **denoising loop** 的表达。StableHLO 用 `while` op 包裹单步 noise prediction + scheduler step；Difflow 通过展开 loop 为 Data Flow Graph（DFG）后进行符号化优化。\n\n**编译流程模拟 — DiT denoising loop 的 IR 变换**：\n\n```\nStep 1: 模型定义 → StableHLO while op\n\n  %result = stablehlo.while(%iter_arg = %latent_noise, %t = %num_steps) {\n    // cond region: t > 0 继续迭代\n    ^cond(%latent, %t):\n      stablehlo.return (stablehlo.compare GT %t, %c0)\n    // body region: 单步 denoising\n    ^body(%latent, %t):\n      %t_emb = stablehlo.custom_call @timestep_embed(%t)\n      %noise_pred = stablehlo.call @dit_backbone(%latent, %t_emb)\n      %next_latent = stablehlo.custom_call @scheduler_step(%latent, %noise_pred)\n      stablehlo.return %next_latent, (stablehlo.subtract %t, %c1)\n  }\n\n  // 并发语义分析:\n  // while body 内部: DiT backbone (MHA + FFN) 的各层间有数据依赖\n  // while 跨迭代: %latent_t → %latent_{t+1} 是 SSA loop carried value\n  //   → 严格串行依赖: 下一迭代必须等待本次的 latent 输出\n  // step-internal 并发: attention 各 head 的 QKV projection 可并行\n\nStep 2: Difflow 符号化 DFG 方法\n\n  // Difflow 的关键洞察: 展开 denoising loop 到收敛\n  // (非嵌套、非重叠的 loop，通常 ≤5 步收敛)\n  \n  ① Loop Unrolling (to stabilization):\n     unroll while body × 3-5 iterations\n     → flat DFG with symbolic redundancy variables\n\n  ② Symbolic Property Assignment:\n     对 DFG 每个输入赋值符号变量:\n       α: prompt_text = redundant? (跨请求同一 prompt)\n       β: timestep_embedding = redundant? (相邻步可能复用)\n       γ: control_image = redundant? (ControlNet 输入)\n       T/F: 已知固定属性值\n\n  ③ Property Propagation (Table 1 rules):\n     // 示例: BatchMatmul [NHW] 的冗余传播规则\n     output_redundancy = [a1 ∧ b1, a2, b3]\n     // → 当两个输入的 batch 维都冗余时，输出的 batch 维也冗余\n\n  ④ dGraph Identification:\n     按输出属性表达式相同性对连续算子分组:\n       dGraph_A: {t_emb → AdaLN → QKV_proj} → 当 β=T 时跨步复用\n       dGraph_B: {attention → FFN}           → 每步重算\n       dGraph_C: {scheduler_step}             → 每步重算\n\n  ⑤ dEngine Compilation:\n     每个 dGraph 按枚举的属性组合编译为多个 dEngine:\n       dEngine_A1: β=T → 缓存 timestep embedding，跳过重算\n       dEngine_A2: β=F → 标准重算\n     → 运行时根据实际属性选择 dEngine\n\nStep 3: MLIR lowering of while body\n  // while body 内的 DiT backbone 通过 MLIR 编译:\n  ① affine-loop-fusion: 融合 denoising step 内的独立循环\n  ② affine-scalar-replacement: 消除临时 intermediate 分配\n  ③ affine-parallelize: affine.for → affine.par (标注并行)\n  ④ lower-affine → scf + arith\n  ⑤ gpu-kernel-outlining + gpu-map-parallel-loops → GPU kernel\n  ⑥ convert-to-nvvm → PTX → cubin\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **`while` op 的硬件语义**：StableHLO 的 `while` op 在 GPU backend 上被编译为 host-side loop——每次迭代从 host 发射 DiT backbone 的 kernel 序列。这意味着迭代间的 kernel launch 由 host CPU 控制，GPU 端严格串行。Difflow 的方法在编译时将 while body 展开，在展开后的 DFG 中发现跨迭代的数据复用（如相同的 timestep embedding），将\"每次重算\"转为\"一次计算+缓存复用\"。\n- **符号属性传播的硬件含义**：属性 `redundant=T` 意味着该 tensor 的 HBM 读取可以被消除——直接在 L2 cache 或 shared memory 中复用。H100 的 HBM 带宽 3.35 TB/s，消除一个 1GB 的冗余读取节省 ~0.3ms latency。对 50 步 denoising，若 30% 的数据可复用，总延迟降低 ~4.5ms。\n- **dGraph 分解的并发含义**：dGraph 本质上是 IR 层面的并发发现单元——不同 dGraph 的数据依赖由 DFG 的边显式表达，编译器据此决定哪些 dGraph 可并发执行（如 dGraph_A 的 timestep embedding 可与上一 denoising step 的 dGraph_C scheduler_step 在 pipeline 中 overlap）。\n- **笔记未明确说明**：StableHLO while op 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 body 内部的异步 kernel launch；Difflow 的单 GPU 验证仅在 A100/H100 上进行；DiT 跨 timestep KV cache 复用等高级优化在 vault 中无直接笔记。\n\n#### 2.2 Low-level IR：Triton IR 中 DiT attention 的 block-level 表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md` (score: 1762); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton Language (GPU Kernel Programming).md` (score: 213)\n\n```\n编译流程模拟 — Triton IR 中 DiT Multi-Head Attention 的 lowering:\n\nPython (@triton.jit attention_kernel)\n    ↓ Triton Frontend (Python AST → Triton IR)\nTTIR (Triton Intermediate Representation)\n  - tt.func: kernel 函数签名（含 block-level shape 参数如 BLOCK_M, BLOCK_N）\n  - tt.program_id(0): batch index → 并发轴 1\n  - tt.program_id(1): head index  → 并发轴 2\n  - tt.load: HBM → SRAM tile load\n  - tt.dot: Tensor Core GEMM（block-level MMA）\n  - tt.store: SRAM → HBM tile write\n    ↓ MLIR Optimizations (layout, loop unroll)\nTTGIR (Triton GPU IR)\n  - block → warp → thread 分解\n  - shared memory allocation 显式化\n  - cp.async insertion (load pipeline)\n    ↓ GPU lowering\nLLVM IR → PTX → cuModule → GPU execution\n\n// Autotuner 配置空间（笔记 Monarch kernel 示例）:\nconfigs = [\n  {'t_n': 32, 't_r': 32, 't_p': 32}, num_warps=4,\n  {'t_n': 64, 't_r': 64, 't_p': 64}, num_warps=8,\n  {'t_n': 128, 't_r': 128, 't_p': 64}, num_warps=8,\n  ...\n]  // 20+ candidate configs\n// key=['n', 'r', 'b_1']: 当这些参数变化时重新 tune\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **`program_id` 的并发映射**：Triton IR 的 `program_id(axis)` 是 block-level 并发的显式 IR 标注。`program_id(0)` 和 `program_id(1)` 分别沿 grid 的两个轴独立——在 H100 上，若 grid=(B, H)，每个 (batch, head) 组合映射为一个 thread block，SM 级并行调度。这与 GPU 的 SIMT 硬件模型直接对齐。\n- **Autotuner 的硬件建模**：Triton autotuner 通过实测进行配置搜索（非 cost model 预测）。`num_warps` 直接影响 SM occupancy——4 warps 允许 16 个 block/SM（H100），8 warps 降至 8 个 block/SM。`num_stages` 控制 software pipeline 深度，影响 global↔shared memory 带宽利用率。\n- **单 kernel 内 vs 跨 kernel 并发**：笔记明确指出 Triton 的局限性——单 kernel 内微算子并发（通过 tile-level 并行），但跨 kernel 编排需要外部调度器（如 CUDA Graph 或 host-side scheduler）。\n\n---\n\n### 3. 多模态模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n#### 3.1 MLIR 中异构编码器的并行表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578); `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md` (score: 279)\n\n多模态模型（LLaVA/BLIP-2/ImageBind）的核心 IR 特征是**异构编码器的多分支并行**——vision encoder 和 text encoder 在融合前无数据依赖。\n\n**编译流程模拟 — MLIR 中多模态模型 IR 的并行编译**：\n\n```\nStep 1: 多模态模型 → MLIR 顶层 IR（两个独立 func.func）\n\nmodule {\n  // 分支 A: Vision Encoder (ViT)\n  func.func @vision_encoder(%image: tensor<Bx3x224x224xf32>)\n      -> tensor<BxNxDxf32> {\n    %patches = stablehlo.convolution(%image, %patch_emb)  // patch embedding\n    %feat = call @vit_transformer(%patches) {depth=12, heads=12}\n    return %feat\n  }\n\n  // 分支 B: Text Encoder (BERT/LLM)\n  func.func @text_encoder(%tokens: tensor<BxLxi32>)\n      -> tensor<BxLxDxf32> {\n    %emb = stablehlo.gather(%emb_table, %tokens)           // token embedding\n    %feat = call @bert_transformer(%emb) {depth=12, heads=12}\n    return %feat\n  }\n  // 关键: vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 无相互调用 → \n  // 编译器的 call graph 分析发现两个 func 无依赖 → 可并行\n}\n\nStep 2: MLIR Pass Pipeline 中的并行调度\n\n  // Async 包裹两个编码器为独立 region\n  %vis_token = async.execute { call @vision_encoder(%image) }\n  %txt_token = async.execute { call @text_encoder(%tokens) }\n  // 两个 async.execute 可并发发射到不同 GPU stream\n\n  // 融合层 barrier\n  async.await %vis_token, %txt_token\n  // 等待两个编码器完成 → cross-modal attention 获取两者输出\n\nStep 3: 融合层 — Cross-Modal Attention 的 SSA 数据流\n\n  func.func @cross_modal_fusion(%v: tensor<...>, %t: tensor<...>) {\n    // SSA use-def 链显式编码跨模态数据流:\n    //   vision tokens (v) → K,V projection → cross-attention\n    //   text tokens (t)   → Q projection   → cross-attention\n    //   cross-attention   → gated add      → text tokens (updated)\n    %q = linalg.matmul ins(%t, %w_q)\n    %k = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_k)\n    %v_proj = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_v)\n    %attn = stablehlo.custom_call @cross_attention(%q, %k, %v_proj)\n    return %attn\n  }\n\nStep 4: EEVEE 模块化 IR（补充视角）\n\n  // EEVEE 的 Module Multiplexing: 每个 modality-specific module\n  // 在 IR 中表示为独立可调度单元，各自有独立的:\n  //   - batch size\n  //   - GPU SM allocation (via MPS)\n  //   - CUDA stream\n  // 这本质上是空间多路复用（spatial multiplexing）在 IR 层面的表达\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **异构编码器的 IR 分离价值**：vision encoder（ViT, 卷积-heavy）和 text encoder（BERT, attention-heavy）的计算特征根本不同——前者适合大 tile size + 低 occupancy，后者适合小 tile size + 高 occupancy。IR 中的独立 `func.func` 允许编译器为两者分别做 target-specific 优化（tile size、fusion strategy、register allocation）。\n- **跨模态 SSA 边的同步语义**：`cross_attention(%q, %k, %v_proj)` 的 operands `%k` 和 `%v_proj`（来自 vision encoder）与 `%q`（来自 text encoder）必须在 cross-attention 执行前都就绪。编译器从 SSA use-def 链自动推导此同步需求，插入 `async.await`（或等价的 CUDA event 同步）。\n- **硬件约束**：笔记显示 EEVEE 通过 NVIDIA MPS 在同一 GPU 上为 vision 和 text encoder 分配不同 SM partition。但笔记未明确说明 MLIR 的 `async.execute` 是否支持 SM 显式分配（这需要额外的 SM allocation hint 在 IR 中表达）。\n\n#### 3.2 多模态 IR 中跨模态融合的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578)\n\n多模态融合层（cross-attention）在 IR 中建立了跨模态数据流。MLIR 的 Linalg dialect 通过 `linalg.matmul` 表达跨模态 QKV 计算，SSA 的 use-def 边从 vision 域跨越到 text 域：\n\n```\n// 跨模态数据流的 SSA 表达:\n// vision 域 → K,V → cross-attention → text 域更新\n%K_vis = linalg.matmul ins(%v_feat, %w_k)  // vision 域\n%V_vis = linalg.matmul ins(%v_feat, %w_v)  // vision 域\n%Q_txt = linalg.matmul ins(%t_feat, %w_q)  // text 域\n// 跨域 SSA 边: vision 域的 value 流入 text 域的计算\n%cross = linalg.matmul ins(%Q_txt, %K_vis) // cross-modal!\n%out   = linalg.matmul ins(%cross, %V_vis) // cross-modal!\n```\n\n**注解**：跨模态 SSA 边是编译器的天然同步标记——`%cross` 依赖 `%Q_txt`（text encoder 输出）和 `%K_vis`（vision encoder 输出），编译器据此推导出融合层必须在两个编码器都完成后才能执行，无需用户显式标注同步点。\n\n---\n\n### 4. Video 模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n#### 4.1 帧级并行的 IR 表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1488, 涵盖 video temporal/spatial attention); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md` (score: 379)\n\nVideo 模型的 IR 核心是**时空计算的表达**——帧级并行在不破坏时序依赖的前提下在 IR 中标注。笔记未直接覆盖 `pmap`/`shard_map` 的详细知识笔记，但 Difflow 论文提供了 video generation model 的实际编译流程。\n\n**编译流程模拟 — Video 模型的 IR 表达**：\n\n```\nStep 1: Video 模型 → DFG/Difflow 编译\n\n  Video DiT / UNet 的时空算子:\n    - spatial_conv:  每帧独立的 2D 卷积 → 帧间无依赖\n    - temporal_attn: 跨帧 attention (Q,K,V over T 维) → 帧间全依赖\n    - spatial_attn:  每帧独立的 2D attention → 帧间无依赖\n    - 3D conv:       kernel 跨帧 (如 3×3×3 over T,H,W) → 局部帧间依赖\n\nStep 2: Difflow DFG 中的帧级分析\n\n  ① Symbolic shape propagation:\n     frames 维度表示为符号变量 f\n     ragged case: f ∈ {14, 28, 57} (不同请求生成不同帧数)\n  \n  ② dGraph decomposition for video:\n     dGraph_spatial:  所有 spatial-only 算子 (每帧独立)\n     dGraph_temporal: temporal attention 算子 (跨帧依赖)\n     dGraph_3Dconv:   3D convolution (局部跨帧，如 3×3×3 kernel)\n  \n  ③ Ragged operation regularization:\n     ragged 帧数 → 合并到 batch 维:\n       原 [f, C, H, W] → reshape → [(f·H), W, C] → 标准 Matmul\n       或 tile each frame independently → round-robin 分配到 GPU blocks\n\nStep 3: 帧级并发的 IR 标注（推断模式）\n\n  // 每帧独立的 spatial 算子 → 标注为并行\n  // 伪 IR: scf.forall (%frame) in (0 to num_frames) {\n  //   spatial_conv_2d(latent[%frame])\n  //   spatial_attn(latent[%frame])\n  // }  // frame iterations 无数据依赖 → 可并发映射到不同 SM\n\n  // temporal attention → 需跨帧通信\n  // 伪 IR: %all_frames = all-gather(%local_frames, dim='frame')\n  //        %t_attn = temporal_attn(%all_frames)\n  // SSA 链接: %local_frames (帧 i 的 local) → \n  //            %all_frames (跨帧收集) → \n  //            %t_attn (继续计算)\n  // 这种 SSA 链显式编码了 temporal attention 的跨帧依赖\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **帧级并发的硬件约束**：temporal attention 的 all-gather 操作在 HBM 上的通信量 = O(T × H × W × C)。对于 T=14 帧、1024×1024 分辨率、C=64 通道的 SVD 模型，单层 temporal attention 需传输约 14×1024×1024×64×2 bytes ≈ 1.8 GB（FP16）。H100 的 HBM 带宽 3.35 TB/s 下传输 ~0.5ms——这是帧级并发的主要瓶颈。\n- **Difflow 的 ragged 处理与硬件**：笔记显示 Difflow 将 ragged 帧数请求通过 `fuse batch dim + ragged dim → regular Matmul` 的方式处理——这种方式利用 GPU 的硬件 batch Matmul kernel（如 cuBLAS），无需手写 ragged kernel。\n- **笔记未明确说明**：`pmap`/`shard_map` 在单 GPU 上的确切性能和实现细节；video 模型 temporal attention 的 communication-computation overlap 自动生成能力。\n\n---\n\n## 二、实验环境\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1488); `paper_secs/secs_moe/X-MoE.../3.3-Expensive-All-to-All...md` (score: 9305)\n\n### 2.1 DiT/Diffusion 编译 IR 实验（Difflow）\n\n| 配置项 | 规格 |\n|--------|------|\n| GPU | NVIDIA A100 40GB PCIe + H100 80GB PCIe |\n| CUDA | 12.1 (UNet) / 12.8 (DiT) |\n| 框架 | PyTorch 2.9, Triton backend, Stable Fast (baseline) |\n| DiT Benchmark | HunyuanImage, Hunyuan-DiT ControlNet, FLUX.1 S |\n| Video Benchmark | SVD (14 frames, 576×1024, I2V) |\n| 编译策略 | dGraph decomposition + dEngine multi-version compilation |\n| 关键指标 | 吞吐量 (req/s)、编译时间 (min)、dEngine 数量 |\n| 核心结果 | DiT refine: 2.2-3.0× speedup; edit: 1.4×; 编译时间: SDXL U-Net 4 min (dGraph) vs 16 min (monolithic) |\n\n### 2.2 MoE 编译 IR 实验（X-MoE / Lancet）\n\n| 配置项 | 规格 |\n|--------|------|\n| 平台 | Frontier HPC (Dragonfly topology) |\n| Intra-node | Infinity Fabric 200 GB/s |\n| Inter-node | Slingshot 25 GB/s |\n| MoE Config | DeepSeek-style: 256 experts, top-8 routing |\n| 关键发现 | 拓扑感知路由减少 8× inter-node 通信量; static-shape approx 误差 3.83% |\n\n### 2.3 多模态编译 IR 实验\n\n笔记中多模态模型编译 IR 的具体实验数据有限。Difflow 涵盖 video model (SVD) 但未专门评估多模态编码器分支的 IR 并发效果。EEVEE 的 Module Multiplexing 实验数据未在 vault 中记录。\n\n---\n\n## 三、实现（辅助说明）\n\n### 3.1 各编译框架 IR 实现总览\n\n| IR 系统 | 实现框架 | 开源 | 编程接口 | 硬件后端 |\n|---------|---------|------|---------|---------|\n| HLO / StableHLO | XLA / OpenXLA | Apache 2.0 | JAX, TF, PyTorch-XLA | GPU(CUDA), TPU, CPU |\n| MLIR 多 dialect | LLVM MLIR | Apache 2.0 | C++ API, Python bindings | GPU, CPU, FPGA, PIM, NPU |\n| Triton IR / TTGIR | OpenAI Triton | MIT | Python DSL (@triton.jit) | NVIDIA (sm_70+), AMD CDNA3/4 |\n| Hidet IR | Hidet | Apache 2.0 | torch.compile(backend='hidet') | NVIDIA GPU |\n| CUTLASS 模板 | NVIDIA CUTLASS | BSD-like | C++ templates | NVIDIA GPU (SM70+) |\n| Event-Based IR | Cypress (学术) | 笔记未说明 | C++ | NVIDIA GPU |\n\n### 3.2 编译时间参考（Difflow）\n\n| 模型 | 策略 | #Inputs | #dGraphs | #Engines | 编译时间 |\n|------|------|---------|----------|----------|----------|\n| SDXL UNet | Monolithic | 4 | 1 | 16 | 16 min |\n| SDXL UNet | dGraph | 4 | 3 | 4 | 4 min |\n| SDXL+ControlNet | Monolithic | 14 | 1 | 16384 | ~11 days |\n| SDXL+ControlNet | dGraph | 14 | 4 | 7 | 7 min |\n\n---\n\n## 四、是什么？（辅助说明）\n\n### 4.1 IR 层次定义\n\n| IR 层级 | 代表 | 硬件无关性 | 并发信息保留 |\n|---------|------|-----------|-------------|\n| High-level IR | StableHLO, Relay | 高（无硬件假设） | SPMD annotation, all-to-all op |\n| Mid-level IR | MLIR Linalg/SCF/GPU, DFG (Difflow) | 中（memory hierarchy 抽象） | scf.forall, async.execute, dGraph |\n| Low-level IR | Triton IR, LLVM IR, PTX | 低（指令集映射） | program_id, gpu.launch, stream |\n\n### 4.2 四类模型 IR 设计核心差异\n\n| 模型 | IR 核心特征 | 关键并发 IR 原语 | 硬件映射关键 |\n|------|-----------|-----------------|-------------|\n| **MoE** | all-to-all + expert FFN 子图 | `scf.forall`, `async.execute`, `all-to-all` | NVLink/NVSwitch 拓扑感知 |\n| **DiT** | `while` op 或展开 DFG | `affine.par`, `program_id`, dGraph | SM block 级并行, denoising loop 展开 |\n| **多模态** | 独立 `func.func` + cross-attention | `async.execute` + `async.await` | 多 CUDA stream, MPS 空间分区 |\n| **Video** | 时空算子 IR + frame parallelism | `scf.forall`(frame axis), ragged dEngine | SM 帧级并行, temporal attn 跨帧通信 |\n\n---\n\n## 五、方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心 IR 机制 | 并发表达 | 编译框架 | 硬件平台 | 编译-运行时权衡 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|------------|---------|---------|---------|---------------|---------|\n| **XLA HLO all-to-all** | all-to-all op + GSPMD sharding | SPMD partition annotation | XLA/OpenXLA | GPU(CUDA), TPU | 编译时 partition + 运行时 NCCL | X-MoE (9305), Irregular all-to-all (1797) |\n| **MLIR scf.forall + async** | 多 dialect progressive lowering | scf.forall 无依赖迭代, async.execute token | LLVM MLIR | GPU(CUDA/Vulkan), PIM, NPU | 编译时 IR pass pipeline + 运行时 stream | MLIR note (578), MLIR PIM Compiler (2553) |\n| **Cypress Event IR** | SSA event + precondition DAG | Event 数组 per-WARP/THREAD 追踪 | Cypress (学术) | GPU(CUDA) | 纯编译时: event→硬件 barrier lowering | Event-Based IR (3521) |\n| **Difflow DFG/dGraph** | 符号属性传播 + dGraph 分解 | dGraph 级数据属性分组并发 | Difflow (PyTorch/Triton) | GPU(A100/H100) | 编译时 dEngine 生成 + 运行时 DP 调度 | Difflow §4 (1488) |\n| **Triton IR program_id** | block-level tile IR | program_id 沿 grid 轴并行 | OpenAI Triton | GPU(NVIDIA/AMD) | 编译时 tile 搜索 + 运行时 grid 发射 | Triton note (1762, 213) |\n| **Hidet IR** | 类 CUDA C task-mapping IR | task mapping 显式指定算子分配 | Hidet | GPU(CUDA) | VM IR→Hidet IR→nvcc→cubin 全编译链 | Hidet IR (5402) |\n| **Tilus SIMB IR** | thread-block 级指令集(Allocate/Dot/View/CopyAsync) | SIMB 模型: block 内所有线程协作 | Tilus (Python IR) | GPU(CUDA) | CopyAsync 三级流水线 + 编译时同步管理 | SIMB note (294) |\n| **CUTLASS 模板** | 层次化 GEMM 模板 (threadblock→warp→fragment) | CUDA 硬件 warp/tblock 调度 | NVIDIA CUTLASS | GPU(SM70+, TensorCore) | 编译时模板展开 + 运行时 kernel 调用 | CUTLASS note (39) |\n| **Infera Multi-Version** | micro-operator 多版本 kernel (reg×shmem×stages) | 编译时 ILP/TLP trade-off 枚举 | Infera (TVM Relay→TensorIR→CUDA) | GPU(CUDA) | 编译时 multi-version gen + 运行时 SelectKernels | Multi-Version note (379) |\n| **PIMphony MLIR+IREE** | StableHLO→Linalg→PIM ops→IREE HAL | PIM-specific 指令级并发标注 | PIMphony (MLIR IREE) | PIM(CENT/NeuPIMs) | 离线编译 + 运行时 HAL dispatch | MLIR PIM Compiler (2553) |\n\n---\n\n## 六、不确定性\n\n1. **StableHLO while op 的 GPU 异步支持**: 笔记显示 `while` op 的 GPU lowering 在 host 端串行发射 iteration kernel，但 XLA 是否支持 while body 内部的异步算子（如 async all-to-all）笔记未明确说明。\n\n2. **Video 模型 `pmap`/`shard_map` 的详细知识笔记缺失**: vault 中缺乏关于 JAX `pmap`/`shard_map` 在单 GPU Video 模型上的 IR lowering 细节笔记。上述分析部分基于 Difflow 的 video evaluation 和 MLIR 的通用 parallel semantics 推断。\n\n3. **NPU 的 IR 设计细节**: vault 中关于 NPU（昇腾、Apple ANE）的 IR 层面编译设计笔记较少。CANN 的 GE IR→Ascend 指令 lowering 的具体 dialect 和 pass pipeline 细节未记录。\n\n4. **多模态模型跨硬件 device placement**: MLIR+IREE 理论上支持 GPU+NPU 异构编译，但 vault 中缺乏多模态模型（LLaVA/BLIP-2 on GPU+ANE）的编译实验数据或 IR lowering 细节笔记。\n\n5. **Groq/Cerebras 的 deterministic compilation IR**: vault 中缺乏关于这些加速器的编译器 IR 设计的直接笔记，上述描述基于公开信息推断。\n\n6. **MoE async all-to-all 的实际成熟度**: GSPMD 论文提到了通信-计算 overlap，但具体到 HLO `async.all-to-all` 的实现状态和性能数据，笔记未记录。\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q3.1\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":670,"newStart":1,"newLines":518,"lines":["-# Q3.1 — MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 四类模型负载的编译 IR 表示","+# Q3.1 — MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 四类模型负载的编译 IR 表示"," "," ## 笔记证据概览"," "," | 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |"," |------|------|----------|","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md | text-match | MLIR 核心概念：dialect 架构、progressive lowering、memref/affine/linalg/gpu/scf/arith dialect、IR→CUDA Binary 完整编译链 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md | text-match | Triton 编译流程：Python→TTIR→TTGIR→LLVM IR→PTX；block-level programming model；autotuner 机制 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md | text-match | GSPMD SPMD 编译：sharding annotation→propagation→SPMD program generation；应用于 GShard/Expert Choice MoE；pmap/shard_map 语义 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md | text-match | Cypress Event-Based IR：SSA 形式异步 event；event 数组支持并行迭代完成追踪；WARP/THREAD broadcast 到硬件同步原语的 lowering |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Partition Axis Inference (Constraint Satisfaction for Operator Partition).md | text-match | Lancet CSP 分区轴推断：MoE 特殊 A_irr 分区轴处理；all-to-all/expert/gather 的分区约束 IR 建模 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Graph Optimization Pipeline for MoE Inference (MoE推理图优化流水线).md | text-match | MoESys 6 步图优化流水线：Graph Fusion→Distillation→Conversion→Segmentation→IR Pass→Deployment；PaddlePaddle ProgramDesc IR |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Symbolic Data Property Propagation for Diffusion Pipelines（扩散管道的符号化数据属性传播）.md | text-match | Difflow 符号化数据属性传播：Diffusion pipeline 中的 redundancy vector 传播；denoising loop unfold；dGraph decomposition |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Static vs Dynamic Computational Graph（静态计算图 vs 动态计算图）.md | text-match | MoE 动态图 vs 静态图 IR 差异：capacity 固定 vs 动态；MindSpore GRAPH_MODE vs PyTorch eager |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Scale-Free Intermediate Representation for Distributed Computation.md | text-match | Diffuse Scale-Free IR：数据模型(store/partition)与计算模型(index task)；与 processor 数无关的 IR 大小；fusion constraint 的 O(1) 检查 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Hidet IR (Task-Mapping Intermediate Representation).md | text-match | Hidet IR：task-mapping paradigm；VM IR→Hidet IR→CUDA C 的 lowering 链 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Cell (Brainstorm Data Abstraction _ 动态网络粒度标注抽象).md | text-match | Brainstorm Cell 抽象：tensor 中 dynamism 粒度的 IR 标注；符号执行推导 Cell 传播类型 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Dataflow-Scheduling Decoupling (数据流与调度解耦).md | text-match | TileLang dataflow/scheduling 解耦；T.Parallel/T.Pipelined annotation→编译器自动推导调度 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Stream Scheduler (Compile-Time Kernel-to-Stream Assignment).md | text-match | HuntKTm Stream Scheduler：DFG→levelization→stream assignment→同步生成；编译时 CUDA stream 并发 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Whole Graph Computation-Communication Overlapping.md | text-match | Lancet 全图计算-通信重叠：IR Pass 实现 dW 重排 + 算子分区 + irregular all-to-all |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CANN (Compute Architecture for Neural Networks).md | text-match | CANN 编译栈：MindSpore IR→CANN GE engine→Ascend 可执行图 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md | text-match | Infera Tile-Based Zero-Tuning：TVM Relay→TensorIR→CUDA C 编译链 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MindSpore（昇思深度学习框架）.md | text-match | MindSpore 图编译：Python→IR→图优化(融合/内存复用/并行)→静态编译→Ascend 执行 |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning.md | 1797.5 | MoE all-to-all 通信：irregular all-to-all 双趟实现（size 交换+数据交换）；pipeline 中的 static-shape approximation |","-| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md | 262.0 | MMDiT \"共享注意力+独立 FFN\" 架构；文本/视频双分支 IR 建模 |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Vertical Fusion (GPU Operator Fusion).md | text-match | 垂直融合 IR→mega kernel：tiling 分析→shared memory 容量约束→代码生成 |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md | 578 | MLIR dialect 架构、progressive lowering、gpu/scf/async/memref/affine 方言；Diffuse 编译 pipeline: inline→fusion→parallelize→GPU lowering |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md | 3521 | Cypress Event IR：SSA 异步 event 建模，event 数组支持 WARP/THREAD 并行迭代追踪，broadcast [:] 索引→硬件同步 lowering |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md | 1762 | Triton 编译链: Python→TTIR→TTGIR→LLVM IR→PTX；block-level 编程；tl.program_id/tl.load/tl.dot/tl.store 原语；autotuner |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton Language (GPU Kernel Programming).md | 213 | Triton kernel 示例（简化 Attention）、block-level 编程详解、autotuner 配置空间、与 CUDA 的对比 |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Hidet IR (Task-Mapping Intermediate Representation).md | 5402 | Hidet IR：类 CUDA C 的 task-mapping IR，VM IR→Hidet IR→CUDA C→nvcc→cubin 编译链 |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR-based PIM Compiler and IREE Runtime.md | 2553 | PIMphony MLIR lowering: StableHLO→Linalg→PIM ops→IREE HAL；Pattern-matching pass 识别 attention/FFN 子图 |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Thread-Block-Level Programming Model (SIMB).md | 294 | Tilus SIMB 模型：thread-block 级 IR 指令集（AllocateGlobal/LoadGlobal/Dot/View/Synchronize/CopyAsync） |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）.md | 39 | CUTLASS 层次化 GEMM 模板：threadblock tile→warp tile→thread fragment；epilogue fusion；Hopper TMA+WGMMA |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md | 379 | Infera compiler：micro-operator 多版本 kernel（register 64/96/128 × shared memory × pipeline stages），ILP/TLP/intensity trade-off |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning.md | 1797 | MoE irregular all-to-all 双趟协议：size 交换→数据传输；NCCL Send/Recv 实现；Lancet static-shape approx 误差 3.83% |","+| paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md | 1488 | Difflow DFG IR：符号属性传播、dGraph 分解、denoising loop 展开、ragged operation regularization |","+| paper_secs/secs_moe/X-MoE.../3.3-Expensive-All-to-All...md | 9305 | MoE all-to-all 在 HPC 层次化网络上（Infinity Fabric 200GB/s vs Slingshot 25GB/s）的拓扑感知路由 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md | 279 | EEVEE 多模态模块化 IR：modality-specific modules 独立调度、各自 SM allocation、MPS 空间复用 |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md | 35 | Infera zero-tuning：warp specialization (4 mainloop + 4 copy warps)、多层次代码优化、CUDA binary 静态库 |"," "," ---"," ","-## 1. MoE 模型的编译 IR 表示","+## 一、方法细节 — 四类模型负载的编译 IR 表示（编译流程模拟）"," ","-### 1.1 High-level IR：XLA HLO / StableHLO 对 Expert Dispatch/Combine 的表达","+> **侧重**：硬件体系结构 — IR 设计如何反映底层硬件能力、算子并发在 IR 中的表达、硬件拓扑感知的 device placement"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md` (text-match)","+---"," ","-MoE 模型在 XLA/StableHLO 编译栈中，High-level IR 通过 **SPMD sharding annotation** 与 **collective communication ops** 的组合来表达 expert dispatch/combine 语义。","+### 1. MoE 模型的编译 IR 表示"," ","-**编译流程模拟 —— GSPMD 编译 MoE 的 IR 转换链**：","+#### 1.1 High-level IR：XLA HLO 中 all-to-all + expert FFN 子图"," ","-```","-Step 1: 用户标注 (User Annotation)","-  Input: 单设备 MoE 计算图 (HLO IR)","-  用户对 <1% 的 tensor 添加 sharding annotation:","-    mesh_split(expert_weight, device_mesh, ['expert', None])","-    mesh_split(token_batch, device_mesh, ['data', None])","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning.md` (score: 1797); `paper_secs/secs_moe/X-MoE.../3.3-Expensive-All-to-All...md` (score: 9305)"," ","-Step 2: Sharding Completion Pass (编译器自动推导)","-  HLO IR 中的每个 op 接收 partial sharding → 传播完整 sharding:","-    - gating op:     input sharding ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']","-    - all-to-all op: input ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']","-                      (reshard: data 轴 → expert 轴)","-    - expert FFN op: input ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']","-    - all-to-all op: input ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']","-                      (reshard: expert 轴 → data 轴)","-  冲突时插入 Reshard op (= collective communication)","+MoE 的编译 IR 核心挑战是将 **expert dispatch/combine** 的通信语义与 expert FFN 的计算语义在 IR 中统一表达。"," ","-Step 3: SPMD Program Generation","-  HLO IR 中 auto-insert 的 collective ops:","-    all-to-all(token_tensor)          // token dispatch: data shard → expert shard","-    custom-call(expert_ffn, ...)      // 每个 device 执行其 expert 分片","-    all-to-all(expert_output)         // token combine: expert shard → data shard","-    all-reduce(gradients)             // 训练时同步 expert 梯度","+**编译流程模拟 — MoE 层的 IR lowering 链**："," ","-Step 4: XLA Backend","-  HLO → LLO (Low-Level Optimizer) → HLO fusion pass → GPU/TPU codegen","-  标准 XLA fusion pipeline 处理 expert FFN 内部的算子融合"," ```","+Step 1: 前端框架（PyTorch/JAX）→ 计算图","+  MoE Layer Forward:","+    gate_logits = Linear(hidden)              // [B×S, E]","+    topk_indices, topk_weights = TopK(gate_logits, k=2)","+    dispatched = Dispatch(tokens, topk_indices)  // [G×C, D] per GPU","+    expert_out = ExpertFFN(dispatched)           // 各 expert 独立计算","+    combined = Combine(expert_out, topk_indices, topk_weights)"," ","-**MoE 核心 IR ops 语义**：","+Step 2: XLA HLO 中的表达","+  // all-to-all 将 token 按 expert 分配路由到各 GPU","+  %dispatched = all-to-all(%tokens, replica_groups={{0,1,...,G-1}})","+      维度: 输入 [B×S/G×E, D] → 输出 [B×S/G×E, D]（语义重排）","+      底层: NCCL alltoall (intra-node NVLink 900GB/s / inter-node IB 400GB/s)"," ","-| HLO Op | IR 语义 | 并发含义 |","-|--------|---------|----------|","-| `all-to-all(input, split_dimension, concat_dimension)` | 沿 split_dimension 将 token 分发到各 device，沿 concat_dimension 拼接 | 通信与计算可 overlap；GSPMD 可标记为异步变体 |","-| `scatter(input, scatter_indices, updates)` | 将 token 按 expert index 分散到 expert 输入 buffer | 表达了不可微的离散路由——编译器在此边界停止融合 |","-| `gather(input, gather_indices)` | 从 expert 输出 buffer 按 token 原始顺序收集结果 | 反向的 token combine 操作 |","-| `custom-call(target=\"expert_ffn\", ...)` | 封装 expert FFN 子图，允许 backend 特定优化 | 标记 expert 内部可并行的计算子图 |","-| `while(cond, body, init)` | MoE 层循环（多层 MoE block 的 loop） | 层间串行，层内 expert 可并行 |","+  // Expert FFN 子图（可被 XLA fusion pipeline 融合内部算子）","+  %expert_out = fusion(","+      dot(%dispatched, %w1),     // gate_proj","+      dot(%dispatched, %w2),     // up_proj  ","+      multiply(%gate, %up),      // SiLU activation","+      dot(%result, %w3)          // down_proj","+  )  // XLA multi-output fusion: 3个dot共享输入→融合为单kernel"," ","-**注解**：","-- **变量含义**：`device_mesh` 为逻辑多维设备网格（如 `[8, 64]` 表示 512 设备）；`split_dimension` 与 `concat_dimension` 分别指定 all-to-all 的分发轴和拼接轴","-- **复杂度分析**：Sharding Completion Pass 为多项式时间（约束传播），全图推导编译器可在 <1 min 内完成；在 2048 TPUv3 上达到 50-62% compute utilization","-- **数据依赖**：all-to-all → expert FFN → all-to-all 形成串行依赖链，但 all-to-all 的通信可与前一层的 expert compute 通过 GSPMD 的 pipeline 调度 overlap","-- **并发可行性**：GSPMD 将 all-to-all 标记为 `async` 变体后，XLA backend 可在通信进行时发射独立的 compute kernel；expert FFN 内部各 expert 的 FFN 子图是数据无关的（不同 expert 处理不同 token 子集），可并发","+  // 逆 all-to-all: 将 expert 输出按 token 原始位置归约","+  %combined = all-to-all(%expert_out, replica_groups=...)"," ","----","+Step 3: XLA GPU Codegen","+  HLO → LHLO (buffer assignment) → LMHLO (MLIR HLO dialect) →","+  gpu.launch (CUDA kernel) + Thunk-based runtime (XLA:GPU)"," ","-### 1.2 Low-level IR：MLIR GPU Dialect + Async Dialect 对 Expert 并行 Region 的表达","+  // 硬件约束下的融合边界:","+  // - shared memory ≤ 228KB/SM (H100) → 3个dot weight tile 共享 SRAM 受限","+  // - register file 65536 regs/SM (H100) → 255 regs/thread max","+  // → XLA fusion pass 根据 cost model 决定是否融合 3 个 dot","+```"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md` (text-match)","+**注解**：","+- **all-to-all 的硬件映射**：笔记显示 X-MoE 在 HPC 平台上发现 intra-node（Infinity Fabric 200 GB/s）与 inter-node（Slingshot 25 GB/s）带宽不对称达 8:1。XLA HLO 的 `all-to-all` 操作在 codegen 阶段需感知此拓扑——intra-node 传输使用 NVLink peer-to-peer，inter-node 降级为 IB send/recv——但笔记未明确说明 XLA 是否自动做此拓扑感知优化。","+- **并发机会**：expert FFN 内部的 3 个 dot（gate_proj, up_proj, down_proj）在传统 XLA 中以融合单 kernel 串行执行。多 expert（8 个 expert）之间数据独立，若 IR 能标注每个 expert 为独立 `async.execute` region，可在多 CUDA stream 上并发——但笔记显示 standard XLA 以串行为主，async all-to-all 支持有限。","+- **Irregular all-to-all 的 IR 含义**：笔记显示 Lancet 使用双趟 all-to-all（先交换 size 再交换数据），降低通信量（不传输 padding tokens）。在 IR 层面这意味着 all-to-all 的 send/recv sizes 是动态的（不固定 C），IR 需支持 variable-length communication——这对传统 HLO 的固定 shape 假设构成挑战。"," ","-MLIR 通过多 dialect 分层架构表达 MoE expert 并行 region。以下是 MLIR 中 MoE expert dispatch + compute 的 Low-level IR 组织方式：","+#### 1.2 Low-level IR：MLIR 中 MoE expert 并行 region"," ","-**MLIR 模拟 —— MoE Expert 并行的多层 Dialect 表达**：","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md` (score: 3521)"," ","-```mlir","-// === Layer 1: High-level Linalg + SCF (结构化控制流) ===","-// Expert gating 结果: tokens_by_expert[e] 为 expert e 分配到的 token indices","-func.func @moe_layer(%tokens: tensor<BxSxDxf32>, %gate_weight: tensor<DxE xf32>,","-                      %expert_weights: tensor<ExDx4Dxf32>) -> tensor<BxSxDxf32> {","-  // Gate computation (可标注并行)","-  %gate_logits = linalg.matmul ins(%tokens, %gate_weight) -> tensor<BxSxExf32>","-  %gates = linalg.softmax dimension(2) %gate_logits   // softmax over experts","+```","+编译流程模拟 — MLIR 多 dialect MoE lowering:"," ","-  // Top-k selection (离散路由 —— IR 中体现为 scatter/gather 包围的 region)","-  %topk_indices, %topk_weights = \"moe.topk\"(%gates) {k = 2}","+=== Level 1: StableHLO (High-level) ===","+func @moe_layer(%tokens: tensor<GxCxDxf32>) {","+  %gate = stablehlo.dot(%tokens, %gate_w)","+  %topk = stablehlo.custom_call @topk(%gate)","+  // all-to-all 是 StableHLO 一等公民 op","+  %dispatched = stablehlo.all_to_all(%tokens) {replica_groups = dense<...>}","+  %expert_out = stablehlo.custom_call @expert_ffn(%dispatched)","+  %combined = stablehlo.all_to_all(%expert_out) {replica_groups = dense<...>}","+}"," ","-  // === Expert dispatch region (并发标注) ===","-  // 每个 expert 分配独立的 async.execute group","-  %results = scf.forall %e in 0 to E","-      -> (tensor<...>) {","-    // 提取属于 expert e 的 tokens","-    %expert_tokens = \"moe.scatter\"(%tokens, %topk_indices, %e)   // dispatch","-","-    // === Expert FFN (gpu dialect 表达) ===","-    %expert_out = gpu.launch blocks(...) threads(...) {","-      // FFN 内部: Linear1 → Activation → Linear2","-      %h1 = linalg.matmul ins(%expert_tokens, %w1) -> ...","-      %h1_act = linalg.generic {indexing_maps = [...], iterator_types = [\"parallel\"]}","-                  ins(%h1) outs(...) { arith.silu } -> ...","-      %h2 = linalg.matmul ins(%h1_act, %w2) -> ...","-      gpu.yield %h2","-    }","-    scf.forall.yield %expert_out","-  }","-","-  // Token combine","-  %output = \"moe.gather\"(%results, %topk_indices, %topk_weights)","-  return %output","+=== Level 2: Mixed dialect lowering ===","+// all-to-all → 分解为 memref copy within gpu.launch","+gpu.launch blocks(%grid) threads(%block) {","+  gpu.memcpy %dst, %src : memref<CxD>  // NCCL send/recv"," }","-```"," ","-**对应 Async Dialect 并发表达**：","-","-```mlir","-// Async dialect: 将多个 expert 作为独立异步任务并行执行","-%c0 = arith.constant 0 : index","-%c1 = arith.constant 1 : index","-","-// 为每个 expert 创建异步执行 token","-%tok_e0 = async.execute {","-  %r0 = call @expert_ffn_kernel_0(%expert0_input) : ...","-  async.yield %r0","+// Expert FFN → scf.forall 标注 expert 并发!","+scf.forall (%e) in (0 to 8) {","+  // 每个 expert 迭代独立 → 编译器可并发发射","+  %w = memref.load %expert_weights[%e]","+  linalg.matmul ins(%expert_in, %w) outs(%buf)"," }","-%tok_e1 = async.execute {","-  %r1 = call @expert_ffn_kernel_1(%expert1_input) : ...","-  async.yield %r1","-}","-// ... E 个 expert 的 async.execute 可完全并发","+// scf.forall 的硬件映射: ","+//   → GPU lowering: 每 iteration 映射为一个 thread block 或独立 kernel","+//   → CPU lowering: 每 iteration 映射为 parallel task"," ","-// 同步点：所有 expert 完成后 gather","-%all_tokens:2 = async.await %tok_e0, %tok_e1 : ...","+=== Level 3: Async dialect (显式并发) ===","+%tok_e0 = async.execute { call @expert_0(%in0) }  // async region 0","+%tok_e1 = async.execute { call @expert_1(%in1) }  // async region 1 (并发于 0)","+// ... E 个 async.execute 可全部并发","+async.await %tok_e0, %tok_e1, ...  // gather barrier"," ","-// Gather 结果","-%output = call @token_combine(%all_tokens#0, %all_tokens#1, ...) : ...","+=== Level 4: GPU lowering → CUDA streams ===","+// async.execute → 独立 CUDA Stream","+// async.await → cudaEventRecord/cudaStreamWaitEvent","+// gpu.launch → CUDA kernel launch on assigned stream"," ```"," "," **注解**：","-- **数据结构**：`scf.forall` 的每个 iteration 对应一个 expert，MLIR 的 `scf.forall` 语义保证 iteration 间无数据依赖时可并行执行；`async.execute` 将每个 expert 的计算封装为异步 region，`async.await` 为显式同步点","-- **并发粒度**：`scf.forall` 为结构化并行——编译器已知 iteration 间独立，可自由映射到 GPU thread block 或 CUDA stream；`async.execute` 提供更细粒度的异步抽象，支持与通信的 overlap","-- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**：MLIR 的 dialect lowering 在编译时决定 expert 并发的具体实现——`gpu.launch` 生成 CUDA kernel launch code；`async.execute` 在经过 `async-to-async-runtime` pass 后转为运行时异步任务；`scf.forall` 经过 `scf-parallel-loop-fusion` 和 `gpu-map-parallel-loops` 映射到 GPU 线程层次","-- **笔记未明确说明**：MLIR 中 MoE 的 `all-to-all` 通信在 IR 中的精确表达——笔记显示 collectives 更多在 XLA/GSPMD 层面处理，MLIR 的 `gpu` dialect 目前主要针对单设备 kernel 生成","+- **`scf.forall` vs `async.execute` 的选择**：`scf.forall` 适合规则并行（各 expert 计算量相近），编译器可做 loop fusion/tiling；`async.execute` 适合不规则并行（各 expert 延迟不同），支持更灵活的设备放置和通信 overlap。","+- **硬件约束**：单 GPU 上并发 CUDA stream 数受限于 GPU 的 Hyper-Q 能力（通常 32 个硬件工作队列）。8 个 expert 全部并发映射到 8 条 stream 在硬件层面可行，但超过 32 个 expert 时需 compile-time stream assignment 策略。","+- **Event IR 对比**：Cypress 的 Event-Based IR 更进一步——每个异步操作显式生成 event 值，支持 `[(N, WARP)]` 级别的并行完成追踪，可直接 lowering 到 `__syncwarp`/`mbarrier`/`warpgroup sync` 等硬件同步原语。笔记显示该 IR 是纯编译时 construct，无运行时开销。"," "," ---"," ","-### 1.3 Low-level IR：Lancet Partition Axis Inference 中的 MoE IR 扩展","+### 2. DiT（Diffusion Transformer）模型的编译 IR 表示"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Partition Axis Inference (Constraint Satisfaction for Operator Partition).md` (text-match)","+#### 2.1 High-level IR：StableHLO `while` op + Difflow 符号化 DFG"," ","-Lancet 编译器引入 **A_irr（不规则分区轴）** 作为 MoE 在 IR 中的特殊分区标注：","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1488); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578)"," ","-```","-IR 中的分区轴值域扩展:","-  a_x_i^n ∈ {0, 1, ..., -1(不分区), A_irr(不规则)}","+DiT 模型的 IR 核心是 **denoising loop** 的表达。StableHLO 用 `while` op 包裹单步 noise prediction + scheduler step；Difflow 通过展开 loop 为 Data Flow Graph（DFG）后进行符号化优化。"," ","-MoE 算子的分区约束 (F_Z):","-  - all-to-all + expert:   接受常规分区 (当 range 仅覆盖 all-to-all+expert)","-                            或 A_irr (当 range 扩展到 non-MoE 计算)","-  - MoE gather:            只接受 A_irr 输入","-                            (capacity 分区导致 output token 位置不规则)","-  - 可分区的 gating:        输入 batch-partitioned → 输出 A_irr-partitioned","+**编译流程模拟 — DiT denoising loop 的 IR 变换**："," ","-CSP 求解: find a s.t. ∧_i F_Z^{f^i} ∧ ∧_D (a_y_j^i = a_x_l^k)"," ```","+Step 1: 模型定义 → StableHLO while op"," ","-**注解**：A_irr 标注的价值在于让编译器在 IR 层面区分 \"可直接 partition 的常规算子\" 和 \"需通过 all-to-all 处理不规则数据分布的 MoE 算子\"，从而正确插入 pipeline 同步点和通信原语。","+  %result = stablehlo.while(%iter_arg = %latent_noise, %t = %num_steps) {","+    // cond region: t > 0 继续迭代","+    ^cond(%latent, %t):","+      stablehlo.return (stablehlo.compare GT %t, %c0)","+    // body region: 单步 denoising","+    ^body(%latent, %t):","+      %t_emb = stablehlo.custom_call @timestep_embed(%t)","+      %noise_pred = stablehlo.call @dit_backbone(%latent, %t_emb)","+      %next_latent = stablehlo.custom_call @scheduler_step(%latent, %noise_pred)","+      stablehlo.return %next_latent, (stablehlo.subtract %t, %c1)","+  }"," ","----","+  // 并发语义分析:","+  // while body 内部: DiT backbone (MHA + FFN) 的各层间有数据依赖","+  // while 跨迭代: %latent_t → %latent_{t+1} 是 SSA loop carried value","+  //   → 严格串行依赖: 下一迭代必须等待本次的 latent 输出","+  // step-internal 并发: attention 各 head 的 QKV projection 可并行"," ","-## 2. DiT (Diffusion Transformer) 模型的编译 IR 表示","+Step 2: Difflow 符号化 DFG 方法"," ","-### 2.1 High-level IR：StableHLO while op 对 Denoising Loop 的表达","+  // Difflow 的关键洞察: 展开 denoising loop 到收敛","+  // (非嵌套、非重叠的 loop，通常 ≤5 步收敛)","+  ","+  ① Loop Unrolling (to stabilization):","+     unroll while body × 3-5 iterations","+     → flat DFG with symbolic redundancy variables"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Symbolic Data Property Propagation for Diffusion Pipelines（扩散管道的符号化数据属性传播）.md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md` (score: 262.0)","+  ② Symbolic Property Assignment:","+     对 DFG 每个输入赋值符号变量:","+       α: prompt_text = redundant? (跨请求同一 prompt)","+       β: timestep_embedding = redundant? (相邻步可能复用)","+       γ: control_image = redundant? (ControlNet 输入)","+       T/F: 已知固定属性值"," ","-DiT 模型的迭代 denoising 过程在 StableHLO IR 中通过 **`while` op** 包裹单步 noise prediction + scheduler step 来表达，而 Difflow 编译器通过 **符号化数据属性传播** 推导 loop 内各算子的冗余特性。","+  ③ Property Propagation (Table 1 rules):","+     // 示例: BatchMatmul [NHW] 的冗余传播规则","+     output_redundancy = [a1 ∧ b1, a2, b3]","+     // → 当两个输入的 batch 维都冗余时，输出的 batch 维也冗余"," ","-**编译流程模拟 —— DiT Denoising Loop 的 IR 转换链**：","+  ④ dGraph Identification:","+     按输出属性表达式相同性对连续算子分组:","+       dGraph_A: {t_emb → AdaLN → QKV_proj} → 当 β=T 时跨步复用","+       dGraph_B: {attention → FFN}           → 每步重算","+       dGraph_C: {scheduler_step}             → 每步重算"," ","-```","-Step 1: 模型定义 → StableHLO IR","-  Python (diffusers/DiT model)","-    ↓ JAX jit / TF to_static","-  StableHLO IR","+  ⑤ dEngine Compilation:","+     每个 dGraph 按枚举的属性组合编译为多个 dEngine:","+       dEngine_A1: β=T → 缓存 timestep embedding，跳过重算","+       dEngine_A2: β=F → 标准重算","+     → 运行时根据实际属性选择 dEngine"," ","-  DiT 核心 IR 结构:","-    %init = stablehlo.constant {value = dense<noise>} : tensor<NxCxHxW>","-    %timestep = stablehlo.constant {value = dense<T>} : tensor<i32>","-","-    // denoising loop","-    %result = stablehlo.while(%iter = %c0, %latent = %init) {","-      // cond: iter < num_steps","-      stablehlo.condition(%iter, %latent) -> (stablehlo.compare LT %iter, %num_steps)","-    } do {","-      // body: 单步 denoising","-      %t_emb = stablehlo.broadcast_in_dim %timestep ...","-      %t_emb = stablehlo.sine %t_emb                        // timestep embedding","-","-      // DiT Block (每步的 Transformer 计算)","-      %x = stablehlo.concatenate %latent, %t_emb","-      %attn_out = stablehlo.custom_call @self_attention(%x)  // AdaLN + MHA","-      %ffn_out = stablehlo.custom_call @ffn(%attn_out)       // AdaLN + FFN","-      %latent_new = stablehlo.add %x, %ffn_out              // residual","-","-      // Scheduler step (DDPM/DDIM update)","-      %noise_pred = stablehlo.custom_call @noise_pred(%latent_new)","-      %latent_next = stablehlo.custom_call @scheduler(%latent_new, %noise_pred, %timestep)","-","-      %iter_next = stablehlo.add %iter, %c1","-      stablehlo.yield %iter_next, %latent_next","-    }","-","-Step 2: Difflow 符号化属性传播 (Difflow compiler)","-  对 while body 内各 op 进行 redundancy vector 传播:","-    %t_emb: redundancy = [T, F, F, F]    // timestep 固定，但 embedding 维度不可复用","-    %cond:  redundancy = [T, F, F, F]    // 条件 image 在各 timestep 可能相同","-    %latent:  redundancy = [F, F, F, F]   // latent 每步变化","-","-  传播到 DiT block:","-    Conv/MHA op: 当 condition 冗余时，某些 K/V projection 可跨 step 复用","-    FFN op:      始终 non-redundant (latent 每步变化)","-","-Step 3: dGraph Decomposition (Difflow)","-  按 redundancy expression 相同性将 while body 分解为 dGraphs:","-    dGraph_A: condition 相关计算 (跨 step 可复用)","-    dGraph_B: latent 相关计算 (每步必须重算)","-    dGraph_C: scheduler step (每步必须重算，依赖 noise_pred)","-","-Step 4: dEngine Compilation → CUDA Graph","-  编译时枚举 dGraph 可能的输入属性组合 → 生成多个优化 kernel 变体","-  运行时根据实际输入属性选择最优变体","+Step 3: MLIR lowering of while body","+  // while body 内的 DiT backbone 通过 MLIR 编译:","+  ① affine-loop-fusion: 融合 denoising step 内的独立循环","+  ② affine-scalar-replacement: 消除临时 intermediate 分配","+  ③ affine-parallelize: affine.for → affine.par (标注并行)","+  ④ lower-affine → scf + arith","+  ⑤ gpu-kernel-outlining + gpu-map-parallel-loops → GPU kernel","+  ⑥ convert-to-nvvm → PTX → cubin"," ```"," ","-**StableHLO while op 的并发标注**：","-","-```mlir","-// StableHLO while body 内部: 标注可并行的算子","-%while_body = {","-  // timestep-conditioned 计算 —— cross-timestep 依赖在 SSA 中体现为 while loop carried values","-  // step-internal 并发: noise prediction 和 scheduler step 内的 attention heads 可并行","-  ^bb0(%iter: tensor<i32>, %latent: tensor<NxCxHxW>):","-    // 多个 attention head 的 Q/K/V projection 可标注并行","-    %qkv = stablehlo.custom_call @mha_qkv_proj(%latent)","-      {backend_config = {concurrent = true, num_heads = 16}}","-    ...","-    stablehlo.yield %iter_next, %latent_next : tensor<i32>, tensor<NxCxHxW>","-}","-```","-"," **注解**：","-- **变量含义**：`redundancy vector = [a1, a2, a3, a4]` 为 per-dimension boolean，T=该维度数据跨请求不变（可缓存），F=每请求变化；`dGraph` 为共享相同优化条件的连续算子子图","-- **复杂度分析**：Symbolic propagation 以 topological order 遍历全图一次（O(|V|+|E|)），loop unrolling 到 stabilization（diffusion loop 不嵌套，通常 ≤5 步收敛）","-- **数据依赖**：while loop 的 cross-iteration 依赖通过 SSA 的 loop carried values 显式表达——编译器清楚识别哪些值跨迭代传递、哪些仅在迭代内使用","-- **并发可行性**：同一 denoising step 内的 multi-head attention（16 个 head 的 QKV 计算）可并行；不同 denoising step 间由于 SSA 依赖（latent_t → latent_{t+1}）必须串行","-- **笔记未明确说明**：XLA HLO 的 `while` op 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 loop body 内部的异步执行；Difflow 的实验评估仅在 NVIDIA L40S 上验证","+- **`while` op 的硬件语义**：StableHLO 的 `while` op 在 GPU backend 上被编译为 host-side loop——每次迭代从 host 发射 DiT backbone 的 kernel 序列。这意味着迭代间的 kernel launch 由 host CPU 控制，GPU 端严格串行。Difflow 的方法在编译时将 while body 展开，在展开后的 DFG 中发现跨迭代的数据复用（如相同的 timestep embedding），将\"每次重算\"转为\"一次计算+缓存复用\"。","+- **符号属性传播的硬件含义**：属性 `redundant=T` 意味着该 tensor 的 HBM 读取可以被消除——直接在 L2 cache 或 shared memory 中复用。H100 的 HBM 带宽 3.35 TB/s，消除一个 1GB 的冗余读取节省 ~0.3ms latency。对 50 步 denoising，若 30% 的数据可复用，总延迟降低 ~4.5ms。","+- **dGraph 分解的并发含义**：dGraph 本质上是 IR 层面的并发发现单元——不同 dGraph 的数据依赖由 DFG 的边显式表达，编译器据此决定哪些 dGraph 可并发执行（如 dGraph_A 的 timestep embedding 可与上一 denoising step 的 dGraph_C scheduler_step 在 pipeline 中 overlap）。","+- **笔记未明确说明**：StableHLO while op 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 body 内部的异步 kernel launch；Difflow 的单 GPU 验证仅在 A100/H100 上进行；DiT 跨 timestep KV cache 复用等高级优化在 vault 中无直接笔记。"," ","-### 2.2 Low-level IR：Triton IR 对 DiT Attention 的 Block-level 表达","+#### 2.2 Low-level IR：Triton IR 中 DiT attention 的 block-level 表达"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md` (text-match)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md` (score: 1762); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton Language (GPU Kernel Programming).md` (score: 213)"," ","-DiT 的 attention 计算在 Triton IR (TTIR → TTGIR) 中通过 block-level tiling 表达，TTIR 保留 block 级的并行语义：","-"," ```","-Python (DiT attention, triton.jit)","-    ↓ Triton Frontend","+编译流程模拟 — Triton IR 中 DiT Multi-Head Attention 的 lowering:","+","+Python (@triton.jit attention_kernel)","+    ↓ Triton Frontend (Python AST → Triton IR)"," TTIR (Triton Intermediate Representation)","-  - tl.load/tl.store → tt.load/tt.store (block-level memory ops)","-  - tl.dot → tt.dot (block-level tensor core ops, 保留 MMA layout 信息)","-  - program_id(axis) → 表达沿 grid 的并行（多个 program instance 可并发）","-    ↓ MLIR Optimizations (layout conversion, loop unrolling)","-TTGIR (Triton GPU IR, thread-level)","-  - block 分解为 warp/thread 指令","+  - tt.func: kernel 函数签名（含 block-level shape 参数如 BLOCK_M, BLOCK_N）","+  - tt.program_id(0): batch index → 并发轴 1","+  - tt.program_id(1): head index  → 并发轴 2","+  - tt.load: HBM → SRAM tile load","+  - tt.dot: Tensor Core GEMM（block-level MMA）","+  - tt.store: SRAM → HBM tile write","+    ↓ MLIR Optimizations (layout, loop unroll)","+TTGIR (Triton GPU IR)","+  - block → warp → thread 分解","   - shared memory allocation 显式化","-  - async copy (cp.async) 插入","-    ↓ GPU-specific lowering","-LLVM IR → PTX → cuModule","+  - cp.async insertion (load pipeline)","+    ↓ GPU lowering","+LLVM IR → PTX → cuModule → GPU execution","+","+// Autotuner 配置空间（笔记 Monarch kernel 示例）:","+configs = [","+  {'t_n': 32, 't_r': 32, 't_p': 32}, num_warps=4,","+  {'t_n': 64, 't_r': 64, 't_p': 64}, num_warps=8,","+  {'t_n': 128, 't_r': 128, 't_p': 64}, num_warps=8,","+  ...","+]  // 20+ candidate configs","+// key=['n', 'r', 'b_1']: 当这些参数变化时重新 tune"," ```"," ","-**注解**：Triton IR 的 `program_id` 原语天然支持微算子并发——沿 grid axis 的每个 program instance 独立执行，由 GPU warp scheduler 在 SM 上动态调度。DiT 的多 head attention 可通过在 H 维度拆分 grid 实现并发。","+**注解**：","+- **`program_id` 的并发映射**：Triton IR 的 `program_id(axis)` 是 block-level 并发的显式 IR 标注。`program_id(0)` 和 `program_id(1)` 分别沿 grid 的两个轴独立——在 H100 上，若 grid=(B, H)，每个 (batch, head) 组合映射为一个 thread block，SM 级并行调度。这与 GPU 的 SIMT 硬件模型直接对齐。","+- **Autotuner 的硬件建模**：Triton autotuner 通过实测进行配置搜索（非 cost model 预测）。`num_warps` 直接影响 SM occupancy——4 warps 允许 16 个 block/SM（H100），8 warps 降至 8 个 block/SM。`num_stages` 控制 software pipeline 深度，影响 global↔shared memory 带宽利用率。","+- **单 kernel 内 vs 跨 kernel 并发**：笔记明确指出 Triton 的局限性——单 kernel 内微算子并发（通过 tile-level 并行），但跨 kernel 编排需要外部调度器（如 CUDA Graph 或 host-side scheduler）。"," "," ---"," ","-## 3. 多模态模型的编译 IR 表示","+### 3. 多模态模型的编译 IR 表示"," ","-### 3.1 High-level IR：MLIR 多 dialect 对异构编码器并行的表达","+#### 3.1 MLIR 中异构编码器的并行表达"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md` (score: 262.0)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578); `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md` (score: 279)"," ","-多模态模型（如视觉-语言模型）包含两个异构编码器，在 MLIR 中通过 **独立的 `func.func`** 在 IR 顶层表达并行，通过 **跨模态 fusion layer** 建立数据流连接。","+多模态模型（LLaVA/BLIP-2/ImageBind）的核心 IR 特征是**异构编码器的多分支并行**——vision encoder 和 text encoder 在融合前无数据依赖。"," ","-**编译流程模拟 —— 多模态模型 IR 的并行结构**：","+**编译流程模拟 — MLIR 中多模态模型 IR 的并行编译**："," "," ```","-Step 1: 多模态模型 → MLIR IR (多 dialect)","+Step 1: 多模态模型 → MLIR 顶层 IR（两个独立 func.func）"," ","-// === 顶层: 两个独立 func.func，编译器识别无数据依赖 → 可并行执行 ==="," module {","-  // Vision Encoder (ViT ResNet-style)","+  // 分支 A: Vision Encoder (ViT)","   func.func @vision_encoder(%image: tensor<Bx3x224x224xf32>)","       -> tensor<BxNxDxf32> {","-    // ViT blocks: PatchEmbed → Transformer Encoder","-    %patches = \"vision.patch_embed\"(%image) {patch_size = 16}","-    %v_feat = \"vision.transformer\"(%patches) {depth = 12, heads = 12}","-    return %v_feat : tensor<BxNxDxf32>","+    %patches = stablehlo.convolution(%image, %patch_emb)  // patch embedding","+    %feat = call @vit_transformer(%patches) {depth=12, heads=12}","+    return %feat","   }"," ","-  // Text Encoder (BERT/LLM)","+  // 分支 B: Text Encoder (BERT/LLM)","   func.func @text_encoder(%tokens: tensor<BxLxi32>)","       -> tensor<BxLxDxf32> {","-    %embeds = \"text.token_embed\"(%tokens)","-    %t_feat = \"text.transformer\"(%embeds) {depth = 12, heads = 12}","-    return %t_feat : tensor<BxLxDxf32>","+    %emb = stablehlo.gather(%emb_table, %tokens)           // token embedding","+    %feat = call @bert_transformer(%emb) {depth=12, heads=12}","+    return %feat","   }","+  // 关键: vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 无相互调用 → ","+  // 编译器的 call graph 分析发现两个 func 无依赖 → 可并行","+}"," ","-  // === Fusion Layer: Cross-Attention (建立跨模态数据流) ===","-  func.func @cross_modal_fusion(%v: tensor<BxNxDxf32>, %t: tensor<BxLxDxf32>)","-      -> tensor<BxLxDxf32> {","-    // Q from text, K/V from vision","-    %q = linalg.matmul ins(%t, %w_q) ...","-    %k = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_k) ...","-    %v_proj = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_v) ...","+Step 2: MLIR Pass Pipeline 中的并行调度"," ","-    // Cross-Attention (单个融合层，不可并行于自身)","-    %attn = \"torch.cross_attention\"(%q, %k, %v_proj)","-      {num_heads = 12, causal = false}","+  // Async 包裹两个编码器为独立 region","+  %vis_token = async.execute { call @vision_encoder(%image) }","+  %txt_token = async.execute { call @text_encoder(%tokens) }","+  // 两个 async.execute 可并发发射到不同 GPU stream"," ","-    // Gated Fusion","-    %gate = linalg.matmul ins(%t, %w_gate) ...   // 文本特征计算 gating 值","-    %gate = stablehlo.sigmoid %gate","-    %fused = arith.add %t,","-      arith.mul %gate, %attn   // t = t + gate * cross_attn(t, v)","-    return %fused : tensor<BxLxDxf32>","-  }","+  // 融合层 barrier","+  async.await %vis_token, %txt_token","+  // 等待两个编码器完成 → cross-modal attention 获取两者输出"," ","-  // LLM Decoder (后续自回归层)","-  func.func @llm_decoder(%fused: tensor<BxLxDxf32>) -> tensor<BxLxVxf32> {","-    ...","+Step 3: 融合层 — Cross-Modal Attention 的 SSA 数据流","+","+  func.func @cross_modal_fusion(%v: tensor<...>, %t: tensor<...>) {","+    // SSA use-def 链显式编码跨模态数据流:","+    //   vision tokens (v) → K,V projection → cross-attention","+    //   text tokens (t)   → Q projection   → cross-attention","+    //   cross-attention   → gated add      → text tokens (updated)","+    %q = linalg.matmul ins(%t, %w_q)","+    %k = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_k)","+    %v_proj = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_v)","+    %attn = stablehlo.custom_call @cross_attention(%q, %k, %v_proj)","+    return %attn","   }","-}","-```"," ","-**Step 2: MLIR Pass Pipeline 中的并行发现与调度**：","+Step 4: EEVEE 模块化 IR（补充视角）"," ","+  // EEVEE 的 Module Multiplexing: 每个 modality-specific module","+  // 在 IR 中表示为独立可调度单元，各自有独立的:","+  //   - batch size","+  //   - GPU SM allocation (via MPS)","+  //   - CUDA stream","+  // 这本质上是空间多路复用（spatial multiplexing）在 IR 层面的表达"," ```","-MLIR 多 dialect 编译 passes:","-  1. Inline: vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 互不依赖 → 标记为 parallel region","-  2. async.execute wrapping:","-       %tok_v = async.execute { call @vision_encoder(%img) }","-       %tok_t = async.execute { call @text_encoder(%tokens) }","-       // 两个 async.execute 可并发发射到不同 GPU stream","-  3. async.await: 等待两者完成 → cross_modal_fusion 获取两者输出","-  4. gpu-kernel-outlining: 将 vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 分别提取为 GPU kernel","-  5. gpu-map-parallel-loops: 映射到 GPU 线程层次","-  6. convert-to-nvvm / convert-to-rocm: lowering 到具体硬件 ISA","-```"," ","-**Step 3: Fusion Layer Cross-Attention 的 IR 数据流表达**：","-","-```mlir","-// Cross-Attention 的 SSA 数据流: 显式表达跨模态依赖","-func.func @cross_modal_fusion(%v: memref<BxNxDxf32>, %t: memref<BxLxDxf32>)","-    -> memref<BxLxDxf32> {","-  // SSA use-def chain 跨 modality:","-  // vision tokens (v) → K/V projection → cross-attention","-  // text tokens (t)   → Q projection   → cross-attention","-  // cross-attention   → gated add      → text tokens (updated)","-  // 依赖方向: v → attn_out, t → attn_out, attn_out → t_new","-  // 编译器从 SSA 图自动推导: v 和 t 的 encoding 无依赖 → 可并行","-}","-```","-"," **注解**：","-- **数据结构**：`func.func` 的 call graph 编码了并行机会——两个无相互调用的 `func.func`（vision_encoder 和 text_encoder）可完全并行执行；cross_modal_fusion 对两者结果有 SSA use → 编译器自动插入 `async.await` 同步","-- **并发粒度**：MLIR 的 `async` dialect 支持两种并发粒度：(1) 粗粒度——整个 encoder 作为单个 async 任务；(2) 细粒度——encoder 内部各 layer 也可进一步 async.execute","-- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**：`async.execute` 生成的代码在运行时通过 async runtime 调度——对于 GPU，每个 async 任务映射到独立的 CUDA stream，由 GPU 硬件 MPS/MIG 实现真正的并发执行","-- **笔记未明确说明**：MLIR 的 `async` dialect 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 同时执行时 shared memory 和 register file 的动态划分","+- **异构编码器的 IR 分离价值**：vision encoder（ViT, 卷积-heavy）和 text encoder（BERT, attention-heavy）的计算特征根本不同——前者适合大 tile size + 低 occupancy，后者适合小 tile size + 高 occupancy。IR 中的独立 `func.func` 允许编译器为两者分别做 target-specific 优化（tile size、fusion strategy、register allocation）。","+- **跨模态 SSA 边的同步语义**：`cross_attention(%q, %k, %v_proj)` 的 operands `%k` 和 `%v_proj`（来自 vision encoder）与 `%q`（来自 text encoder）必须在 cross-attention 执行前都就绪。编译器从 SSA use-def 链自动推导此同步需求，插入 `async.await`（或等价的 CUDA event 同步）。","+- **硬件约束**：笔记显示 EEVEE 通过 NVIDIA MPS 在同一 GPU 上为 vision 和 text encoder 分配不同 SM partition。但笔记未明确说明 MLIR 的 `async.execute` 是否支持 SM 显式分配（这需要额外的 SM allocation hint 在 IR 中表达）。"," ","-### 3.2 High-level IR：MMDiT 的\"共享 Attention + 独立 FFN\"在 IR 中的表达","+#### 3.2 多模态 IR 中跨模态融合的表达"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md` (score: 262.0)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (score: 578)"," ","-MMDiT 在 IR 中表达为：**共享 self-attention 算子（跨模态 concat 输入） + 独立 FFN 分支（模态特定权重）**：","+多模态融合层（cross-attention）在 IR 中建立了跨模态数据流。MLIR 的 Linalg dialect 通过 `linalg.matmul` 表达跨模态 QKV 计算，SSA 的 use-def 边从 vision 域跨越到 text 域："," "," ```","-IR 层次 MMDiT Block:","-  h_text, h_video = inputs","-","-  // 共享 Self-Attention: 文本和视频 token 拼接后统一计算","-  h_combined = concat(norm_text(h_text), norm_video(h_video))   // [B, L_t+L_v, D]","-  attn_out = self_attn(h_combined)                              // 单一算子","-  attn_text, attn_video = split(attn_out)                       // 拆回两分支","-","-  // 独立 FFN (两分支并行): 使用各自独立的权重参数","-  h_text  = h_text + attn_text + ffn_text(norm(h_text))      // 分支 A","-  h_video = h_video + attn_video + ffn_video(norm(h_video))  // 分支 B (与 A 无数据依赖)","-","-  // 编译器可发现分叉后两个 FFN 无依赖 → 并行发射","+// 跨模态数据流的 SSA 表达:","+// vision 域 → K,V → cross-attention → text 域更新","+%K_vis = linalg.matmul ins(%v_feat, %w_k)  // vision 域","+%V_vis = linalg.matmul ins(%v_feat, %w_v)  // vision 域","+%Q_txt = linalg.matmul ins(%t_feat, %w_q)  // text 域","+// 跨域 SSA 边: vision 域的 value 流入 text 域的计算","+%cross = linalg.matmul ins(%Q_txt, %K_vis) // cross-modal!","+%out   = linalg.matmul ins(%cross, %V_vis) // cross-modal!"," ```"," ","-**注解**：MMDiT 的 IR 设计体现了一种重要模式——**并发在分叉处自然出现**。SSA 图中的 fork（shared attention → split → 两个独立 FFN 分支）向编译器明确传达了并行机会，无需额外 annotation。","+**注解**：跨模态 SSA 边是编译器的天然同步标记——`%cross` 依赖 `%Q_txt`（text encoder 输出）和 `%K_vis`（vision encoder 输出），编译器据此推导出融合层必须在两个编码器都完成后才能执行，无需用户显式标注同步点。"," "," ---"," ","-## 4. Video 模型的编译 IR 表示","+### 4. Video 模型的编译 IR 表示"," ","-### 4.1 High-level IR：GSPMD shard_map/pmap 对帧级并行的表达","+#### 4.1 帧级并行的 IR 表达"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md` (text-match)","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1488, 涵盖 video temporal/spatial attention); `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md` (score: 379)"," ","-Video 模型的帧级并行在 XLA/GSPMD 编译栈中通过 **`shard_map` annotation** 和 **spatial partitioning** 在 IR 中表达。关键 IR 机制是将时间维度（T）作为可 shard 的维度，编译器自动推导跨帧的依赖关系和通信需求。","+Video 模型的 IR 核心是**时空计算的表达**——帧级并行在不破坏时序依赖的前提下在 IR 中标注。笔记未直接覆盖 `pmap`/`shard_map` 的详细知识笔记，但 Difflow 论文提供了 video generation model 的实际编译流程。"," ","-**编译流程模拟 —— Video 模型帧级并行的 IR 表达**：","+**编译流程模拟 — Video 模型的 IR 表达**："," "," ```","-Step 1: 单设备 Video 模型 → StableHLO IR","-  Video DiT / UNet 计算图:","-    input: [B, T, C, H, W]   // T = 帧数, 可沿 T 维度 partition","-    ops: temporal_attn(Q,K,V over T), spatial_attn(Q,K,V over H×W), 3D conv","+Step 1: Video 模型 → DFG/Difflow 编译"," ","-Step 2: 用户 shard_map annotation (JAX 风格)","-  mesh = Mesh(devices.reshape(1, 4), ('spatial', 'temporal'))","-  # 沿 temporal 维度将 T=16 帧 partition 到 4 个 devices","+  Video DiT / UNet 的时空算子:","+    - spatial_conv:  每帧独立的 2D 卷积 → 帧间无依赖","+    - temporal_attn: 跨帧 attention (Q,K,V over T 维) → 帧间全依赖","+    - spatial_attn:  每帧独立的 2D attention → 帧间无依赖","+    - 3D conv:       kernel 跨帧 (如 3×3×3 over T,H,W) → 局部帧间依赖"," ","-  @shard_map(mesh=mesh, in_specs=(P('spatial', 'temporal'),),","-             out_specs=P('spatial', 'temporal'))","-  def video_temporal_block(x):","-      # x 在每 device 上的 local shape: [B, T/4, C, H, W]","-      # temporal attention 需要跨帧通信: 沿 temporal 轴的 all-gather","-      x_full_t = all_gather(x, axis='temporal')   // 暂时收集全帧 → [B, T, C, H, W]","-      attn_out = temporal_self_attn(x_full_t)      // 全帧 attention","-      return attn_out   // 输出按原 sharding 分布","+Step 2: Difflow DFG 中的帧级分析"," ","-Step 3: GSPMD Sharding Propagation","-  编译器从 shard_map annotation 推导:","-    - temporal_attn: 输入需要全帧 → 插入 all-gather (temporal 维度)","-    - spatial_attn:  每帧独立的 2D attention → 无跨帧依赖 → 无需通信","-    - 3D conv:       kernel 跨帧 → 插入 halo exchange (temporal 维度)","-    - FFN/layer_norm: 逐帧操作 → 无通信","+  ① Symbolic shape propagation:","+     frames 维度表示为符号变量 f","+     ragged case: f ∈ {14, 28, 57} (不同请求生成不同帧数)","+  ","+  ② dGraph decomposition for video:","+     dGraph_spatial:  所有 spatial-only 算子 (每帧独立)","+     dGraph_temporal: temporal attention 算子 (跨帧依赖)","+     dGraph_3Dconv:   3D convolution (局部跨帧，如 3×3×3 kernel)","+  ","+  ③ Ragged operation regularization:","+     ragged 帧数 → 合并到 batch 维:","+       原 [f, C, H, W] → reshape → [(f·H), W, C] → 标准 Matmul","+       或 tile each frame independently → round-robin 分配到 GPU blocks"," ","-  IR 中的通信标注 (类似 HLO):","-    %full_frames = all-gather(%local_frames, dimensions=[1])  // dim=1 是 temporal","-    %t_attn = custom-call @temporal_attn(%full_frames)","-    %s_attn = custom-call @spatial_attn(%t_attn)            // 无通信","-    %out = custom-call @temporal_conv(%s_attn)  // 自动插入 halo exchange","+Step 3: 帧级并发的 IR 标注（推断模式）"," ","-Step 4: PMap 语义的 SPMD codegen","-  pmap 等价于沿指定轴的 SPMD partition:","-    pmap(fn, axis='temporal')(video_frames)","-  = GSPMD partition(video_frames, mesh, {temporal: 4})","-  → 每个 device 获得 T/4 帧 → 编译生成包含 all-gather 的 SPMD 程序","-```","+  // 每帧独立的 spatial 算子 → 标注为并行","+  // 伪 IR: scf.forall (%frame) in (0 to num_frames) {","+  //   spatial_conv_2d(latent[%frame])","+  //   spatial_attn(latent[%frame])","+  // }  // frame iterations 无数据依赖 → 可并发映射到不同 SM"," ","-**SSA 图中跨帧依赖的链接方式**：","-","+  // temporal attention → 需跨帧通信","+  // 伪 IR: %all_frames = all-gather(%local_frames, dim='frame')","+  //        %t_attn = temporal_attn(%all_frames)","+  // SSA 链接: %local_frames (帧 i 的 local) → ","+  //            %all_frames (跨帧收集) → ","+  //            %t_attn (继续计算)","+  // 这种 SSA 链显式编码了 temporal attention 的跨帧依赖"," ```","-帧级并行 SSA 依赖分析:","-  Frame 0: [op_0_0] → [op_0_1] → [op_0_2] → ...   (帧内: 串行 SSA use-def)","-  Frame 1: [op_1_0] → [op_1_1] → [op_1_2] → ...","-  ...","-  Frame T: [op_T_0] → [op_T_1] → [op_T_2] → ..."," ","-  跨帧依赖 (temporal attention):","-    op_t_k (frame t, layer k) dependson:","-      op_t_{k-1}         (帧内依赖)","-      op_{t-1}_k         (帧间依赖, temporal attention 的 KV)","-      op_{t+1}_k         (帧间依赖, 双向 attention)","-","-  IR 中的跨帧边: 从 op_{t-1}_k 到 op_t_k 的 SSA edge 在 partition 后变为","-    跨 device 的 all-gather/reduce-scatter collective","-```","-"," **注解**：","-- **变量含义**：`shard_map` 是 JAX 的 SPMD annotation 原语，指定 mesh（设备拓扑）和 in_specs/out_specs（tensor 的 sharding 方式）；`P('spatial', 'temporal')` 表示沿第一维（spatial）不 partition，沿第二维（temporal）partition","-- **复杂度分析**：帧级并行的通信量 = temporal attention 层的 all-gather 量 = O(T × H × W × C) per attention layer；spatial attention 层无跨帧通信 = O(0)","-- **数据依赖**：temporal attention 产生跨帧依赖——SSA 图中表示为从 device i（持有帧 f_i）到 device j（持有帧 f_j）的 data edge；GSPMD 将其编译为 collective permute 或 all-gather","-- **并发可行性**：帧内 spatial attention 可完全并行（每帧独立）；temporal attention 需要 all-gather 同步——通信与 spatial attention 的计算可 overlap（异步 pipeline）","-- **笔记未明确说明**：XLA 的 pmap/shard_map 在 GPU 上是否支持 temporal attention 的通信与 spatial attention 的计算自动 overlap；GSPMD 论文报告了 TPU 上的结果","+- **帧级并发的硬件约束**：temporal attention 的 all-gather 操作在 HBM 上的通信量 = O(T × H × W × C)。对于 T=14 帧、1024×1024 分辨率、C=64 通道的 SVD 模型，单层 temporal attention 需传输约 14×1024×1024×64×2 bytes ≈ 1.8 GB（FP16）。H100 的 HBM 带宽 3.35 TB/s 下传输 ~0.5ms——这是帧级并发的主要瓶颈。","+- **Difflow 的 ragged 处理与硬件**：笔记显示 Difflow 将 ragged 帧数请求通过 `fuse batch dim + ragged dim → regular Matmul` 的方式处理——这种方式利用 GPU 的硬件 batch Matmul kernel（如 cuBLAS），无需手写 ragged kernel。","+- **笔记未明确说明**：`pmap`/`shard_map` 在单 GPU 上的确切性能和实现细节；video 模型 temporal attention 的 communication-computation overlap 自动生成能力。"," ","-### 4.2 Low-level IR：WELDER Hierarchical Tile-Graph 对 Video UNet 的表达","+---"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Hierarchical Tile-Graph (WELDER).md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Inter-Layer Independence (WELDER).md` (text-match)","+## 二、实验环境"," ","-Video 模型中常用的 UNet 架构在 WELDER 编译器中通过 **Hierarchical Tile-Graph** 表达——将完整的 DNN graph 递归分解为多层 tile-graph，支持跨 host+device memory 的 tile-based streaming：","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1488); `paper_secs/secs_moe/X-MoE.../3.3-Expensive-All-to-All...md` (score: 9305)"," ","-```","-WELDER Tile-Graph 对 Video UNet (8k×8k 输入) 的编译:","+### 2.1 DiT/Diffusion 编译 IR 实验（Difflow）"," ","-L0 (完整 graph):","-  Video UNet: [Conv3D → ResBlock → DownSample → ... → UpSample → Conv3D]","+| 配置项 | 规格 |","+|--------|------|","+| GPU | NVIDIA A100 40GB PCIe + H100 80GB PCIe |","+| CUDA | 12.1 (UNet) / 12.8 (DiT) |","+| 框架 | PyTorch 2.9, Triton backend, Stable Fast (baseline) |","+| DiT Benchmark | HunyuanImage, Hunyuan-DiT ControlNet, FLUX.1 S |","+| Video Benchmark | SVD (14 frames, 576×1024, I2V) |","+| 编译策略 | dGraph decomposition + dEngine multi-version compilation |","+| 关键指标 | 吞吐量 (req/s)、编译时间 (min)、dEngine 数量 |","+| 核心结果 | DiT refine: 2.2-3.0× speedup; edit: 1.4×; 编译时间: SDXL U-Net 4 min (dGraph) vs 16 min (monolithic) |"," ","-L1 (sub-graph by connectivity):","-  Encoder:     Conv → BN → ReLU → MaxPool  (tile-graph A)","-  Bottleneck:  Conv → BN → ReLU             (tile-graph B)","-  Decoder:     UpSample → Conv → BN → ReLU  (tile-graph C)","+### 2.2 MoE 编译 IR 实验（X-MoE / Lancet）"," ","-L2 (进一步分裂):","-  Conv → BN → ReLU 子图内部:","-    Conv_tile  → BN_tile  → ReLU_tile","-    (每个 tile 链接通过 SetConnect 建立内存层次: Reg→Shared→Global→Host)","+| 配置项 | 规格 |","+|--------|------|","+| 平台 | Frontier HPC (Dragonfly topology) |","+| Intra-node | Infinity Fabric 200 GB/s |","+| Inter-node | Slingshot 25 GB/s |","+| MoE Config | DeepSeek-style: 256 experts, top-8 routing |","+| 关键发现 | 拓扑感知路由减少 8× inter-node 通信量; static-shape approx 误差 3.83% |"," ","-ExecuteGraph 递归展开:","-  for node in g.nodes():","-    if level == top: ComputeTile(node)","-    else: ExecuteGraph(node.TileGraph(), level+1)","+### 2.3 多模态编译 IR 实验"," ","-Inter-Layer Independence:","-  L0 (Register):  优化 Conv+ReLU register tile → 最小化 L1→L0 traffic","-  L1 (SharedMem): 优化 (Conv+ReLU)+MaxPool shared memory tile → 最小化 L2→L1 traffic","-  改变 L0 配置不影响 L1 traffic → 两层独立优化","-```","+笔记中多模态模型编译 IR 的具体实验数据有限。Difflow 涵盖 video model (SVD) 但未专门评估多模态编码器分支的 IR 并发效果。EEVEE 的 Module Multiplexing 实验数据未在 vault 中记录。"," ","-**注解**：","-- **Tile 约束**：每层 tile 的 shared memory 需求之和 ≤ SM shared memory capacity（A100: 192 KB/SM）；大输入（8k×8k video frame）通过 tile-based streaming 跨 host+device memory 处理","-- **CTA 分配**：Tile-graph 的递归展开自动决定各 sub-graph 的 Block/ThreadIdx 映射（Block/ThreadIdx Remapping pass）","-- **并发可行性**：Inter-Layer Independence 意味着不同 sub-graph 的 tile 配置可并行搜索和编译；同一 memory level 内的不同 sub-graph 可分配到不同 SM 并发执行","-"," ---"," ","-## 5. 多算子并发在 IR 中的通用表达能力","+## 三、实现（辅助说明）"," ","-### 5.1 Event-Based IR：显式异步依赖建模","+### 3.1 各编译框架 IR 实现总览"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md` (text-match)","+| IR 系统 | 实现框架 | 开源 | 编程接口 | 硬件后端 |","+|---------|---------|------|---------|---------|","+| HLO / StableHLO | XLA / OpenXLA | Apache 2.0 | JAX, TF, PyTorch-XLA | GPU(CUDA), TPU, CPU |","+| MLIR 多 dialect | LLVM MLIR | Apache 2.0 | C++ API, Python bindings | GPU, CPU, FPGA, PIM, NPU |","+| Triton IR / TTGIR | OpenAI Triton | MIT | Python DSL (@triton.jit) | NVIDIA (sm_70+), AMD CDNA3/4 |","+| Hidet IR | Hidet | Apache 2.0 | torch.compile(backend='hidet') | NVIDIA GPU |","+| CUTLASS 模板 | NVIDIA CUTLASS | BSD-like | C++ templates | NVIDIA GPU (SM70+) |","+| Event-Based IR | Cypress (学术) | 笔记未说明 | C++ | NVIDIA GPU |"," ","-Cypress 编译器的 Event-Based IR 提供了最精细的异步并发 IR 建模——每个异步操作产生 event，每个操作声明 precondition events，SSA 形式确保任何有效排序满足所有依赖。","+### 3.2 编译时间参考（Difflow）"," ","-```","-Event-Based IR 并发建模 (Cypress):","+| 模型 | 策略 | #Inputs | #dGraphs | #Engines | 编译时间 |","+|------|------|---------|----------|----------|----------|","+| SDXL UNet | Monolithic | 4 | 1 | 16 | 16 min |","+| SDXL UNet | dGraph | 4 | 3 | 4 | 4 min |","+| SDXL+ControlNet | Monolithic | 14 | 1 | 16384 | ~11 days |","+| SDXL+ControlNet | dGraph | 14 | 4 | 7 | 7 min |"," ","-// 异步操作 = (output_event, precondition_events, operation)","-e1: [(N, WARP)] = pfor i in [0, N) do","-  e2: [(M, THREAD)] = pfor j in [0, M) do","-    e3: () = call(compute_kernel, tile[i,j]), precondition={}","-    yield e3                       // point-wise event","-  e4: () = copy(result, output[i]), precondition={e2[:]}  // all threads done","-  yield e4","+---"," ","-// 关键并发原语:","-// - event 数组 [(N, WARP)]: N 个并行 event，每个对应一个 warp 迭代","-// - broadcast [:] 索引: 等待所有并行迭代完成","-// - copy/precondition: 异步 copy 操作仅等待其数据生产者","+## 四、是什么？（辅助说明）"," ","-// Event → Hardware Sync Lowering:","-//   ():         → no sync (SSA guarantees ordering)","-//   (WARP):     → __syncwarp","-//   (THREAD):   → __syncwarp / __threadfence_block","-//   (CTA):      → __syncthreads / named barrier","-//   TMA events  → mbarrier (Hopper)","-//   MMA events  → warpgroup sync assembly","-```","+### 4.1 IR 层次定义"," ","-**注解**：Event-Based IR 的核心价值在于将硬件同步原语（`__syncwarp`、`mbarrier`、`warpgroup sync`）的插入从手写 CUDA 中提升到编译器 IR 层面——编译器自动根据 event 依赖选择最轻量的同步原语。","+| IR 层级 | 代表 | 硬件无关性 | 并发信息保留 |","+|---------|------|-----------|-------------|","+| High-level IR | StableHLO, Relay | 高（无硬件假设） | SPMD annotation, all-to-all op |","+| Mid-level IR | MLIR Linalg/SCF/GPU, DFG (Difflow) | 中（memory hierarchy 抽象） | scf.forall, async.execute, dGraph |","+| Low-level IR | Triton IR, LLVM IR, PTX | 低（指令集映射） | program_id, gpu.launch, stream |"," ","-### 5.2 Stream Scheduler IR：编译时 Kernel-to-Stream 并发","+### 4.2 四类模型 IR 设计核心差异"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Stream Scheduler (Compile-Time Kernel-to-Stream Assignment).md` (text-match)","+| 模型 | IR 核心特征 | 关键并发 IR 原语 | 硬件映射关键 |","+|------|-----------|-----------------|-------------|","+| **MoE** | all-to-all + expert FFN 子图 | `scf.forall`, `async.execute`, `all-to-all` | NVLink/NVSwitch 拓扑感知 |","+| **DiT** | `while` op 或展开 DFG | `affine.par`, `program_id`, dGraph | SM block 级并行, denoising loop 展开 |","+| **多模态** | 独立 `func.func` + cross-attention | `async.execute` + `async.await` | 多 CUDA stream, MPS 空间分区 |","+| **Video** | 时空算子 IR + frame parallelism | `scf.forall`(frame axis), ragged dEngine | SM 帧级并行, temporal attn 跨帧通信 |"," ","-HuntKTm 的 Stream Scheduler 展示了如何在 host IR 层面表达多 kernel 并发——通过 LLVM pass 分析 DFG、分层、分配 stream、生成最小同步集：","+---"," ","-```","-编译时 Stream 并发 IR 转换:","+## 五、方法对比表"," ","-Input: 串行 CUDA kernel launch 序列","-  kernel_1(args, writable=[0,1])","-  kernel_2(args, writable=[0])","-  kernel_3(args, writable=[1])","-  kernel_4(args, writable=[0,1])","+| 方法 | 核心 IR 机制 | 并发表达 | 编译框架 | 硬件平台 | 编译-运行时权衡 | 笔记证据 |","+|------|------------|---------|---------|---------|---------------|---------|","+| **XLA HLO all-to-all** | all-to-all op + GSPMD sharding | SPMD partition annotation | XLA/OpenXLA | GPU(CUDA), TPU | 编译时 partition + 运行时 NCCL | X-MoE (9305), Irregular all-to-all (1797) |","+| **MLIR scf.forall + async** | 多 dialect progressive lowering | scf.forall 无依赖迭代, async.execute token | LLVM MLIR | GPU(CUDA/Vulkan), PIM, NPU | 编译时 IR pass pipeline + 运行时 stream | MLIR note (578), MLIR PIM Compiler (2553) |","+| **Cypress Event IR** | SSA event + precondition DAG | Event 数组 per-WARP/THREAD 追踪 | Cypress (学术) | GPU(CUDA) | 纯编译时: event→硬件 barrier lowering | Event-Based IR (3521) |","+| **Difflow DFG/dGraph** | 符号属性传播 + dGraph 分解 | dGraph 级数据属性分组并发 | Difflow (PyTorch/Triton) | GPU(A100/H100) | 编译时 dEngine 生成 + 运行时 DP 调度 | Difflow §4 (1488) |","+| **Triton IR program_id** | block-level tile IR | program_id 沿 grid 轴并行 | OpenAI Triton | GPU(NVIDIA/AMD) | 编译时 tile 搜索 + 运行时 grid 发射 | Triton note (1762, 213) |","+| **Hidet IR** | 类 CUDA C task-mapping IR | task mapping 显式指定算子分配 | Hidet | GPU(CUDA) | VM IR→Hidet IR→nvcc→cubin 全编译链 | Hidet IR (5402) |","+| **Tilus SIMB IR** | thread-block 级指令集(Allocate/Dot/View/CopyAsync) | SIMB 模型: block 内所有线程协作 | Tilus (Python IR) | GPU(CUDA) | CopyAsync 三级流水线 + 编译时同步管理 | SIMB note (294) |","+| **CUTLASS 模板** | 层次化 GEMM 模板 (threadblock→warp→fragment) | CUDA 硬件 warp/tblock 调度 | NVIDIA CUTLASS | GPU(SM70+, TensorCore) | 编译时模板展开 + 运行时 kernel 调用 | CUTLASS note (39) |","+| **Infera Multi-Version** | micro-operator 多版本 kernel (reg×shmem×stages) | 编译时 ILP/TLP trade-off 枚举 | Infera (TVM Relay→TensorIR→CUDA) | GPU(CUDA) | 编译时 multi-version gen + 运行时 SelectKernels | Multi-Version note (379) |","+| **PIMphony MLIR+IREE** | StableHLO→Linalg→PIM ops→IREE HAL | PIM-specific 指令级并发标注 | PIMphony (MLIR IREE) | PIM(CENT/NeuPIMs) | 离线编译 + 运行时 HAL dispatch | MLIR PIM Compiler (2553) |"," ","-↓ DFG Constructor (LLVM pass)","-","-DFG:","-  k1 → k2 (RAW on arg 0)      k1 → k3 (RAW on arg 1)","-  k2 → k4 (RAW on arg 0)      k3 → k4 (WAR on arg 1)","-","-↓ Kernel Distributor (levelization)","-","-Level 0: {k1}        (no predecessors)","-Level 1: {k2, k3}    (k2,k3 both depend only on k1 → mutually independent)","-Level 2: {k4}        (depends on both k2,k3)","-","-↓ Stream Assignment","-","-Stream 0: k1 → k2 → k4","-Stream 1: k3 (并发于 k2)","-","-↓ Synchronization Generator","-","-Stream 0: k1 → k2 → k4  (intra-stream implicit ordering)","-Stream 1: k3","-Sync: k3 等待 k1 完成; k4 等待 k3 完成","-Redundant sync 剪除: k3→k4 sync 可通过 k2→k4 的 arg 依赖传递性地满足","-```","-","-**注解**：Stream Scheduler 的 IR 转换展示了编译时并发提取的完整链路——DFG 分析→分层→分配→同步生成。与运行时并发（如 CUDA Graph 的动态依赖）不同，编译时方案可看到全局 DFG，从而更激进地消除冗余同步。","-"," ---"," ","-## 6. 跨框架 IR 对比总结","+## 六、不确定性"," ","-### 6.1 IR 并发表达能力矩阵","+1. **StableHLO while op 的 GPU 异步支持**: 笔记显示 `while` op 的 GPU lowering 在 host 端串行发射 iteration kernel，但 XLA 是否支持 while body 内部的异步算子（如 async all-to-all）笔记未明确说明。"," ","-| IR 系统 | 并发标注方式 | 异步语义 | 硬件拓扑感知 | 多算子并发支持 | 笔记证据 |","-|---------|-------------|----------|-------------|---------------|---------|","-| **XLA HLO / StableHLO** | `shard_map`/`pmap` annotation + GSPMD collective ops | `async` 变体 of all-to-all/all-reduce | device mesh (2D/3D torus for TPU) | SPMD-level 并发；GSPMD auto-placement | GSPMD note |","-| **MLIR (gpu+async+scf)** | `scf.forall` / `async.execute` / `gpu.launch` | `async.execute` + `async.await` 显式异步 | 通过 gpu dialect 映射到 thread hierarchy | dialect-level 并发；需 pass pipeline 组合 | MLIR note, Event-Based IR note |","-| **Triton IR (TTIR/TTGIR)** | `program_id` 沿 grid axis 的并行 | 单 kernel 内 tile 级并发 | 间接：通过 grid/block 配置反映硬件 | 单 kernel 内微算子并发；跨 kernel 需外部调度 | Triton note |","-| **TVM Relay / TensorIR** | `parallel` axis / `block` buffer annotation | 有限的异步支持（需手动 scheduling） | 通过 target-specific scheduling | AutoScheduler 搜索式并发 | Tile-Based Zero-Tuning note |","-| **Torch FX Graph → Inductor IR** | FX graph node parallelism | Triton backend 的 multi-kernel codegen | 通过 Triton Autotuner 间接建模 | TorchInductor multi-kernel 发射 | （笔记推断 — Triton note 的扩展） |","-| **Event-Based IR (Cypress)** | event/precondition SSA 对 | event 数组 + broadcast 索引 | WARP/THREAD/CTA 粒度映射 | 最精细的异步并发建模 | Event-Based IR note |","-| **Scale-Free IR (Diffuse)** | index task 隐式并行 | task fusion 后的 MLIR kernel fusion | partition 的隐式映射公式 (与 processor 数无关) | 分布式 task 级并发 | Scale-Free IR note |","-| **CANN GE IR (Ascend NPU)** | GE engine 图编译 | 限于 GE fusion + IRFusion | Da Vinci Cube/Vector 单元感知 | 单指令流内微算子并发（ILP） | CANN note, MindSpore note |","+2. **Video 模型 `pmap`/`shard_map` 的详细知识笔记缺失**: vault 中缺乏关于 JAX `pmap`/`shard_map` 在单 GPU Video 模型上的 IR lowering 细节笔记。上述分析部分基于 Difflow 的 video evaluation 和 MLIR 的通用 parallel semantics 推断。"," ","-### 6.2 硬件平台对 IR 并发支持的差异","+3. **NPU 的 IR 设计细节**: vault 中关于 NPU（昇腾、Apple ANE）的 IR 层面编译设计笔记较少。CANN 的 GE IR→Ascend 指令 lowering 的具体 dialect 和 pass pipeline 细节未记录。"," ","-| 硬件平台 | IR 并发模型 | 并发原语在 IR 中的表达 | 编译 vs 运行时并发 |","-|---------|------------|----------------------|-------------------|","-| **NVIDIA GPU** | 动态并发（MPS/MIG/CUDA stream） | `gpu.launch` + `async.execute` → 多条 CUDA stream | 编译时分配 stream + 同步点插入，运行时 GPU warp scheduler 调度 |","-| **Google TPU** | 编译时静态 SPMD | XLA `shard_map` + `collective-permute` | 完全编译时决定——SPMD program 在所有 core 上同步执行 |","-| **Ascend NPU** | 单指令流 + 脉动阵列 | CANN GE IR → Da Vinci 指令流 | 编译时 operator fusion + tiling，运行时固定数据流 |","-| **Groq LPU** | 确定性静态调度 | Groq Compiler IR → spatial mapping | 完全编译时——无运行时调度器，算子直接映射到芯片单元 |","-| **Cerebras CS-3** | Dataflow 编译 | Dataflow graph → wafer-scale mapping | 编译时将计算图映射为晶圆级 dataflow |","+4. **多模态模型跨硬件 device placement**: MLIR+IREE 理论上支持 GPU+NPU 异构编译，但 vault 中缺乏多模态模型（LLaVA/BLIP-2 on GPU+ANE）的编译实验数据或 IR lowering 细节笔记。"," ","----","+5. **Groq/Cerebras 的 deterministic compilation IR**: vault 中缺乏关于这些加速器的编译器 IR 设计的直接笔记，上述描述基于公开信息推断。"," ","-## 方法对比表","+6. **MoE async all-to-all 的实际成熟度**: GSPMD 论文提到了通信-计算 overlap，但具体到 HLO `async.all-to-all` 的实现状态和性能数据，笔记未记录。"," ","-| 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |","-|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|","-| **GSPMD SPMD Partition** | Sharding annotation 传播 + collective insertion | XLA (JAX/TF) | TPU v3/v4/v5, GPU | 2048 TPUv3 上 50-62% compute utilization；<1% tensor 需标注 | GSPMD note |","-| **MLIR Dialect Ladder** | 多 dialect progressive lowering: Linalg→Affine→GPU→LLVM | MLIR + IREE/OpenXLA | GPU (CUDA/ROCm/Vulkan) | Dialect 数量>20；社区 passes 复用；类型安全 memref | MLIR note |","-| **Triton Block-level IR** | Block-level tiling → TTIR → TTGIR → LLVM IR → PTX | Triton Compiler | NVIDIA GPU (sm_70+), AMD CDNA3/4 | 比 CUDA 开发效率高 3-5×；autotuner 自动探索 >20 配置 | Triton note |","-| **Cypress Event-Based IR** | SSA 形式 event + precondition → 硬件同步 lowering | Cypress (MLIR-based) | NVIDIA GPU (Hopper TMA) | Event 数组支持 WARP/THREAD/CTA broadcast；编译时消除→零运行时开销 | Event-Based IR note |","-| **Difflow Symbolic Propagation** | Boolean redundancy vector propagation + dGraph decomposition | Difflow | NVIDIA L40S | Loop unrolling ≤5 steps 收敛；redundancy-aware kernel 选择 | Symbolic Data Property note |","-| **Lancet Partition Axis Inference** | CSP 求解分区轴 + A_irr (MoE 不规则标注) | Lancet (RAF compiler, OR-Tools CP-SAT) | NVIDIA GPU (A100/H100) | Static-shape approximation 误差仅 3.83%；DP 自动决策最优 (i,n,k) | Partition Axis Inference note |","-| **WELDER Tile-Graph** | 多层 tile-graph 递归 + Inter-Layer Independence | WELDER (TIR-based) | NVIDIA GPU, ROCm GPU, GraphCore IPU | 支持 8k×8k UNet 输入 (host memory streaming) | Hierarchical Tile-Graph note |","-| **HuntKTm Stream Scheduler** | DFG levelization + stream assignment + 同步剪除 | LLVM Pass | NVIDIA GPU (CUDA stream) | 编译时间 +0.99s；用户仅需 ~15 LoC 标注 | Stream Scheduler note |","-| **CANN GE Graph Compiler** | MindSpore IR → GE engine → Ascend 指令流 | CANN (Huawei) | Ascend 910B/310P | LocMoE 在 32 Ascend 910A 上验证；支持 GE fusion + IRFusion | CANN note |","-"," ---"," ","-## 不确定性","-","-1. **StableHLO while op 的 GPU 异步支持**：笔记未明确说明 XLA 的 `while` op 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 loop body 内部的异步执行和算子并发——这主要来自 Web 知识推断","-2. **Video 模型帧级并发的实际编译实现**：笔记主要覆盖 GSPMD 的一般机制和 WELDER 的 tile-graph，针对 Video-specific（如 temporal attention 的 communication-computation overlap 自动生成）在 vault 中缺乏直接论文笔记","-3. **多模态模型在 NPU 上的 IR 表达**：CANN note 覆盖了 MindSpore + Ascend 的一般编译流程，但多模态异构编码器在 NPU 上的 IR 并发表达无直接笔记证据","-4. **MLIR async dialect 的 GPU multi-stream 并发成熟度**：笔记显示 async dialect 被用于 PIM 编译和 Diffuse 分布式场景，但其在单 GPU 上生成真正 concurrent kernel execution 的状态未在笔记中明确","-5. **DiT denoising loop 的 cross-timestep 依赖优化**：Difflow note 覆盖了 redundancy 分析和 dGraph decomposition，但跨 timestep 的 KV cache 复用等高级优化在 vault 中无直接笔记","-","----","-","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L3-Q3.1","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q3.1"]}],"originalFile":"# Q3.1 — MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 四类模型负载的编译 IR 表示\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md | text-match | MLIR 核心概念：dialect 架构、progressive lowering、memref/affine/linalg/gpu/scf/arith dialect、IR→CUDA Binary 完整编译链 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md | text-match | Triton 编译流程：Python→TTIR→TTGIR→LLVM IR→PTX；block-level programming model；autotuner 机制 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md | text-match | GSPMD SPMD 编译：sharding annotation→propagation→SPMD program generation；应用于 GShard/Expert Choice MoE；pmap/shard_map 语义 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md | text-match | Cypress Event-Based IR：SSA 形式异步 event；event 数组支持并行迭代完成追踪；WARP/THREAD broadcast 到硬件同步原语的 lowering |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Partition Axis Inference (Constraint Satisfaction for Operator Partition).md | text-match | Lancet CSP 分区轴推断：MoE 特殊 A_irr 分区轴处理；all-to-all/expert/gather 的分区约束 IR 建模 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Graph Optimization Pipeline for MoE Inference (MoE推理图优化流水线).md | text-match | MoESys 6 步图优化流水线：Graph Fusion→Distillation→Conversion→Segmentation→IR Pass→Deployment；PaddlePaddle ProgramDesc IR |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Symbolic Data Property Propagation for Diffusion Pipelines（扩散管道的符号化数据属性传播）.md | text-match | Difflow 符号化数据属性传播：Diffusion pipeline 中的 redundancy vector 传播；denoising loop unfold；dGraph decomposition |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Static vs Dynamic Computational Graph（静态计算图 vs 动态计算图）.md | text-match | MoE 动态图 vs 静态图 IR 差异：capacity 固定 vs 动态；MindSpore GRAPH_MODE vs PyTorch eager |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Scale-Free Intermediate Representation for Distributed Computation.md | text-match | Diffuse Scale-Free IR：数据模型(store/partition)与计算模型(index task)；与 processor 数无关的 IR 大小；fusion constraint 的 O(1) 检查 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Hidet IR (Task-Mapping Intermediate Representation).md | text-match | Hidet IR：task-mapping paradigm；VM IR→Hidet IR→CUDA C 的 lowering 链 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Cell (Brainstorm Data Abstraction _ 动态网络粒度标注抽象).md | text-match | Brainstorm Cell 抽象：tensor 中 dynamism 粒度的 IR 标注；符号执行推导 Cell 传播类型 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Dataflow-Scheduling Decoupling (数据流与调度解耦).md | text-match | TileLang dataflow/scheduling 解耦；T.Parallel/T.Pipelined annotation→编译器自动推导调度 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Stream Scheduler (Compile-Time Kernel-to-Stream Assignment).md | text-match | HuntKTm Stream Scheduler：DFG→levelization→stream assignment→同步生成；编译时 CUDA stream 并发 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Whole Graph Computation-Communication Overlapping.md | text-match | Lancet 全图计算-通信重叠：IR Pass 实现 dW 重排 + 算子分区 + irregular all-to-all |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CANN (Compute Architecture for Neural Networks).md | text-match | CANN 编译栈：MindSpore IR→CANN GE engine→Ascend 可执行图 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md | text-match | Infera Tile-Based Zero-Tuning：TVM Relay→TensorIR→CUDA C 编译链 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MindSpore（昇思深度学习框架）.md | text-match | MindSpore 图编译：Python→IR→图优化(融合/内存复用/并行)→静态编译→Ascend 执行 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning.md | 1797.5 | MoE all-to-all 通信：irregular all-to-all 双趟实现（size 交换+数据交换）；pipeline 中的 static-shape approximation |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md | 262.0 | MMDiT \"共享注意力+独立 FFN\" 架构；文本/视频双分支 IR 建模 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Vertical Fusion (GPU Operator Fusion).md | text-match | 垂直融合 IR→mega kernel：tiling 分析→shared memory 容量约束→代码生成 |\n\n---\n\n## 1. MoE 模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n### 1.1 High-level IR：XLA HLO / StableHLO 对 Expert Dispatch/Combine 的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md` (text-match)\n\nMoE 模型在 XLA/StableHLO 编译栈中，High-level IR 通过 **SPMD sharding annotation** 与 **collective communication ops** 的组合来表达 expert dispatch/combine 语义。\n\n**编译流程模拟 —— GSPMD 编译 MoE 的 IR 转换链**：\n\n```\nStep 1: 用户标注 (User Annotation)\n  Input: 单设备 MoE 计算图 (HLO IR)\n  用户对 <1% 的 tensor 添加 sharding annotation:\n    mesh_split(expert_weight, device_mesh, ['expert', None])\n    mesh_split(token_batch, device_mesh, ['data', None])\n\nStep 2: Sharding Completion Pass (编译器自动推导)\n  HLO IR 中的每个 op 接收 partial sharding → 传播完整 sharding:\n    - gating op:     input sharding ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']\n    - all-to-all op: input ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']\n                      (reshard: data 轴 → expert 轴)\n    - expert FFN op: input ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']\n    - all-to-all op: input ['data','expert'] → output ['data','expert']\n                      (reshard: expert 轴 → data 轴)\n  冲突时插入 Reshard op (= collective communication)\n\nStep 3: SPMD Program Generation\n  HLO IR 中 auto-insert 的 collective ops:\n    all-to-all(token_tensor)          // token dispatch: data shard → expert shard\n    custom-call(expert_ffn, ...)      // 每个 device 执行其 expert 分片\n    all-to-all(expert_output)         // token combine: expert shard → data shard\n    all-reduce(gradients)             // 训练时同步 expert 梯度\n\nStep 4: XLA Backend\n  HLO → LLO (Low-Level Optimizer) → HLO fusion pass → GPU/TPU codegen\n  标准 XLA fusion pipeline 处理 expert FFN 内部的算子融合\n```\n\n**MoE 核心 IR ops 语义**：\n\n| HLO Op | IR 语义 | 并发含义 |\n|--------|---------|----------|\n| `all-to-all(input, split_dimension, concat_dimension)` | 沿 split_dimension 将 token 分发到各 device，沿 concat_dimension 拼接 | 通信与计算可 overlap；GSPMD 可标记为异步变体 |\n| `scatter(input, scatter_indices, updates)` | 将 token 按 expert index 分散到 expert 输入 buffer | 表达了不可微的离散路由——编译器在此边界停止融合 |\n| `gather(input, gather_indices)` | 从 expert 输出 buffer 按 token 原始顺序收集结果 | 反向的 token combine 操作 |\n| `custom-call(target=\"expert_ffn\", ...)` | 封装 expert FFN 子图，允许 backend 特定优化 | 标记 expert 内部可并行的计算子图 |\n| `while(cond, body, init)` | MoE 层循环（多层 MoE block 的 loop） | 层间串行，层内 expert 可并行 |\n\n**注解**：\n- **变量含义**：`device_mesh` 为逻辑多维设备网格（如 `[8, 64]` 表示 512 设备）；`split_dimension` 与 `concat_dimension` 分别指定 all-to-all 的分发轴和拼接轴\n- **复杂度分析**：Sharding Completion Pass 为多项式时间（约束传播），全图推导编译器可在 <1 min 内完成；在 2048 TPUv3 上达到 50-62% compute utilization\n- **数据依赖**：all-to-all → expert FFN → all-to-all 形成串行依赖链，但 all-to-all 的通信可与前一层的 expert compute 通过 GSPMD 的 pipeline 调度 overlap\n- **并发可行性**：GSPMD 将 all-to-all 标记为 `async` 变体后，XLA backend 可在通信进行时发射独立的 compute kernel；expert FFN 内部各 expert 的 FFN 子图是数据无关的（不同 expert 处理不同 token 子集），可并发\n\n---\n\n### 1.2 Low-level IR：MLIR GPU Dialect + Async Dialect 对 Expert 并行 Region 的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md` (text-match)\n\nMLIR 通过多 dialect 分层架构表达 MoE expert 并行 region。以下是 MLIR 中 MoE expert dispatch + compute 的 Low-level IR 组织方式：\n\n**MLIR 模拟 —— MoE Expert 并行的多层 Dialect 表达**：\n\n```mlir\n// === Layer 1: High-level Linalg + SCF (结构化控制流) ===\n// Expert gating 结果: tokens_by_expert[e] 为 expert e 分配到的 token indices\nfunc.func @moe_layer(%tokens: tensor<BxSxDxf32>, %gate_weight: tensor<DxE xf32>,\n                      %expert_weights: tensor<ExDx4Dxf32>) -> tensor<BxSxDxf32> {\n  // Gate computation (可标注并行)\n  %gate_logits = linalg.matmul ins(%tokens, %gate_weight) -> tensor<BxSxExf32>\n  %gates = linalg.softmax dimension(2) %gate_logits   // softmax over experts\n\n  // Top-k selection (离散路由 —— IR 中体现为 scatter/gather 包围的 region)\n  %topk_indices, %topk_weights = \"moe.topk\"(%gates) {k = 2}\n\n  // === Expert dispatch region (并发标注) ===\n  // 每个 expert 分配独立的 async.execute group\n  %results = scf.forall %e in 0 to E\n      -> (tensor<...>) {\n    // 提取属于 expert e 的 tokens\n    %expert_tokens = \"moe.scatter\"(%tokens, %topk_indices, %e)   // dispatch\n\n    // === Expert FFN (gpu dialect 表达) ===\n    %expert_out = gpu.launch blocks(...) threads(...) {\n      // FFN 内部: Linear1 → Activation → Linear2\n      %h1 = linalg.matmul ins(%expert_tokens, %w1) -> ...\n      %h1_act = linalg.generic {indexing_maps = [...], iterator_types = [\"parallel\"]}\n                  ins(%h1) outs(...) { arith.silu } -> ...\n      %h2 = linalg.matmul ins(%h1_act, %w2) -> ...\n      gpu.yield %h2\n    }\n    scf.forall.yield %expert_out\n  }\n\n  // Token combine\n  %output = \"moe.gather\"(%results, %topk_indices, %topk_weights)\n  return %output\n}\n```\n\n**对应 Async Dialect 并发表达**：\n\n```mlir\n// Async dialect: 将多个 expert 作为独立异步任务并行执行\n%c0 = arith.constant 0 : index\n%c1 = arith.constant 1 : index\n\n// 为每个 expert 创建异步执行 token\n%tok_e0 = async.execute {\n  %r0 = call @expert_ffn_kernel_0(%expert0_input) : ...\n  async.yield %r0\n}\n%tok_e1 = async.execute {\n  %r1 = call @expert_ffn_kernel_1(%expert1_input) : ...\n  async.yield %r1\n}\n// ... E 个 expert 的 async.execute 可完全并发\n\n// 同步点：所有 expert 完成后 gather\n%all_tokens:2 = async.await %tok_e0, %tok_e1 : ...\n\n// Gather 结果\n%output = call @token_combine(%all_tokens#0, %all_tokens#1, ...) : ...\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **数据结构**：`scf.forall` 的每个 iteration 对应一个 expert，MLIR 的 `scf.forall` 语义保证 iteration 间无数据依赖时可并行执行；`async.execute` 将每个 expert 的计算封装为异步 region，`async.await` 为显式同步点\n- **并发粒度**：`scf.forall` 为结构化并行——编译器已知 iteration 间独立，可自由映射到 GPU thread block 或 CUDA stream；`async.execute` 提供更细粒度的异步抽象，支持与通信的 overlap\n- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**：MLIR 的 dialect lowering 在编译时决定 expert 并发的具体实现——`gpu.launch` 生成 CUDA kernel launch code；`async.execute` 在经过 `async-to-async-runtime` pass 后转为运行时异步任务；`scf.forall` 经过 `scf-parallel-loop-fusion` 和 `gpu-map-parallel-loops` 映射到 GPU 线程层次\n- **笔记未明确说明**：MLIR 中 MoE 的 `all-to-all` 通信在 IR 中的精确表达——笔记显示 collectives 更多在 XLA/GSPMD 层面处理，MLIR 的 `gpu` dialect 目前主要针对单设备 kernel 生成\n\n---\n\n### 1.3 Low-level IR：Lancet Partition Axis Inference 中的 MoE IR 扩展\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Partition Axis Inference (Constraint Satisfaction for Operator Partition).md` (text-match)\n\nLancet 编译器引入 **A_irr（不规则分区轴）** 作为 MoE 在 IR 中的特殊分区标注：\n\n```\nIR 中的分区轴值域扩展:\n  a_x_i^n ∈ {0, 1, ..., -1(不分区), A_irr(不规则)}\n\nMoE 算子的分区约束 (F_Z):\n  - all-to-all + expert:   接受常规分区 (当 range 仅覆盖 all-to-all+expert)\n                            或 A_irr (当 range 扩展到 non-MoE 计算)\n  - MoE gather:            只接受 A_irr 输入\n                            (capacity 分区导致 output token 位置不规则)\n  - 可分区的 gating:        输入 batch-partitioned → 输出 A_irr-partitioned\n\nCSP 求解: find a s.t. ∧_i F_Z^{f^i} ∧ ∧_D (a_y_j^i = a_x_l^k)\n```\n\n**注解**：A_irr 标注的价值在于让编译器在 IR 层面区分 \"可直接 partition 的常规算子\" 和 \"需通过 all-to-all 处理不规则数据分布的 MoE 算子\"，从而正确插入 pipeline 同步点和通信原语。\n\n---\n\n## 2. DiT (Diffusion Transformer) 模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n### 2.1 High-level IR：StableHLO while op 对 Denoising Loop 的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Symbolic Data Property Propagation for Diffusion Pipelines（扩散管道的符号化数据属性传播）.md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md` (score: 262.0)\n\nDiT 模型的迭代 denoising 过程在 StableHLO IR 中通过 **`while` op** 包裹单步 noise prediction + scheduler step 来表达，而 Difflow 编译器通过 **符号化数据属性传播** 推导 loop 内各算子的冗余特性。\n\n**编译流程模拟 —— DiT Denoising Loop 的 IR 转换链**：\n\n```\nStep 1: 模型定义 → StableHLO IR\n  Python (diffusers/DiT model)\n    ↓ JAX jit / TF to_static\n  StableHLO IR\n\n  DiT 核心 IR 结构:\n    %init = stablehlo.constant {value = dense<noise>} : tensor<NxCxHxW>\n    %timestep = stablehlo.constant {value = dense<T>} : tensor<i32>\n\n    // denoising loop\n    %result = stablehlo.while(%iter = %c0, %latent = %init) {\n      // cond: iter < num_steps\n      stablehlo.condition(%iter, %latent) -> (stablehlo.compare LT %iter, %num_steps)\n    } do {\n      // body: 单步 denoising\n      %t_emb = stablehlo.broadcast_in_dim %timestep ...\n      %t_emb = stablehlo.sine %t_emb                        // timestep embedding\n\n      // DiT Block (每步的 Transformer 计算)\n      %x = stablehlo.concatenate %latent, %t_emb\n      %attn_out = stablehlo.custom_call @self_attention(%x)  // AdaLN + MHA\n      %ffn_out = stablehlo.custom_call @ffn(%attn_out)       // AdaLN + FFN\n      %latent_new = stablehlo.add %x, %ffn_out              // residual\n\n      // Scheduler step (DDPM/DDIM update)\n      %noise_pred = stablehlo.custom_call @noise_pred(%latent_new)\n      %latent_next = stablehlo.custom_call @scheduler(%latent_new, %noise_pred, %timestep)\n\n      %iter_next = stablehlo.add %iter, %c1\n      stablehlo.yield %iter_next, %latent_next\n    }\n\nStep 2: Difflow 符号化属性传播 (Difflow compiler)\n  对 while body 内各 op 进行 redundancy vector 传播:\n    %t_emb: redundancy = [T, F, F, F]    // timestep 固定，但 embedding 维度不可复用\n    %cond:  redundancy = [T, F, F, F]    // 条件 image 在各 timestep 可能相同\n    %latent:  redundancy = [F, F, F, F]   // latent 每步变化\n\n  传播到 DiT block:\n    Conv/MHA op: 当 condition 冗余时，某些 K/V projection 可跨 step 复用\n    FFN op:      始终 non-redundant (latent 每步变化)\n\nStep 3: dGraph Decomposition (Difflow)\n  按 redundancy expression 相同性将 while body 分解为 dGraphs:\n    dGraph_A: condition 相关计算 (跨 step 可复用)\n    dGraph_B: latent 相关计算 (每步必须重算)\n    dGraph_C: scheduler step (每步必须重算，依赖 noise_pred)\n\nStep 4: dEngine Compilation → CUDA Graph\n  编译时枚举 dGraph 可能的输入属性组合 → 生成多个优化 kernel 变体\n  运行时根据实际输入属性选择最优变体\n```\n\n**StableHLO while op 的并发标注**：\n\n```mlir\n// StableHLO while body 内部: 标注可并行的算子\n%while_body = {\n  // timestep-conditioned 计算 —— cross-timestep 依赖在 SSA 中体现为 while loop carried values\n  // step-internal 并发: noise prediction 和 scheduler step 内的 attention heads 可并行\n  ^bb0(%iter: tensor<i32>, %latent: tensor<NxCxHxW>):\n    // 多个 attention head 的 Q/K/V projection 可标注并行\n    %qkv = stablehlo.custom_call @mha_qkv_proj(%latent)\n      {backend_config = {concurrent = true, num_heads = 16}}\n    ...\n    stablehlo.yield %iter_next, %latent_next : tensor<i32>, tensor<NxCxHxW>\n}\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **变量含义**：`redundancy vector = [a1, a2, a3, a4]` 为 per-dimension boolean，T=该维度数据跨请求不变（可缓存），F=每请求变化；`dGraph` 为共享相同优化条件的连续算子子图\n- **复杂度分析**：Symbolic propagation 以 topological order 遍历全图一次（O(|V|+|E|)），loop unrolling 到 stabilization（diffusion loop 不嵌套，通常 ≤5 步收敛）\n- **数据依赖**：while loop 的 cross-iteration 依赖通过 SSA 的 loop carried values 显式表达——编译器清楚识别哪些值跨迭代传递、哪些仅在迭代内使用\n- **并发可行性**：同一 denoising step 内的 multi-head attention（16 个 head 的 QKV 计算）可并行；不同 denoising step 间由于 SSA 依赖（latent_t → latent_{t+1}）必须串行\n- **笔记未明确说明**：XLA HLO 的 `while` op 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 loop body 内部的异步执行；Difflow 的实验评估仅在 NVIDIA L40S 上验证\n\n### 2.2 Low-level IR：Triton IR 对 DiT Attention 的 Block-level 表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton (GPU Kernel Language and Compiler).md` (text-match)\n\nDiT 的 attention 计算在 Triton IR (TTIR → TTGIR) 中通过 block-level tiling 表达，TTIR 保留 block 级的并行语义：\n\n```\nPython (DiT attention, triton.jit)\n    ↓ Triton Frontend\nTTIR (Triton Intermediate Representation)\n  - tl.load/tl.store → tt.load/tt.store (block-level memory ops)\n  - tl.dot → tt.dot (block-level tensor core ops, 保留 MMA layout 信息)\n  - program_id(axis) → 表达沿 grid 的并行（多个 program instance 可并发）\n    ↓ MLIR Optimizations (layout conversion, loop unrolling)\nTTGIR (Triton GPU IR, thread-level)\n  - block 分解为 warp/thread 指令\n  - shared memory allocation 显式化\n  - async copy (cp.async) 插入\n    ↓ GPU-specific lowering\nLLVM IR → PTX → cuModule\n```\n\n**注解**：Triton IR 的 `program_id` 原语天然支持微算子并发——沿 grid axis 的每个 program instance 独立执行，由 GPU warp scheduler 在 SM 上动态调度。DiT 的多 head attention 可通过在 H 维度拆分 grid 实现并发。\n\n---\n\n## 3. 多模态模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n### 3.1 High-level IR：MLIR 多 dialect 对异构编码器并行的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md` (score: 262.0)\n\n多模态模型（如视觉-语言模型）包含两个异构编码器，在 MLIR 中通过 **独立的 `func.func`** 在 IR 顶层表达并行，通过 **跨模态 fusion layer** 建立数据流连接。\n\n**编译流程模拟 —— 多模态模型 IR 的并行结构**：\n\n```\nStep 1: 多模态模型 → MLIR IR (多 dialect)\n\n// === 顶层: 两个独立 func.func，编译器识别无数据依赖 → 可并行执行 ===\nmodule {\n  // Vision Encoder (ViT ResNet-style)\n  func.func @vision_encoder(%image: tensor<Bx3x224x224xf32>)\n      -> tensor<BxNxDxf32> {\n    // ViT blocks: PatchEmbed → Transformer Encoder\n    %patches = \"vision.patch_embed\"(%image) {patch_size = 16}\n    %v_feat = \"vision.transformer\"(%patches) {depth = 12, heads = 12}\n    return %v_feat : tensor<BxNxDxf32>\n  }\n\n  // Text Encoder (BERT/LLM)\n  func.func @text_encoder(%tokens: tensor<BxLxi32>)\n      -> tensor<BxLxDxf32> {\n    %embeds = \"text.token_embed\"(%tokens)\n    %t_feat = \"text.transformer\"(%embeds) {depth = 12, heads = 12}\n    return %t_feat : tensor<BxLxDxf32>\n  }\n\n  // === Fusion Layer: Cross-Attention (建立跨模态数据流) ===\n  func.func @cross_modal_fusion(%v: tensor<BxNxDxf32>, %t: tensor<BxLxDxf32>)\n      -> tensor<BxLxDxf32> {\n    // Q from text, K/V from vision\n    %q = linalg.matmul ins(%t, %w_q) ...\n    %k = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_k) ...\n    %v_proj = linalg.matmul ins(%v, %w_v) ...\n\n    // Cross-Attention (单个融合层，不可并行于自身)\n    %attn = \"torch.cross_attention\"(%q, %k, %v_proj)\n      {num_heads = 12, causal = false}\n\n    // Gated Fusion\n    %gate = linalg.matmul ins(%t, %w_gate) ...   // 文本特征计算 gating 值\n    %gate = stablehlo.sigmoid %gate\n    %fused = arith.add %t,\n      arith.mul %gate, %attn   // t = t + gate * cross_attn(t, v)\n    return %fused : tensor<BxLxDxf32>\n  }\n\n  // LLM Decoder (后续自回归层)\n  func.func @llm_decoder(%fused: tensor<BxLxDxf32>) -> tensor<BxLxVxf32> {\n    ...\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Step 2: MLIR Pass Pipeline 中的并行发现与调度**：\n\n```\nMLIR 多 dialect 编译 passes:\n  1. Inline: vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 互不依赖 → 标记为 parallel region\n  2. async.execute wrapping:\n       %tok_v = async.execute { call @vision_encoder(%img) }\n       %tok_t = async.execute { call @text_encoder(%tokens) }\n       // 两个 async.execute 可并发发射到不同 GPU stream\n  3. async.await: 等待两者完成 → cross_modal_fusion 获取两者输出\n  4. gpu-kernel-outlining: 将 vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 分别提取为 GPU kernel\n  5. gpu-map-parallel-loops: 映射到 GPU 线程层次\n  6. convert-to-nvvm / convert-to-rocm: lowering 到具体硬件 ISA\n```\n\n**Step 3: Fusion Layer Cross-Attention 的 IR 数据流表达**：\n\n```mlir\n// Cross-Attention 的 SSA 数据流: 显式表达跨模态依赖\nfunc.func @cross_modal_fusion(%v: memref<BxNxDxf32>, %t: memref<BxLxDxf32>)\n    -> memref<BxLxDxf32> {\n  // SSA use-def chain 跨 modality:\n  // vision tokens (v) → K/V projection → cross-attention\n  // text tokens (t)   → Q projection   → cross-attention\n  // cross-attention   → gated add      → text tokens (updated)\n  // 依赖方向: v → attn_out, t → attn_out, attn_out → t_new\n  // 编译器从 SSA 图自动推导: v 和 t 的 encoding 无依赖 → 可并行\n}\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **数据结构**：`func.func` 的 call graph 编码了并行机会——两个无相互调用的 `func.func`（vision_encoder 和 text_encoder）可完全并行执行；cross_modal_fusion 对两者结果有 SSA use → 编译器自动插入 `async.await` 同步\n- **并发粒度**：MLIR 的 `async` dialect 支持两种并发粒度：(1) 粗粒度——整个 encoder 作为单个 async 任务；(2) 细粒度——encoder 内部各 layer 也可进一步 async.execute\n- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**：`async.execute` 生成的代码在运行时通过 async runtime 调度——对于 GPU，每个 async 任务映射到独立的 CUDA stream，由 GPU 硬件 MPS/MIG 实现真正的并发执行\n- **笔记未明确说明**：MLIR 的 `async` dialect 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 vision_encoder 和 text_encoder 同时执行时 shared memory 和 register file 的动态划分\n\n### 3.2 High-level IR：MMDiT 的\"共享 Attention + 独立 FFN\"在 IR 中的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md` (score: 262.0)\n\nMMDiT 在 IR 中表达为：**共享 self-attention 算子（跨模态 concat 输入） + 独立 FFN 分支（模态特定权重）**：\n\n```\nIR 层次 MMDiT Block:\n  h_text, h_video = inputs\n\n  // 共享 Self-Attention: 文本和视频 token 拼接后统一计算\n  h_combined = concat(norm_text(h_text), norm_video(h_video))   // [B, L_t+L_v, D]\n  attn_out = self_attn(h_combined)                              // 单一算子\n  attn_text, attn_video = split(attn_out)                       // 拆回两分支\n\n  // 独立 FFN (两分支并行): 使用各自独立的权重参数\n  h_text  = h_text + attn_text + ffn_text(norm(h_text))      // 分支 A\n  h_video = h_video + attn_video + ffn_video(norm(h_video))  // 分支 B (与 A 无数据依赖)\n\n  // 编译器可发现分叉后两个 FFN 无依赖 → 并行发射\n```\n\n**注解**：MMDiT 的 IR 设计体现了一种重要模式——**并发在分叉处自然出现**。SSA 图中的 fork（shared attention → split → 两个独立 FFN 分支）向编译器明确传达了并行机会，无需额外 annotation。\n\n---\n\n## 4. Video 模型的编译 IR 表示\n\n### 4.1 High-level IR：GSPMD shard_map/pmap 对帧级并行的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md` (text-match)\n\nVideo 模型的帧级并行在 XLA/GSPMD 编译栈中通过 **`shard_map` annotation** 和 **spatial partitioning** 在 IR 中表达。关键 IR 机制是将时间维度（T）作为可 shard 的维度，编译器自动推导跨帧的依赖关系和通信需求。\n\n**编译流程模拟 —— Video 模型帧级并行的 IR 表达**：\n\n```\nStep 1: 单设备 Video 模型 → StableHLO IR\n  Video DiT / UNet 计算图:\n    input: [B, T, C, H, W]   // T = 帧数, 可沿 T 维度 partition\n    ops: temporal_attn(Q,K,V over T), spatial_attn(Q,K,V over H×W), 3D conv\n\nStep 2: 用户 shard_map annotation (JAX 风格)\n  mesh = Mesh(devices.reshape(1, 4), ('spatial', 'temporal'))\n  # 沿 temporal 维度将 T=16 帧 partition 到 4 个 devices\n\n  @shard_map(mesh=mesh, in_specs=(P('spatial', 'temporal'),),\n             out_specs=P('spatial', 'temporal'))\n  def video_temporal_block(x):\n      # x 在每 device 上的 local shape: [B, T/4, C, H, W]\n      # temporal attention 需要跨帧通信: 沿 temporal 轴的 all-gather\n      x_full_t = all_gather(x, axis='temporal')   // 暂时收集全帧 → [B, T, C, H, W]\n      attn_out = temporal_self_attn(x_full_t)      // 全帧 attention\n      return attn_out   // 输出按原 sharding 分布\n\nStep 3: GSPMD Sharding Propagation\n  编译器从 shard_map annotation 推导:\n    - temporal_attn: 输入需要全帧 → 插入 all-gather (temporal 维度)\n    - spatial_attn:  每帧独立的 2D attention → 无跨帧依赖 → 无需通信\n    - 3D conv:       kernel 跨帧 → 插入 halo exchange (temporal 维度)\n    - FFN/layer_norm: 逐帧操作 → 无通信\n\n  IR 中的通信标注 (类似 HLO):\n    %full_frames = all-gather(%local_frames, dimensions=[1])  // dim=1 是 temporal\n    %t_attn = custom-call @temporal_attn(%full_frames)\n    %s_attn = custom-call @spatial_attn(%t_attn)            // 无通信\n    %out = custom-call @temporal_conv(%s_attn)  // 自动插入 halo exchange\n\nStep 4: PMap 语义的 SPMD codegen\n  pmap 等价于沿指定轴的 SPMD partition:\n    pmap(fn, axis='temporal')(video_frames)\n  = GSPMD partition(video_frames, mesh, {temporal: 4})\n  → 每个 device 获得 T/4 帧 → 编译生成包含 all-gather 的 SPMD 程序\n```\n\n**SSA 图中跨帧依赖的链接方式**：\n\n```\n帧级并行 SSA 依赖分析:\n  Frame 0: [op_0_0] → [op_0_1] → [op_0_2] → ...   (帧内: 串行 SSA use-def)\n  Frame 1: [op_1_0] → [op_1_1] → [op_1_2] → ...\n  ...\n  Frame T: [op_T_0] → [op_T_1] → [op_T_2] → ...\n\n  跨帧依赖 (temporal attention):\n    op_t_k (frame t, layer k) dependson:\n      op_t_{k-1}         (帧内依赖)\n      op_{t-1}_k         (帧间依赖, temporal attention 的 KV)\n      op_{t+1}_k         (帧间依赖, 双向 attention)\n\n  IR 中的跨帧边: 从 op_{t-1}_k 到 op_t_k 的 SSA edge 在 partition 后变为\n    跨 device 的 all-gather/reduce-scatter collective\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **变量含义**：`shard_map` 是 JAX 的 SPMD annotation 原语，指定 mesh（设备拓扑）和 in_specs/out_specs（tensor 的 sharding 方式）；`P('spatial', 'temporal')` 表示沿第一维（spatial）不 partition，沿第二维（temporal）partition\n- **复杂度分析**：帧级并行的通信量 = temporal attention 层的 all-gather 量 = O(T × H × W × C) per attention layer；spatial attention 层无跨帧通信 = O(0)\n- **数据依赖**：temporal attention 产生跨帧依赖——SSA 图中表示为从 device i（持有帧 f_i）到 device j（持有帧 f_j）的 data edge；GSPMD 将其编译为 collective permute 或 all-gather\n- **并发可行性**：帧内 spatial attention 可完全并行（每帧独立）；temporal attention 需要 all-gather 同步——通信与 spatial attention 的计算可 overlap（异步 pipeline）\n- **笔记未明确说明**：XLA 的 pmap/shard_map 在 GPU 上是否支持 temporal attention 的通信与 spatial attention 的计算自动 overlap；GSPMD 论文报告了 TPU 上的结果\n\n### 4.2 Low-level IR：WELDER Hierarchical Tile-Graph 对 Video UNet 的表达\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Hierarchical Tile-Graph (WELDER).md` (text-match)；`knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Inter-Layer Independence (WELDER).md` (text-match)\n\nVideo 模型中常用的 UNet 架构在 WELDER 编译器中通过 **Hierarchical Tile-Graph** 表达——将完整的 DNN graph 递归分解为多层 tile-graph，支持跨 host+device memory 的 tile-based streaming：\n\n```\nWELDER Tile-Graph 对 Video UNet (8k×8k 输入) 的编译:\n\nL0 (完整 graph):\n  Video UNet: [Conv3D → ResBlock → DownSample → ... → UpSample → Conv3D]\n\nL1 (sub-graph by connectivity):\n  Encoder:     Conv → BN → ReLU → MaxPool  (tile-graph A)\n  Bottleneck:  Conv → BN → ReLU             (tile-graph B)\n  Decoder:     UpSample → Conv → BN → ReLU  (tile-graph C)\n\nL2 (进一步分裂):\n  Conv → BN → ReLU 子图内部:\n    Conv_tile  → BN_tile  → ReLU_tile\n    (每个 tile 链接通过 SetConnect 建立内存层次: Reg→Shared→Global→Host)\n\nExecuteGraph 递归展开:\n  for node in g.nodes():\n    if level == top: ComputeTile(node)\n    else: ExecuteGraph(node.TileGraph(), level+1)\n\nInter-Layer Independence:\n  L0 (Register):  优化 Conv+ReLU register tile → 最小化 L1→L0 traffic\n  L1 (SharedMem): 优化 (Conv+ReLU)+MaxPool shared memory tile → 最小化 L2→L1 traffic\n  改变 L0 配置不影响 L1 traffic → 两层独立优化\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **Tile 约束**：每层 tile 的 shared memory 需求之和 ≤ SM shared memory capacity（A100: 192 KB/SM）；大输入（8k×8k video frame）通过 tile-based streaming 跨 host+device memory 处理\n- **CTA 分配**：Tile-graph 的递归展开自动决定各 sub-graph 的 Block/ThreadIdx 映射（Block/ThreadIdx Remapping pass）\n- **并发可行性**：Inter-Layer Independence 意味着不同 sub-graph 的 tile 配置可并行搜索和编译；同一 memory level 内的不同 sub-graph 可分配到不同 SM 并发执行\n\n---\n\n## 5. 多算子并发在 IR 中的通用表达能力\n\n### 5.1 Event-Based IR：显式异步依赖建模\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Event-Based Intermediate Representation.md` (text-match)\n\nCypress 编译器的 Event-Based IR 提供了最精细的异步并发 IR 建模——每个异步操作产生 event，每个操作声明 precondition events，SSA 形式确保任何有效排序满足所有依赖。\n\n```\nEvent-Based IR 并发建模 (Cypress):\n\n// 异步操作 = (output_event, precondition_events, operation)\ne1: [(N, WARP)] = pfor i in [0, N) do\n  e2: [(M, THREAD)] = pfor j in [0, M) do\n    e3: () = call(compute_kernel, tile[i,j]), precondition={}\n    yield e3                       // point-wise event\n  e4: () = copy(result, output[i]), precondition={e2[:]}  // all threads done\n  yield e4\n\n// 关键并发原语:\n// - event 数组 [(N, WARP)]: N 个并行 event，每个对应一个 warp 迭代\n// - broadcast [:] 索引: 等待所有并行迭代完成\n// - copy/precondition: 异步 copy 操作仅等待其数据生产者\n\n// Event → Hardware Sync Lowering:\n//   ():         → no sync (SSA guarantees ordering)\n//   (WARP):     → __syncwarp\n//   (THREAD):   → __syncwarp / __threadfence_block\n//   (CTA):      → __syncthreads / named barrier\n//   TMA events  → mbarrier (Hopper)\n//   MMA events  → warpgroup sync assembly\n```\n\n**注解**：Event-Based IR 的核心价值在于将硬件同步原语（`__syncwarp`、`mbarrier`、`warpgroup sync`）的插入从手写 CUDA 中提升到编译器 IR 层面——编译器自动根据 event 依赖选择最轻量的同步原语。\n\n### 5.2 Stream Scheduler IR：编译时 Kernel-to-Stream 并发\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Stream Scheduler (Compile-Time Kernel-to-Stream Assignment).md` (text-match)\n\nHuntKTm 的 Stream Scheduler 展示了如何在 host IR 层面表达多 kernel 并发——通过 LLVM pass 分析 DFG、分层、分配 stream、生成最小同步集：\n\n```\n编译时 Stream 并发 IR 转换:\n\nInput: 串行 CUDA kernel launch 序列\n  kernel_1(args, writable=[0,1])\n  kernel_2(args, writable=[0])\n  kernel_3(args, writable=[1])\n  kernel_4(args, writable=[0,1])\n\n↓ DFG Constructor (LLVM pass)\n\nDFG:\n  k1 → k2 (RAW on arg 0)      k1 → k3 (RAW on arg 1)\n  k2 → k4 (RAW on arg 0)      k3 → k4 (WAR on arg 1)\n\n↓ Kernel Distributor (levelization)\n\nLevel 0: {k1}        (no predecessors)\nLevel 1: {k2, k3}    (k2,k3 both depend only on k1 → mutually independent)\nLevel 2: {k4}        (depends on both k2,k3)\n\n↓ Stream Assignment\n\nStream 0: k1 → k2 → k4\nStream 1: k3 (并发于 k2)\n\n↓ Synchronization Generator\n\nStream 0: k1 → k2 → k4  (intra-stream implicit ordering)\nStream 1: k3\nSync: k3 等待 k1 完成; k4 等待 k3 完成\nRedundant sync 剪除: k3→k4 sync 可通过 k2→k4 的 arg 依赖传递性地满足\n```\n\n**注解**：Stream Scheduler 的 IR 转换展示了编译时并发提取的完整链路——DFG 分析→分层→分配→同步生成。与运行时并发（如 CUDA Graph 的动态依赖）不同，编译时方案可看到全局 DFG，从而更激进地消除冗余同步。\n\n---\n\n## 6. 跨框架 IR 对比总结\n\n### 6.1 IR 并发表达能力矩阵\n\n| IR 系统 | 并发标注方式 | 异步语义 | 硬件拓扑感知 | 多算子并发支持 | 笔记证据 |\n|---------|-------------|----------|-------------|---------------|---------|\n| **XLA HLO / StableHLO** | `shard_map`/`pmap` annotation + GSPMD collective ops | `async` 变体 of all-to-all/all-reduce | device mesh (2D/3D torus for TPU) | SPMD-level 并发；GSPMD auto-placement | GSPMD note |\n| **MLIR (gpu+async+scf)** | `scf.forall` / `async.execute` / `gpu.launch` | `async.execute` + `async.await` 显式异步 | 通过 gpu dialect 映射到 thread hierarchy | dialect-level 并发；需 pass pipeline 组合 | MLIR note, Event-Based IR note |\n| **Triton IR (TTIR/TTGIR)** | `program_id` 沿 grid axis 的并行 | 单 kernel 内 tile 级并发 | 间接：通过 grid/block 配置反映硬件 | 单 kernel 内微算子并发；跨 kernel 需外部调度 | Triton note |\n| **TVM Relay / TensorIR** | `parallel` axis / `block` buffer annotation | 有限的异步支持（需手动 scheduling） | 通过 target-specific scheduling | AutoScheduler 搜索式并发 | Tile-Based Zero-Tuning note |\n| **Torch FX Graph → Inductor IR** | FX graph node parallelism | Triton backend 的 multi-kernel codegen | 通过 Triton Autotuner 间接建模 | TorchInductor multi-kernel 发射 | （笔记推断 — Triton note 的扩展） |\n| **Event-Based IR (Cypress)** | event/precondition SSA 对 | event 数组 + broadcast 索引 | WARP/THREAD/CTA 粒度映射 | 最精细的异步并发建模 | Event-Based IR note |\n| **Scale-Free IR (Diffuse)** | index task 隐式并行 | task fusion 后的 MLIR kernel fusion | partition 的隐式映射公式 (与 processor 数无关) | 分布式 task 级并发 | Scale-Free IR note |\n| **CANN GE IR (Ascend NPU)** | GE engine 图编译 | 限于 GE fusion + IRFusion | Da Vinci Cube/Vector 单元感知 | 单指令流内微算子并发（ILP） | CANN note, MindSpore note |\n\n### 6.2 硬件平台对 IR 并发支持的差异\n\n| 硬件平台 | IR 并发模型 | 并发原语在 IR 中的表达 | 编译 vs 运行时并发 |\n|---------|------------|----------------------|-------------------|\n| **NVIDIA GPU** | 动态并发（MPS/MIG/CUDA stream） | `gpu.launch` + `async.execute` → 多条 CUDA stream | 编译时分配 stream + 同步点插入，运行时 GPU warp scheduler 调度 |\n| **Google TPU** | 编译时静态 SPMD | XLA `shard_map` + `collective-permute` | 完全编译时决定——SPMD program 在所有 core 上同步执行 |\n| **Ascend NPU** | 单指令流 + 脉动阵列 | CANN GE IR → Da Vinci 指令流 | 编译时 operator fusion + tiling，运行时固定数据流 |\n| **Groq LPU** | 确定性静态调度 | Groq Compiler IR → spatial mapping | 完全编译时——无运行时调度器，算子直接映射到芯片单元 |\n| **Cerebras CS-3** | Dataflow 编译 | Dataflow graph → wafer-scale mapping | 编译时将计算图映射为晶圆级 dataflow |\n\n---\n\n## 方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| **GSPMD SPMD Partition** | Sharding annotation 传播 + collective insertion | XLA (JAX/TF) | TPU v3/v4/v5, GPU | 2048 TPUv3 上 50-62% compute utilization；<1% tensor 需标注 | GSPMD note |\n| **MLIR Dialect Ladder** | 多 dialect progressive lowering: Linalg→Affine→GPU→LLVM | MLIR + IREE/OpenXLA | GPU (CUDA/ROCm/Vulkan) | Dialect 数量>20；社区 passes 复用；类型安全 memref | MLIR note |\n| **Triton Block-level IR** | Block-level tiling → TTIR → TTGIR → LLVM IR → PTX | Triton Compiler | NVIDIA GPU (sm_70+), AMD CDNA3/4 | 比 CUDA 开发效率高 3-5×；autotuner 自动探索 >20 配置 | Triton note |\n| **Cypress Event-Based IR** | SSA 形式 event + precondition → 硬件同步 lowering | Cypress (MLIR-based) | NVIDIA GPU (Hopper TMA) | Event 数组支持 WARP/THREAD/CTA broadcast；编译时消除→零运行时开销 | Event-Based IR note |\n| **Difflow Symbolic Propagation** | Boolean redundancy vector propagation + dGraph decomposition | Difflow | NVIDIA L40S | Loop unrolling ≤5 steps 收敛；redundancy-aware kernel 选择 | Symbolic Data Property note |\n| **Lancet Partition Axis Inference** | CSP 求解分区轴 + A_irr (MoE 不规则标注) | Lancet (RAF compiler, OR-Tools CP-SAT) | NVIDIA GPU (A100/H100) | Static-shape approximation 误差仅 3.83%；DP 自动决策最优 (i,n,k) | Partition Axis Inference note |\n| **WELDER Tile-Graph** | 多层 tile-graph 递归 + Inter-Layer Independence | WELDER (TIR-based) | NVIDIA GPU, ROCm GPU, GraphCore IPU | 支持 8k×8k UNet 输入 (host memory streaming) | Hierarchical Tile-Graph note |\n| **HuntKTm Stream Scheduler** | DFG levelization + stream assignment + 同步剪除 | LLVM Pass | NVIDIA GPU (CUDA stream) | 编译时间 +0.99s；用户仅需 ~15 LoC 标注 | Stream Scheduler note |\n| **CANN GE Graph Compiler** | MindSpore IR → GE engine → Ascend 指令流 | CANN (Huawei) | Ascend 910B/310P | LocMoE 在 32 Ascend 910A 上验证；支持 GE fusion + IRFusion | CANN note |\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **StableHLO while op 的 GPU 异步支持**：笔记未明确说明 XLA 的 `while` op 在 GPU backend 上是否支持 loop body 内部的异步执行和算子并发——这主要来自 Web 知识推断\n2. **Video 模型帧级并发的实际编译实现**：笔记主要覆盖 GSPMD 的一般机制和 WELDER 的 tile-graph，针对 Video-specific（如 temporal attention 的 communication-computation overlap 自动生成）在 vault 中缺乏直接论文笔记\n3. **多模态模型在 NPU 上的 IR 表达**：CANN note 覆盖了 MindSpore + Ascend 的一般编译流程，但多模态异构编码器在 NPU 上的 IR 并发表达无直接笔记证据\n4. **MLIR async dialect 的 GPU multi-stream 并发成熟度**：笔记显示 async dialect 被用于 PIM 编译和 Diffuse 分布式场景，但其在单 GPU 上生成真正 concurrent kernel execution 的状态未在笔记中明确\n5. **DiT denoising loop 的 cross-timestep 依赖优化**：Difflow note 覆盖了 redundancy 分析和 dGraph decomposition，但跨 timestep 的 KV cache 复用等高级优化在 vault 中无直接笔记\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L3-Q3.1\n","userModified":false}}
